(1696784, 229729, 41522, '<td valign="top">A very interesting image.  The visual weight is almost exclusively the eyes.  For me, and I have to think that negative response is what you may be expecting, the high key is so strong that there is nothing to look at except the eyes.  The image becomes static for me because there is nothing else to explore in the image.  Kudos for trying something original, and without having seen all the images yet, I bet yours will be one of the most unique.  JMO.</td>', 'A very interesting image.  The visual weight is almost exclusively the eyes.  For me, and I have to think that negative response is what you may be expecting, the high key is so strong that there is nothing to look at except the eyes.  The image becomes static for me because there is nothing else to explore in the image.  Kudos for trying something original, and without having seen all the images yet, I bet yours will be one of the most unique.  JMO.', '2005-09-12 01:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1696786, 229004, 42826, '<td valign="top">very nice...ballerinas rock!</td>', 'very nice...ballerinas rock!', '2005-09-12 01:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1696789, 229122, 24073, '<td valign="top">There is really nothing to work with here.  Your colors are all neutral, there is no shadows, the light is moderate, and the depth and clarity are so-so.  The model here is pretty, but expressionless. I hope this comment helps.  GL.</td>', 'There is really nothing to work with here.  Your colors are all neutral, there is no shadows, the light is moderate, and the depth and clarity are so-so.  The model here is pretty, but expressionless. I hope this comment helps.  GL.', '2005-09-12 01:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
