(1697153, 230356, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture.  Beautiful girl.  Very nice color balance.  One thing...probably should have cleaned the cob web out of the post.</td>', 'Very nice picture.  Beautiful girl.  Very nice color balance.  One thing...probably should have cleaned the cob web out of the post.', '2005-09-12 02:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
