(1697162, 230374, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful start.  The eyes and lips are wonderful.  I think some post editing work would really put this in a class by itself.  I''d clone out the blemish to the left side of her nose and maybe soften it up ever so much overall.  I''d probably clone out the pink of her shirt as well, since it really doesn''t add to the overall appeal of the shot. She''s a lovely girl!!</td>', 'This is a wonderful start.  The eyes and lips are wonderful.  I think some post editing work would really put this in a class by itself.  I''d clone out the blemish to the left side of her nose and maybe soften it up ever so much overall.  I''d probably clone out the pink of her shirt as well, since it really doesn''t add to the overall appeal of the shot. She''s a lovely girl!!', '2005-09-12 02:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1697163, 229724, 41522, '<td valign="top">Great expresion ... overall a very nice shot.  Looks like a character.</td>', 'Great expresion ... overall a very nice shot.  Looks like a character.', '2005-09-12 02:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1697165, 228781, 24073, '<td valign="top">the eyes look to exaggerated.  But I still like the photo well enough for the top half so far.  I may be back to bump this one, be patient with me I''ve only just started voting.</td>', 'the eyes look to exaggerated.  But I still like the photo well enough for the top half so far.  I may be back to bump this one, be patient with me I''ve only just started voting.', '2005-09-12 02:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
