(1697170, 230082, 34763, '<td valign="top">Over did the neat image to the forehead and made his hair look blurred. It also looks like you tried to sharpen it after the smoothing, especially on the edge. Great look, model and pose, just a little too unnatural.</td>', 'Over did the neat image to the forehead and made his hair look blurred. It also looks like you tried to sharpen it after the smoothing, especially on the edge. Great look, model and pose, just a little too unnatural.', '2005-09-12 02:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1697171, 230145, 28882, '<td valign="top">first thing I noticed was that her breasts look like they are setting on the frame of the pic.  I think the cropping should be either higher or lower..and the lighting of the woman seems different than the background.  It makes the background look like a poster.</td>', 'first thing I noticed was that her breasts look like they are setting on the frame of the pic.  I think the cropping should be either higher or lower..and the lighting of the woman seems different than the background.  It makes the background look like a poster.', '2005-09-12 02:12:08.000000', NULL, 1);
