(1697202, 229325, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great job.  Bet the blue ink was a tasty beverage. I hope you chased it down with a nice cold one!!!  Very interesting perspective.  I have no idea how you did this.  The colors are great and considering you''re under water, it is amazingly clear.  Imagination at it''s best. 10!!!</td>', 'Great job.  Bet the blue ink was a tasty beverage. I hope you chased it down with a nice cold one!!!  Very interesting perspective.  I have no idea how you did this.  The colors are great and considering you''re under water, it is amazingly clear.  Imagination at it''s best. 10!!!', '2005-09-12 02:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
