(1697629, 227475, 1796, '<td valign="top">a bit too much blur (in post processing?), especially on the arm, not so sure about the face - the hair looks great, natural texture. Too much of a "mall studio portrait" for my taste. The background works very well, but the kid''s too soft  -  he''s a great looking boy! no need to "polish" him this way.<br/> <br/>Otherwise: good lighting, nice expression and pose. The T-shirt''s color seems a little overwhelming. Different color (not solid, brighter?) or different crop (same width, cut off the bottom and make it square?) might have helped.<br/> <br/>As is, a 6. Could have been a 7, at least .</td>', 'a bit too much blur (in post processing?), especially on the arm, not so sure about the face - the hair looks great, natural texture. Too much of a "mall studio portrait" for my taste. The background works very well, but the kid''s too soft  -  he''s a great looking boy! no need to "polish" him this way. Otherwise: good lighting, nice expression and pose. The T-shirt''s color seems a little overwhelming. Different color (not solid, brighter?) or different crop (same width, cut off the bottom and make it square?) might have helped. As is, a 6. Could have been a 7, at least .', '2005-09-12 03:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
