(1698207, 230272, 28963, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the available light. SHould have toned down the reds thuogh afterwards. 5</td>', 'Nice job with the available light. SHould have toned down the reds thuogh afterwards. 5', '2005-09-12 09:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698208, 230154, 8292, '<td valign="top">ehe :) I like his facial expression.</td>', 'ehe :) I like his facial expression.', '2005-09-12 09:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698211, 227656, 15711, '<td valign="top">Of all the baby shots, this is the only one that is a true portrait in my eyes.  I just love  that adorable face.  The skintones are very natural, the lighting is nice and it isn''t over processed. If possible, I''d have removed the blanket on the left side, but understandably, that might not be possible.  Very sweet indeed.  Congratulations to the parents!!!</td>', 'Of all the baby shots, this is the only one that is a true portrait in my eyes.  I just love  that adorable face.  The skintones are very natural, the lighting is nice and it isn''t over processed. If possible, I''d have removed the blanket on the left side, but understandably, that might not be possible.  Very sweet indeed.  Congratulations to the parents!!!', '2005-09-12 09:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698212, 230144, 28963, '<td valign="top">Tighter crop form the botom would have worked much better for me. His face looks interesting but it''s not dominant enough.</td>', 'Tighter crop form the botom would have worked much better for me. His face looks interesting but it''s not dominant enough.', '2005-09-12 09:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698214, 230271, 28963, '<td valign="top">Funny</td>', 'Funny', '2005-09-12 09:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698215, 230055, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this very much.  It is striking and not the "typical" portrait.  The lighting is wonderful and helps add to the drama of his countenance.  I love the beard and craggy face.  Your use of negative space helps showcase his features.  I wish it were a bit tighter zoom, as I''d like to really study all of the textures of his skin. Well done.</td>', 'I like this very much.  It is striking and not the "typical" portrait.  The lighting is wonderful and helps add to the drama of his countenance.  I love the beard and craggy face.  Your use of negative space helps showcase his features.  I wish it were a bit tighter zoom, as I''d like to really study all of the textures of his skin. Well done.', '2005-09-12 09:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698217, 229772, 28963, '<td valign="top">Good messege, not so good photo.</td>', 'Good messege, not so good photo.', '2005-09-12 09:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698225, 227989, 15711, '<td valign="top">This struck me from the moment I saw it.  The fur lined hood is a wonderful frame to the face. I wish the overall size of the subject were larger so I could really study the details of the face.  Lovely eyes and beautiful creamy complexion. I like the expression of gazing out and possibly daydreaming.  Nice indeed.</td>', 'This struck me from the moment I saw it.  The fur lined hood is a wonderful frame to the face. I wish the overall size of the subject were larger so I could really study the details of the face.  Lovely eyes and beautiful creamy complexion. I like the expression of gazing out and possibly daydreaming.  Nice indeed.', '2005-09-12 09:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698230, 228910, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this alot. Her placement in the shot is well done.  The complimentary colors of her ballet gown against the similar colors of the textured walls adds to the softness of her. I wish I could see her face closer and study the details. The skin seems just a smidge overprocessed although the coloration is nice.  I know software such as Neat Image can almost plasticize skin sometimes.  The leaves on the ground add a very nice natural sense to it all. Overall - REALLY GOOD.</td>', 'I like this alot. Her placement in the shot is well done.  The complimentary colors of her ballet gown against the similar colors of the textured walls adds to the softness of her. I wish I could see her face closer and study the details. The skin seems just a smidge overprocessed although the coloration is nice.  I know software such as Neat Image can almost plasticize skin sometimes.  The leaves on the ground add a very nice natural sense to it all. Overall - REALLY GOOD.', '2005-09-12 09:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698233, 230179, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the mysterious sense of this shot.  Her eyes are stunning and not overly post edited.  I think the white light to the right is a tad blown out (for my taste at least). I wish the scarf were a solid color. The touch of pinkish red and yellow detract just a bit. Her complexion is very pretty.</td>', 'I like the mysterious sense of this shot.  Her eyes are stunning and not overly post edited.  I think the white light to the right is a tad blown out (for my taste at least). I wish the scarf were a solid color. The touch of pinkish red and yellow detract just a bit. Her complexion is very pretty.', '2005-09-12 09:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698234, 230083, 8610, '<td valign="top">outstanding job</td>', 'outstanding job', '2005-09-12 09:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698236, 230113, 41701, '<td valign="top">Brilliant!  A little too much sharpening for my taste though.</td>', 'Brilliant!  A little too much sharpening for my taste though.', '2005-09-12 09:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698238, 227597, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the coy expression.  Her cocked head adds a cuteness. Her smile is adorable. I like her hair having the windblowh sense to it. I also like that you used a landscape layout. The black background is a nice backdrop to her face and the white tee shirt. Nice skin tones as well.  Crystal clear eyes. Not too much post processing is evident.   Upon 2nd review, I''m upping my score.  Congrats on a nice capture!</td>', 'I like the coy expression.  Her cocked head adds a cuteness. Her smile is adorable. I like her hair having the windblowh sense to it. I also like that you used a landscape layout. The black background is a nice backdrop to her face and the white tee shirt. Nice skin tones as well.  Crystal clear eyes. Not too much post processing is evident.   Upon 2nd review, I''m upping my score.  Congrats on a nice capture!', '2005-09-12 09:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698239, 228347, 14656, '<td valign="top">I sense no reason for this image to be cropped to a square. Especially after centering the composition. Too much negative space on the sides.</td>', 'I sense no reason for this image to be cropped to a square. Especially after centering the composition. Too much negative space on the sides.', '2005-09-12 09:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698242, 228857, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  I feel that it''s a tad too soft for my taste.  The skin and hair appears slightly flat. I think some light on her face might help it a touch.  Her coloration is lovely and the hair against the skin is quite appealing.  Here eyes are gorgeous.</td>', 'Very pretty.  I feel that it''s a tad too soft for my taste.  The skin and hair appears slightly flat. I think some light on her face might help it a touch.  Her coloration is lovely and the hair against the skin is quite appealing.  Here eyes are gorgeous.', '2005-09-12 09:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698244, 230310, 31628, '<td valign="top">This screams Librodo.  Nice capture.</td>', 'This screams Librodo.  Nice capture.', '2005-09-12 09:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698245, 227437, 14656, '<td valign="top">This image is so noisy, it hurts my ears. The compression artifacting is unattractive as well. You may optimize your filesize up to 150kb, try to preserve the quality and integrity of the original photo.</td>', 'This image is so noisy, it hurts my ears. The compression artifacting is unattractive as well. You may optimize your filesize up to 150kb, try to preserve the quality and integrity of the original photo.', '2005-09-12 09:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
