(1698344, 229959, 11518, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, looks like a porcelain doll!  A little bit of fill flash would add a catchlight in her eyes, making her look more lively. 7</td>', 'Beautiful, looks like a porcelain doll!  A little bit of fill flash would add a catchlight in her eyes, making her look more lively. 7', '2005-09-12 10:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698346, 228826, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the overall appeal of this shot. I think it''s juts a touch too sof though.  The halo of light is almost too much and creates an overblown sense behind her. I wish she were wearing a solid top - maybe deep blue or even black or dark red. The skin color is pretty. I''d like the light to be on her face - it would illuminate her face a bit more.  As it is, the skin tones are a touch flat.  Her gaze and expression is very pleasant.</td>', 'I like the overall appeal of this shot. I think it''s juts a touch too sof though.  The halo of light is almost too much and creates an overblown sense behind her. I wish she were wearing a solid top - maybe deep blue or even black or dark red. The skin color is pretty. I''d like the light to be on her face - it would illuminate her face a bit more.  As it is, the skin tones are a touch flat.  Her gaze and expression is very pleasant.', '2005-09-12 10:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698347, 229087, 11518, '<td valign="top">Beautiful pose, great warm light.  Did you blur the face?  Looks too plastic. 6</td>', 'Beautiful pose, great warm light.  Did you blur the face?  Looks too plastic. 6', '2005-09-12 10:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698350, 229841, 11518, '<td valign="top">Get closer or crop tighter, the subject is the person, the background adds nothing to the photo.</td>', 'Get closer or crop tighter, the subject is the person, the background adds nothing to the photo.', '2005-09-12 10:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698352, 230178, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like his far off gaze, but I wish it were a touch more toward the camera, so we could see the eyes better. The beach scene with the blue hoody is a nice contrast. The skin tones are natural and there is a luminescence to his face. Overall - nicely captured.</td>', 'I like his far off gaze, but I wish it were a touch more toward the camera, so we could see the eyes better. The beach scene with the blue hoody is a nice contrast. The skin tones are natural and there is a luminescence to his face. Overall - nicely captured.', '2005-09-12 10:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698353, 230359, 14656, '<td valign="top">Wrong challenge? "Branch" was due September 6th. A portrait of a log or waterfall will not fare well against the other entries.</td>', 'Wrong challenge? "Branch" was due September 6th. A portrait of a log or waterfall will not fare well against the other entries.', '2005-09-12 10:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698357, 230114, 11518, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, great expression.  He does not look very happy...LOL 8</td>', 'Nice composition, great expression.  He does not look very happy...LOL 8', '2005-09-12 10:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698360, 229471, 14656, '<td valign="top">Great expression. I can feel the intensity in his eyes.</td>', 'Great expression. I can feel the intensity in his eyes.', '2005-09-12 10:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698361, 228810, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beautiful intense eyes.  I like the hair over the right eye. The softness might be just a touch overdone - it tends to flatten her skin tones a bit too much for my taste. The pearlescenht lip color is attractive as well. Lovely model!</td>', 'Beautiful intense eyes.  I like the hair over the right eye. The softness might be just a touch overdone - it tends to flatten her skin tones a bit too much for my taste. The pearlescenht lip color is attractive as well. Lovely model!', '2005-09-12 10:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698364, 229508, 11518, '<td valign="top">Face is too centered, the top and right side could be cropped enhancing the portrait.  Great pose and model.</td>', 'Face is too centered, the top and right side could be cropped enhancing the portrait.  Great pose and model.', '2005-09-12 10:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698365, 230231, 14656, '<td valign="top">Great post processing.</td>', 'Great post processing.', '2005-09-12 10:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698366, 229864, 11518, '<td valign="top">Nice expression and composition.</td>', 'Nice expression and composition.', '2005-09-12 10:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698367, 229795, 28801, '<td valign="top">Dont find this type of abstract too appealing - sorry</td>', 'Dont find this type of abstract too appealing - sorry', '2005-09-12 10:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698368, 229914, 40820, '<td valign="top">would have had more impact if it was sharp</td>', 'would have had more impact if it was sharp', '2005-09-12 10:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698369, 229004, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the softness of her en pointe with the tutu against the craggy concrete floor and stone wall. I wish she were  larger in the shot so I could concentrate on her pretty face. This is more of an entire body shot than what I think of as a true portrait. Still, it is very well shot and you did a good job. 7</td>', 'I like the softness of her en pointe with the tutu against the craggy concrete floor and stone wall. I wish she were  larger in the shot so I could concentrate on her pretty face. This is more of an entire body shot than what I think of as a true portrait. Still, it is very well shot and you did a good job. 7', '2005-09-12 10:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698372, 230370, 14656, '<td valign="top">No thank you..</td>', 'No thank you..', '2005-09-12 10:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698374, 230365, 11518, '<td valign="top">Out of focus.  Nice composition though.</td>', 'Out of focus.  Nice composition though.', '2005-09-12 10:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698375, 229122, 41066, '<td valign="top">Lovely eyes and very natural looking skin.</td>', 'Lovely eyes and very natural looking skin.', '2005-09-12 10:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698377, 228910, 14656, '<td valign="top">Beautiful work! One of my faves in this challenge :)</td>', 'Beautiful work! One of my faves in this challenge :)', '2005-09-12 10:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698378, 228197, 40820, '<td valign="top">this image is needs to be sharper...did you use a tripod for this shot?</td>', 'this image is needs to be sharper...did you use a tripod for this shot?', '2005-09-12 10:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698379, 230218, 28801, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp image</td>', 'Nice sharp image', '2005-09-12 10:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
