(1698416, 230101, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice natural pose.  I find that the reflection of the chess board is a bit distracting, but in another sense, it is interesting. It just detracts from his nice face a bit. The skin tones seem just a touch too yellow - maybe a little desat of yellow and an upping of a bit of red might help. Overall - nice. 7</td>', 'Nice natural pose.  I find that the reflection of the chess board is a bit distracting, but in another sense, it is interesting. It just detracts from his nice face a bit. The skin tones seem just a touch too yellow - maybe a little desat of yellow and an upping of a bit of red might help. Overall - nice. 7', '2005-09-12 10:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698417, 230341, 41066, '<td valign="top">I love how you can see the sunset in his glasses.  Very cool photograph.  Well Done! 8</td>', 'I love how you can see the sunset in his glasses.  Very cool photograph.  Well Done! 8', '2005-09-12 10:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698421, 228520, 41066, '<td valign="top">Nice Grunge Effect on this photo.  I bet this guy could tell a story or two! 8</td>', 'Nice Grunge Effect on this photo.  I bet this guy could tell a story or two! 8', '2005-09-12 10:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
