(1698436, 230149, 37005, '<td valign="top">There is a harsh flash kick in the owl''s eyesand his beak reflection.  A flash diffuser would''ve improved that "harsh" look.<br/> <br/>Otherwise a VERY cool portrait of "whooo whooo".</td>', 'There is a harsh flash kick in the owl''s eyesand his beak reflection.  A flash diffuser would''ve improved that "harsh" look. Otherwise a VERY cool portrait of "whooo whooo".', '2005-09-12 10:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
