(1698438, 230233, 41066, '<td valign="top">This looks like it could be used for the Capital One commercial! hehe.  Fabulous but scary photograph! 8</td>', 'This looks like it could be used for the Capital One commercial! hehe.  Fabulous but scary photograph! 8', '2005-09-12 10:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
