(1698444, 229673, 11518, '<td valign="top">That''s more than a bit of Irish!  Great composition, eyes are sharp and draw attention to them, no distracting background.  Well done 9</td>', 'That''s more than a bit of Irish!  Great composition, eyes are sharp and draw attention to them, no distracting background.  Well done 9', '2005-09-12 10:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698445, 228206, 42638, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful! I like tighter crops for portraits but this works well. Only the taller tree behind her take my eye off her.</td>', 'Simply beautiful! I like tighter crops for portraits but this works well. Only the taller tree behind her take my eye off her.', '2005-09-12 10:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698446, 230058, 41066, '<td valign="top">I think I would have like to have seen it a bit sharper.  Your model is stunning with gorgeous green eyes.  Nice shot overall!  6</td>', 'I think I would have like to have seen it a bit sharper.  Your model is stunning with gorgeous green eyes.  Nice shot overall!  6', '2005-09-12 10:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698448, 228884, 37005, '<td valign="top">Really a nice shot.  My only 2 issues lie with the harshness of the shadows from the flash.  One: on the hand and arm and pencil and Two: the desk and that tiny bit of shadow is distracting.  Good portraiture rids itself of harsh shadows.<br/> <br/>I do like the set up and that child looks "thrilled"  (hehe) to be doing homework.  Nice penmanship, btw.</td>', 'Really a nice shot.  My only 2 issues lie with the harshness of the shadows from the flash.  One: on the hand and arm and pencil and Two: the desk and that tiny bit of shadow is distracting.  Good portraiture rids itself of harsh shadows. I do like the set up and that child looks "thrilled"  (hehe) to be doing homework.  Nice penmanship, btw.', '2005-09-12 10:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698449, 229122, 40820, '<td valign="top">this image could have done with a bit more contrast....the colors seem a little "washed out"</td>', 'this image could have done with a bit more contrast....the colors seem a little "washed out"', '2005-09-12 10:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698452, 230296, 41066, '<td valign="top">Love the model and her body language.  Great smile and I love the positioning within the photo.  8</td>', 'Love the model and her body language.  Great smile and I love the positioning within the photo.  8', '2005-09-12 10:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698453, 230174, 37005, '<td valign="top">Beautifully executed.  I am curious, tho, how the leaves would''ve made the eyes look in this shot.</td>', 'Beautifully executed.  I am curious, tho, how the leaves would''ve made the eyes look in this shot.', '2005-09-12 10:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
