(1698467, 230091, 21500, '<td valign="top">I recommend trying a number of angles with the light.  If you have a flash (might need to be closer) it sometimes helps to use it even in daylight.</td>', 'I recommend trying a number of angles with the light.  If you have a flash (might need to be closer) it sometimes helps to use it even in daylight.', '2005-09-12 10:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
