(1698705, 230108, 24454, '<td valign="top">That is a beautiful animal portrait!    I hope you aren''t getting hits because it is animals. . .I love it!</td>', 'That is a beautiful animal portrait!    I hope you aren''t getting hits because it is animals. . .I love it!', '2005-09-12 11:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698706, 229867, 42470, '<td valign="top">very cute!  great shot, great colors</td>', 'very cute!  great shot, great colors', '2005-09-12 11:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698708, 229092, 24454, '<td valign="top">Nice job.   He has such a natural look.</td>', 'Nice job.   He has such a natural look.', '2005-09-12 11:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698709, 230138, 42470, '<td valign="top">nice idea...might have done something different w. wardrobe.</td>', 'nice idea...might have done something different w. wardrobe.', '2005-09-12 11:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698710, 229724, 10686, '<td valign="top">Wonderful face and expression !</td>', 'Wonderful face and expression !', '2005-09-12 11:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698715, 230122, 14620, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful model!  I like her natural expression with a little hint of a smile.  The composition is also nice.  Some things that I might change if this were mine would be to brighten it up a bit.  It seems a little dark, maybe taken in a shady area or on a very overcast day.  It''s just a bit flat and could use maybe a bit more contrast.  Overall, a nice portrait of a cute little lady. :-)</td>', 'What a beautiful model!  I like her natural expression with a little hint of a smile.  The composition is also nice.  Some things that I might change if this were mine would be to brighten it up a bit.  It seems a little dark, maybe taken in a shady area or on a very overcast day.  It''s just a bit flat and could use maybe a bit more contrast.  Overall, a nice portrait of a cute little lady. :-)', '2005-09-12 11:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698716, 230364, 42470, '<td valign="top">wow, a Honda Trail 70 on the right...flashback for me!  cool shot.</td>', 'wow, a Honda Trail 70 on the right...flashback for me!  cool shot.', '2005-09-12 11:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698719, 230231, 10686, '<td valign="top">What a look!</td>', 'What a look!', '2005-09-12 11:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698724, 228773, 24846, '<td valign="top">Very lovely Mambe. Composition is great with 1/3''s of tree, shawl, and you. Nice natural skin tones with your eyes that look right at me. Good luck with this wonderful self portrait!</td>', 'Very lovely Mambe. Composition is great with 1/3''s of tree, shawl, and you. Nice natural skin tones with your eyes that look right at me. Good luck with this wonderful self portrait!', '2005-09-12 11:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698726, 230298, 14620, '<td valign="top">Interesting candid portrait.  The colors are nice, light seems just a little harsh not that that can be helped in a situation like this.   Tthis seems like more of a storytelling type portrait so possibly including more of the drum or drumstick might help the compostion.  Overall,  a nice job.</td>', 'Interesting candid portrait.  The colors are nice, light seems just a little harsh not that that can be helped in a situation like this.   Tthis seems like more of a storytelling type portrait so possibly including more of the drum or drumstick might help the compostion.  Overall,  a nice job.', '2005-09-12 11:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698727, 228017, 42470, '<td valign="top">nice shot ... it''s tough to get this quality on Day 1!  Congrats</td>', 'nice shot ... it''s tough to get this quality on Day 1!  Congrats', '2005-09-12 11:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698729, 229378, 42470, '<td valign="top">great expression</td>', 'great expression', '2005-09-12 11:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698731, 230098, 28801, '<td valign="top">nice and lively pic, could do with a hint of saturation</td>', 'nice and lively pic, could do with a hint of saturation', '2005-09-12 11:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698732, 230229, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is very well done, except, for my tastes, I think it would have made a better portrait to just have her in it since she is posing so well, and it looks like he got caught off guard.</td>', 'This is very well done, except, for my tastes, I think it would have made a better portrait to just have her in it since she is posing so well, and it looks like he got caught off guard.', '2005-09-12 11:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
