(1698735, 230091, 10686, '<td valign="top">Great subject and location, but I think some more thought given to composition would really help as would a bit of fill.</td>', 'Great subject and location, but I think some more thought given to composition would really help as would a bit of fill.', '2005-09-12 11:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
