(1698741, 229696, 42328, '<td valign="top">Great photo -- compostion, pose, expression.  However the retouching on the skin could be better.  I don''t mean more, I mean better.</td>', 'Great photo -- compostion, pose, expression.  However the retouching on the skin could be better.  I don''t mean more, I mean better.', '2005-09-12 11:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
