(1698753, 227475, 41277, '<td valign="top">im sure the kid doesnt have makeup.. <br/>my point is that blur doesnt work everywhere... <br/>nice compose though.. and expression from the kid..7</td>', 'im sure the kid doesnt have makeup.. my point is that blur doesnt work everywhere... nice compose though.. and expression from the kid..7', '2005-09-12 11:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698754, 230179, 39664, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait but I think the skin is too smoothed over.  It gives a bright cast to the left side of her forehead.</td>', 'Lovely portrait but I think the skin is too smoothed over.  It gives a bright cast to the left side of her forehead.', '2005-09-12 11:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698755, 228731, 42638, '<td valign="top">How fun! Nice picture and the colors are great! I like the blur effect.</td>', 'How fun! Nice picture and the colors are great! I like the blur effect.', '2005-09-12 11:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698756, 229383, 24546, '<td valign="top">While I like the pose, the framing and the expression, this feels under exposed.</td>', 'While I like the pose, the framing and the expression, this feels under exposed.', '2005-09-12 11:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698757, 228347, 14620, '<td valign="top">A lovely model and I like her pose and expression.  One thing that I think might help this shot is to change up the composition a bit.  I would either crop it to potrait orientation and have it be more about her and less about the wall, or I would put her off center to give it a little more interest.  Having her dead center seems to take away from the photo a bit.   It really should be all about her. :-)</td>', 'A lovely model and I like her pose and expression.  One thing that I think might help this shot is to change up the composition a bit.  I would either crop it to potrait orientation and have it be more about her and less about the wall, or I would put her off center to give it a little more interest.  Having her dead center seems to take away from the photo a bit.   It really should be all about her. :-)', '2005-09-12 11:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698758, 229332, 41277, '<td valign="top">great shot and compose/angle.. love it..<br/>whould have been better witout the sleeping eye...</td>', 'great shot and compose/angle.. love it..whould have been better witout the sleeping eye...', '2005-09-12 11:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698760, 228381, 42638, '<td valign="top">Good Picture! I like the background, it really brings out this portrait. Good Job!</td>', 'Good Picture! I like the background, it really brings out this portrait. Good Job!', '2005-09-12 11:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698762, 230091, 42470, '<td valign="top">I like the landscape which adds a lot to the subject.</td>', 'I like the landscape which adds a lot to the subject.', '2005-09-12 11:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698763, 230111, 39664, '<td valign="top">The eyes have it!  I don''t care for the hood coming at me from the top.</td>', 'The eyes have it!  I don''t care for the hood coming at me from the top.', '2005-09-12 11:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698765, 228978, 41277, '<td valign="top">great negetive space.. i like when breaking the rules.. i bet some people said something about it.. i think its great as well as the skin tone  and focus... my first 10</td>', 'great negetive space.. i like when breaking the rules.. i bet some people said something about it.. i think its great as well as the skin tone  and focus... my first 10', '2005-09-12 11:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698766, 229673, 14620, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This is a really wonderful portrait.  You seem to have captured the essence of this beautiful young lady.  The coloring is amazing all the way around from her hair to her eyes to those cute freckles.  The black background sets her off nicely.  Well done!</td>', 'Wow!  This is a really wonderful portrait.  You seem to have captured the essence of this beautiful young lady.  The coloring is amazing all the way around from her hair to her eyes to those cute freckles.  The black background sets her off nicely.  Well done!', '2005-09-12 11:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698767, 229691, 42638, '<td valign="top">Too Cute! So adorable! Nice shot! Really conveys their emotions.</td>', 'Too Cute! So adorable! Nice shot! Really conveys their emotions.', '2005-09-12 11:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698769, 227989, 39664, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked this better if the collar of the hood wasn''t visible, maybe by pulling the fur all around the face for framing.  Also, less background with a tighter crop.</td>', 'I think I would have liked this better if the collar of the hood wasn''t visible, maybe by pulling the fur all around the face for framing.  Also, less background with a tighter crop.', '2005-09-12 11:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698770, 227206, 24546, '<td valign="top">Such a sweet photo!  You really captured that innocence and the sweetness of a sleeping baby. From a technical viewpoint, the most sharply focused part of the photo is the stars in his hat.  I would prefer his face - nose,eyes, etc. to be more sharply focused.  A greater depth of field would have made this a stronger shot.</td>', 'Such a sweet photo!  You really captured that innocence and the sweetness of a sleeping baby. From a technical viewpoint, the most sharply focused part of the photo is the stars in his hat.  I would prefer his face - nose,eyes, etc. to be more sharply focused.  A greater depth of field would have made this a stronger shot.', '2005-09-12 11:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698771, 230343, 41277, '<td valign="top">i know that look!!!! <br/>its lke my girlfreind saying "stop shooting already..."</td>', 'i know that look!!!! its lke my girlfreind saying "stop shooting already..."', '2005-09-12 11:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
