(1698785, 229722, 39664, '<td valign="top">I would have liked a portrait of the handler better.  He has such a merry, "WC Fields" look to him!  But this is an amusing and happy photo.  It brought a smile to my face and made me think of the movie "Groundhog Day" w/ Bill Murray.</td>', 'I would have liked a portrait of the handler better.  He has such a merry, "WC Fields" look to him!  But this is an amusing and happy photo.  It brought a smile to my face and made me think of the movie "Groundhog Day" w/ Bill Murray.', '2005-09-12 11:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1698786, 230310, 41277, '<td valign="top">great use of negetive space...</td>', 'great use of negetive space...', '2005-09-12 11:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
