(1699010, 230154, 41066, '<td valign="top">Very nice Shot.  What a poser he is!  I like how the foreground is in sharp contrast to the softness in the background.  Well Done! 8</td>', 'Very nice Shot.  What a poser he is!  I like how the foreground is in sharp contrast to the softness in the background.  Well Done! 8', '2005-09-12 12:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
