(1699284, 229902, 37961, '<td valign="top">Love the far away look in his eyes. Great shadows and nice contrast. The more I look at this, the more I like it! Great Job! 10.</td>', 'Love the far away look in his eyes. Great shadows and nice contrast. The more I look at this, the more I like it! Great Job! 10.', '2005-09-12 13:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1699285, 228125, 39664, '<td valign="top">The green is too bright and distracting from the otherwise beautiful subject.  A little green could have gone a long way!  I would crop the entire left half off.</td>', 'The green is too bright and distracting from the otherwise beautiful subject.  A little green could have gone a long way!  I would crop the entire left half off.', '2005-09-12 13:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1699286, 229696, 30605, '<td valign="top">This picture started as a very good potrait. Composition and lighting are very good. However, I detect heavy spot editing on cheeks and nose that makes skin texture  looking weird.</td>', 'This picture started as a very good potrait. Composition and lighting are very good. However, I detect heavy spot editing on cheeks and nose that makes skin texture  looking weird.', '2005-09-12 13:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1699288, 230086, 6008, '<td valign="top">This comes across as an image taken in low light with the wrong white balance. Whereas the yellowish/red tones can usually suggest warmth I think a ''proper'' skin tone would be more appealing. The image also looks quite soft and either requires some sharpening or more light to help with focusing. I''m assuming this was a long exposure due to the laser pen markings and that may have been partly the reason why also. The lines do add an unusual interest.</td>', 'This comes across as an image taken in low light with the wrong white balance. Whereas the yellowish/red tones can usually suggest warmth I think a ''proper'' skin tone would be more appealing. The image also looks quite soft and either requires some sharpening or more light to help with focusing. I''m assuming this was a long exposure due to the laser pen markings and that may have been partly the reason why also. The lines do add an unusual interest.', '2005-09-12 13:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1699289, 230072, 10080, '<td valign="top">I had a similar idea in my head, to use face paint. The coloring is just way bizzare if thats what you were going for.  decent final result.</td>', 'I had a similar idea in my head, to use face paint. The coloring is just way bizzare if thats what you were going for.  decent final result.', '2005-09-12 13:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1699292, 229518, 39664, '<td valign="top">This is advanced editing.  Why didn''t you take out the bloodshot eyes?  I think you should either have the other eye all the way covered up or visible, not partially covered as it is here.</td>', 'This is advanced editing.  Why didn''t you take out the bloodshot eyes?  I think you should either have the other eye all the way covered up or visible, not partially covered as it is here.', '2005-09-12 13:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
