(1699331, 230076, 6008, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if you were trying for a high-key shot or else just a lack of contrast. There is a distinct lack of black in the image and I think that may have helped rescue it from an overall washed-out look. It also looks a little soft. If this wasnt a candid shot then using a light-colored shirt probably would have worked better. His facial expression is quite cute and that helps convey a sense of personality in the image.</td>', 'I''m not sure if you were trying for a high-key shot or else just a lack of contrast. There is a distinct lack of black in the image and I think that may have helped rescue it from an overall washed-out look. It also looks a little soft. If this wasnt a candid shot then using a light-colored shirt probably would have worked better. His facial expression is quite cute and that helps convey a sense of personality in the image.', '2005-09-12 14:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
