(1699523, 229000, 37103, '<td valign="top">I think this is a fun shot with the flower and the pose.  The red is too much for me, especially since it clashes a little with the lipstick.  I wonder how this portrait would be in black and white.  Also, it might be nice to pull back a little, her face seems quite large in this frame.</td>', 'I think this is a fun shot with the flower and the pose.  The red is too much for me, especially since it clashes a little with the lipstick.  I wonder how this portrait would be in black and white.  Also, it might be nice to pull back a little, her face seems quite large in this frame.', '2005-09-12 14:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1699525, 229842, 37103, '<td valign="top">This is technically a very well composed, exposed and post processed shot.  My only suggestion would be to try to create a portrait that conveys something about the person.  To me that is the intent of portraiture.  Put her in a context, have her show her personality.  There isn''t enough information here for me.</td>', 'This is technically a very well composed, exposed and post processed shot.  My only suggestion would be to try to create a portrait that conveys something about the person.  To me that is the intent of portraiture.  Put her in a context, have her show her personality.  There isn''t enough information here for me.', '2005-09-12 14:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
