(1699579, 229954, 42871, '<td valign="top">very interesting photo. it seems to be telling a story with the man out of focus in the background and the woman looking off. do they know each other? is the man a forgotten love? or maybe he loves her but she does not know, or maybe even care. photo''s like this really speak to me, the only thing I am not crazy about is the exposure/color choice. otherwise, top marks.</td>', 'very interesting photo. it seems to be telling a story with the man out of focus in the background and the woman looking off. do they know each other? is the man a forgotten love? or maybe he loves her but she does not know, or maybe even care. photo''s like this really speak to me, the only thing I am not crazy about is the exposure/color choice. otherwise, top marks.', '2005-09-12 14:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
