(1699645, 230156, 37779, '<td valign="top">The lighting is cool- but its a little to much of a snapshot!</td>', 'The lighting is cool- but its a little to much of a snapshot!', '2005-09-12 15:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1699647, 229578, 44086, '<td valign="top">Wow. Fantastic capture.<br/></td>', 'Wow. Fantastic capture.', '2005-09-12 15:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1699654, 229751, 34217, '<td valign="top">nice light</td>', 'nice light', '2005-09-12 15:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1699656, 228125, 37103, '<td valign="top">Technically this is a beautiful picture.  The colors, exposure and pose are all very attractive.  For me I would like to see a little bit more personality in a portrait, or at least something that tells you about the person being photographed.  Maybe having some emotion on her face would help.  Or possibly having the background be someplace that is symbolic or important to her.  The bright green of the background is also a little distracting.</td>', 'Technically this is a beautiful picture.  The colors, exposure and pose are all very attractive.  For me I would like to see a little bit more personality in a portrait, or at least something that tells you about the person being photographed.  Maybe having some emotion on her face would help.  Or possibly having the background be someplace that is symbolic or important to her.  The bright green of the background is also a little distracting.', '2005-09-12 15:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1699657, 230359, 16106, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, my only improvment might be a bit of burning at the top edge to keep the eye from wandering off the top of the page. Lovely color and tones. Of course it will probably get hammered since the subject is not a head and sholders shot with one hand supporting the chin, but it is a lovely photograph</td>', 'Lovely shot, my only improvment might be a bit of burning at the top edge to keep the eye from wandering off the top of the page. Lovely color and tones. Of course it will probably get hammered since the subject is not a head and sholders shot with one hand supporting the chin, but it is a lovely photograph', '2005-09-12 15:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1699658, 229832, 37779, '<td valign="top">Too much of a snapshot- but quite funny!</td>', 'Too much of a snapshot- but quite funny!', '2005-09-12 15:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1699665, 230144, 32848, '<td valign="top">Looks like a character!  I think the shot looks a little washed out, though, but an interesting background.</td>', 'Looks like a character!  I think the shot looks a little washed out, though, but an interesting background.', '2005-09-12 15:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1699666, 229332, 16106, '<td valign="top">I find the jutting angle of the model''s neck to be rather disconserting, and the eyes are a touch soft, but i love the tones and the way she blends into the backround</td>', 'I find the jutting angle of the model''s neck to be rather disconserting, and the eyes are a touch soft, but i love the tones and the way she blends into the backround', '2005-09-12 15:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1699667, 229332, 34217, '<td valign="top">she looks kinda drunk.  I think if you would have had her lift her chin a little more it would have worked a little better.  With that said you do have really nice light compisition and so on.  I guess we all prefer different facial expressions<br/></td>', 'she looks kinda drunk.  I think if you would have had her lift her chin a little more it would have worked a little better.  With that said you do have really nice light compisition and so on.  I guess we all prefer different facial expressions', '2005-09-12 15:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1699668, 227989, 24454, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait!  I just love that look!</td>', 'Beautiful portrait!  I just love that look!', '2005-09-12 15:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1699669, 228365, 32848, '<td valign="top">Although not human (like mine), it''s almost human.  You''ve caught this shot very well.  The depth of field is spot on, giving enough detail in the subject, but throwing the background out of focus which makes the shot.  Well done.</td>', 'Although not human (like mine), it''s almost human.  You''ve caught this shot very well.  The depth of field is spot on, giving enough detail in the subject, but throwing the background out of focus which makes the shot.  Well done.', '2005-09-12 15:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1699670, 227701, 34217, '<td valign="top">this took my breath away.  Everything about it is perfect.  Superb job!  I hope it get the blue!</td>', 'this took my breath away.  Everything about it is perfect.  Superb job!  I hope it get the blue!', '2005-09-12 15:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
