(1699697, 230246, 24454, '<td valign="top">Gasp!!!   THAT is the most incredible portrait!   I would be delighted to see this with a blue ribbon.  Gosh. . .I hope you aren''t taking hits tho about the border.   Typically the dpc''ers are one border-hating bunch!    The picture is nothing short of spectacular!     Best of luck!   10+     I''m adding this to my favorites too.</td>', 'Gasp!!!   THAT is the most incredible portrait!   I would be delighted to see this with a blue ribbon.  Gosh. . .I hope you aren''t taking hits tho about the border.   Typically the dpc''ers are one border-hating bunch!    The picture is nothing short of spectacular!     Best of luck!   10+     I''m adding this to my favorites too.', '2005-09-12 15:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1699699, 228520, 43565, '<td valign="top">The lighting is too bright, especially on his shirt.   I would like to see the focus be on his face and showing more detail.</td>', 'The lighting is too bright, especially on his shirt.   I would like to see the focus be on his face and showing more detail.', '2005-09-12 15:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1699700, 230172, 39566, '<td valign="top">gorgeous picture beautiful model</td>', 'gorgeous picture beautiful model', '2005-09-12 15:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1699701, 228520, 16106, '<td valign="top">great model, i am sorry that the top of his cap and left elbow are cut off, makes the composition seem  un intended. In a more spacious framing the modle''s tilted seat would have added to the style, with  the framing so tight,  it hurts. Anyway, I like the shot and the slightly washed out colors you used, I hope it does well since there is a ton of personalty here, and i like the old world feel.</td>', 'great model, i am sorry that the top of his cap and left elbow are cut off, makes the composition seem  un intended. In a more spacious framing the modle''s tilted seat would have added to the style, with  the framing so tight,  it hurts. Anyway, I like the shot and the slightly washed out colors you used, I hope it does well since there is a ton of personalty here, and i like the old world feel.', '2005-09-12 15:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1699702, 228762, 41066, '<td valign="top">Stunning photo.  Such a natural warm pose.</td>', 'Stunning photo.  Such a natural warm pose.', '2005-09-12 15:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1699704, 229774, 24454, '<td valign="top">That''s just beautiful!    What a beautiful mom and baby girl!!!</td>', 'That''s just beautiful!    What a beautiful mom and baby girl!!!', '2005-09-12 15:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1699706, 229725, 32848, '<td valign="top">I like the exposure on this shot, great skin tones and facial detail.  She has a lovely complextion, and yes, she looks timid.</td>', 'I like the exposure on this shot, great skin tones and facial detail.  She has a lovely complextion, and yes, she looks timid.', '2005-09-12 15:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
