(1699714, 228810, 41066, '<td valign="top">A bit too much neat image I think, but it does not seem to detract too much from your photograph.  Your model is stunning with lovely big eyes.  Nice Work.</td>', 'A bit too much neat image I think, but it does not seem to detract too much from your photograph.  Your model is stunning with lovely big eyes.  Nice Work.', '2005-09-12 15:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1699715, 230246, 37779, '<td valign="top">Adorable- I quite like it a lot! Hope it scores well :-)</td>', 'Adorable- I quite like it a lot! Hope it scores well :-)', '2005-09-12 15:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1699717, 230236, 32848, '<td valign="top">It''s good to get to the same level as the subject, but it doesn''t quite make it in the sharpness, imo.</td>', 'It''s good to get to the same level as the subject, but it doesn''t quite make it in the sharpness, imo.', '2005-09-12 15:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1699718, 230294, 14620, '<td valign="top">Very cute!  Nice expression and cute touch with the golf club.  Could benefit from a tad more light on his face.  The bill of the hat shades his pretty eyes.  Maybe a use of a reflector below would help here.  Like we all carry those around while we''re out with the kids. :-)  Nice portrait.</td>', 'Very cute!  Nice expression and cute touch with the golf club.  Could benefit from a tad more light on his face.  The bill of the hat shades his pretty eyes.  Maybe a use of a reflector below would help here.  Like we all carry those around while we''re out with the kids. :-)  Nice portrait.', '2005-09-12 15:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1699719, 229378, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwwwwww. . . . what an amazing picture!!!    He just makes me want to give him a huge hug.   It''s just a tad over-exposed, but I just love it anyway!   Gosh.  I hope you aren''t getting killed for the border.   This is normally one border-hating bunch!   I happen to like it a lot and think this is an awesome photo!!!!!</td>', 'Awwwwwww. . . . what an amazing picture!!!    He just makes me want to give him a huge hug.   It''s just a tad over-exposed, but I just love it anyway!   Gosh.  I hope you aren''t getting killed for the border.   This is normally one border-hating bunch!   I happen to like it a lot and think this is an awesome photo!!!!!', '2005-09-12 15:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1699720, 230153, 32848, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, more than one onlooker too!</td>', 'Interesting idea, more than one onlooker too!', '2005-09-12 15:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1699722, 230370, 30605, '<td valign="top">I am not sure this effect add anything to this picture. Looks like a very good picture from the start destroyed by filter abuse. Subject has a nice pose and intriguing look.</td>', 'I am not sure this effect add anything to this picture. Looks like a very good picture from the start destroyed by filter abuse. Subject has a nice pose and intriguing look.', '2005-09-12 15:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1699723, 228773, 37779, '<td valign="top">Oh baby, you know this is good!</td>', 'Oh baby, you know this is good!', '2005-09-12 15:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1699724, 229959, 24454, '<td valign="top">She is too cute to be real!    What a PERFECT specimen of "little girl" !!!    Good luck!</td>', 'She is too cute to be real!    What a PERFECT specimen of "little girl" !!!    Good luck!', '2005-09-12 15:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1699725, 230172, 32848, '<td valign="top">Nice focus, I really like the soft hair.  Good exposure too.</td>', 'Nice focus, I really like the soft hair.  Good exposure too.', '2005-09-12 15:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
