(1699729, 229944, 14620, '<td valign="top">Cute!  I like the idea of this shot.  It seems a litte soft on the focus especially on the eyes and the litte hairs over her eye are a little distracting.  Would also love to see the whole eye on right as the corner is cropped a little tight.  The braids are cute and so is she. :-)</td>', 'Cute!  I like the idea of this shot.  It seems a litte soft on the focus especially on the eyes and the litte hairs over her eye are a little distracting.  Would also love to see the whole eye on right as the corner is cropped a little tight.  The braids are cute and so is she. :-)', '2005-09-12 15:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1699731, 229945, 24454, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!!!!   Perfect composition, and what a natural she is in front of the camera!  There''s such freshness and innocence in that face!</td>', 'Beautiful!!!!   Perfect composition, and what a natural she is in front of the camera!  There''s such freshness and innocence in that face!', '2005-09-12 15:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
