(1699733, 230271, 43565, '<td valign="top">Is there something in the water coming after him?  I like the focus, but not the composition or background.  To me, a portrait is posed and tells the viewer something about the subject.</td>', 'Is there something in the water coming after him?  I like the focus, but not the composition or background.  To me, a portrait is posed and tells the viewer something about the subject.', '2005-09-12 15:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
