(1699741, 230270, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awww. . .how beautiful!   My little Abby has real life eyes that blue too.   They are rare, and this is one of the best!!!!!  Good Luck!</td>', 'Awww. . .how beautiful!   My little Abby has real life eyes that blue too.   They are rare, and this is one of the best!!!!!  Good Luck!', '2005-09-12 15:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
