(1699921, 229954, 34247, '<td valign="top">brilliant. one of the best of the bunch. and if the voters can''t see it, then it''s their loss. love the texturing on the clothing. the gaze and title work well. funny how people get caught checking up other people sometime.</td>', 'brilliant. one of the best of the bunch. and if the voters can''t see it, then it''s their loss. love the texturing on the clothing. the gaze and title work well. funny how people get caught checking up other people sometime.', '2005-09-12 16:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1699923, 229115, 39664, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the skin tones in this shot....her neck looks orange and face looks pinkish-gold.  If the lighting on the face were more even, this would be a much more effective shot.</td>', 'I don''t care for the skin tones in this shot....her neck looks orange and face looks pinkish-gold.  If the lighting on the face were more even, this would be a much more effective shot.', '2005-09-12 16:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
