(1699957, 230343, 39664, '<td valign="top">She is a very pretty girl and this could be a senior portrait.<br/> <br/>A few minor details that you might want to think about:<br/> <br/>Limit distractions.  If you must use jewelry, make sure the clasp is hidden.<br/> <br/>PS out those tan lines or use body make-up before the shoot.<br/> <br/>The make-up and hair are very nice.  Nice portrait!</td>', 'She is a very pretty girl and this could be a senior portrait. A few minor details that you might want to think about: Limit distractions.  If you must use jewelry, make sure the clasp is hidden. PS out those tan lines or use body make-up before the shoot. The make-up and hair are very nice.  Nice portrait!', '2005-09-12 16:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1699958, 228943, 43565, '<td valign="top">The chains are distracting, and this looks more like a snapshot than a portrait.  If you wanted to include the dog, she should have sat behind him.  It''s hard to get a good shot like this at night.</td>', 'The chains are distracting, and this looks more like a snapshot than a portrait.  If you wanted to include the dog, she should have sat behind him.  It''s hard to get a good shot like this at night.', '2005-09-12 16:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
