(1700430, 228910, 40977, '<td valign="top">Beautiful...the colors are amazing and the imagery and composition is stellar. Great Job - should ribbon.</td>', 'Beautiful...the colors are amazing and the imagery and composition is stellar. Great Job - should ribbon.', '2005-09-12 18:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1700432, 229959, 34217, '<td valign="top">lovely little girl, great expression.  I would have like to see a catch light in her eye.  Without it the eyes look "dead"  It looks like there may be a faint one, you might try and enhance it with your dodging tool.  The catch light is one of the most important parts of a portrait.</td>', 'lovely little girl, great expression.  I would have like to see a catch light in her eye.  Without it the eyes look "dead"  It looks like there may be a faint one, you might try and enhance it with your dodging tool.  The catch light is one of the most important parts of a portrait.', '2005-09-12 18:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1700433, 228206, 39664, '<td valign="top">The lighting is too harsh and the background distracting.  It looks like the brown things on the left are growing off her head.  The horizon cuts the photo in half.</td>', 'The lighting is too harsh and the background distracting.  It looks like the brown things on the left are growing off her head.  The horizon cuts the photo in half.', '2005-09-12 18:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1700435, 230285, 43565, '<td valign="top">What was the victory. the right to smoke a cigar?  I like the expression in his eyes and the flag background, but the focus becomes the cigar and takes it away from the man.</td>', 'What was the victory. the right to smoke a cigar?  I like the expression in his eyes and the flag background, but the focus becomes the cigar and takes it away from the man.', '2005-09-12 18:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1700436, 229578, 34217, '<td valign="top">this is such a great shot that the border is not needed.  It really takes away!</td>', 'this is such a great shot that the border is not needed.  It really takes away!', '2005-09-12 18:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1700438, 229621, 39664, '<td valign="top">What a cutie!  I think this is more a candid than a portrait.</td>', 'What a cutie!  I think this is more a candid than a portrait.', '2005-09-12 18:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1700445, 230083, 34217, '<td valign="top">love it, the best one in the challenge</td>', 'love it, the best one in the challenge', '2005-09-12 18:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
