(1700479, 229722, 43565, '<td valign="top">If you say so.  Having an out of focus man in the background is totally distracting to me.</td>', 'If you say so.  Having an out of focus man in the background is totally distracting to me.', '2005-09-12 18:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
