(1700493, 230299, 37961, '<td valign="top">Wow...nice portrait, however you overdid the eyes....But since I dont mind freaky editing, this doesnt really turn me off. However I think it may have been better with less eye editing.</td>', 'Wow...nice portrait, however you overdid the eyes....But since I dont mind freaky editing, this doesnt really turn me off. However I think it may have been better with less eye editing.', '2005-09-12 18:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
