(1700531, 229711, 9111, '<td valign="top">Nice posing He looks cute posed that way :)   <br/>The background is distracting though with the chain link fence top coming out of his neck.  and the light behind the fencing above that drawing the eye away from the young man.  the light on the right side of the tree is again drawing the eye.    movinghim to the middle of the tree thats showing and changing the crop might help here.</td>', 'Nice posing He looks cute posed that way :)   The background is distracting though with the chain link fence top coming out of his neck.  and the light behind the fencing above that drawing the eye away from the young man.  the light on the right side of the tree is again drawing the eye.    movinghim to the middle of the tree thats showing and changing the crop might help here.', '2005-09-12 18:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
