(1700630, 229092, 7543, '<td valign="top">Great use of DOF, good colors and expression, a bit grainy (reminds me of my 20D''s ISO 3200 setting, banding a bit) but grains don''t bother me that much. Good job.</td>', 'Great use of DOF, good colors and expression, a bit grainy (reminds me of my 20D''s ISO 3200 setting, banding a bit) but grains don''t bother me that much. Good job.', '2005-09-12 19:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
