(1700633, 229518, 7543, '<td valign="top">Uber sharp, super sharpness and shallow dof works great together, bringing the focus straight to her eyes. Her eyes seem a bit processed though, are they? Good job, rememberable shot.</td>', 'Uber sharp, super sharpness and shallow dof works great together, bringing the focus straight to her eyes. Her eyes seem a bit processed though, are they? Good job, rememberable shot.', '2005-09-12 19:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
