(1701086, 230115, 41675, '<td valign="top">A nice contemplative look. It''s also nice to see a guy (cute one too) instead of stereotypical female models. Good luck in the challenge. 8</td>', 'A nice contemplative look. It''s also nice to see a guy (cute one too) instead of stereotypical female models. Good luck in the challenge. 8', '2005-09-12 21:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
