(1701417, 229252, 42638, '<td valign="top">Cute picture. Love the playfullness of it all. The smiles are so honest and natural, not posed. I might have cropped closer in to the faces though.</td>', 'Cute picture. Love the playfullness of it all. The smiles are so honest and natural, not posed. I might have cropped closer in to the faces though.', '2005-09-12 21:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701419, 230172, 11518, '<td valign="top">Great pose and light!  Attitude!!!</td>', 'Great pose and light!  Attitude!!!', '2005-09-12 21:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701420, 228125, 30605, '<td valign="top">Nice background and interesting bokeh. Background almost too bright though. Light on model very good. Amazing look.</td>', 'Nice background and interesting bokeh. Background almost too bright though. Light on model very good. Amazing look.', '2005-09-12 21:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701421, 230138, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but there''s; something about the coloring that seems...off.</td>', 'I like the concept, but there''s; something about the coloring that seems...off.', '2005-09-12 21:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701423, 229906, 42638, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Picture. The eyes are wonderful. I like the hair and background too, overall the face is a bit too soft though.</td>', 'Beautiful Picture. The eyes are wonderful. I like the hair and background too, overall the face is a bit too soft though.', '2005-09-12 21:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701429, 228781, 41675, '<td valign="top">Strongly intense coloring. All I see are the eyes and the rest of the photo is lost to me.</td>', 'Strongly intense coloring. All I see are the eyes and the rest of the photo is lost to me.', '2005-09-12 21:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701432, 230154, 42638, '<td valign="top">Cute, original. Lots of people portraits so this is refreshing! Great catch. I like the blurred background and ears really give it character. Good Job!</td>', 'Cute, original. Lots of people portraits so this is refreshing! Great catch. I like the blurred background and ears really give it character. Good Job!', '2005-09-12 21:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701436, 230057, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice photo of a cute kid. For me, I would have cropped out that bit of leg on the right, but not bad overall.</td>', 'Nice photo of a cute kid. For me, I would have cropped out that bit of leg on the right, but not bad overall.', '2005-09-12 21:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701437, 228365, 40386, '<td valign="top">Wouldnt like to met this guy in a dark alley LOL.  Great shot, good luck</td>', 'Wouldnt like to met this guy in a dark alley LOL.  Great shot, good luck', '2005-09-12 21:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701438, 230083, 11518, '<td valign="top">Clever very clever!  Very original.  Bumping up. 9</td>', 'Clever very clever!  Very original.  Bumping up. 9', '2005-09-12 21:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701439, 227837, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait and beautiful child. I like her expression...and the writing on the t-shirt is a nice touch.</td>', 'Nice portrait and beautiful child. I like her expression...and the writing on the t-shirt is a nice touch.', '2005-09-12 21:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701441, 229842, 42638, '<td valign="top">Nice Picture, beautiful pose. The face is a bit too soft and the arms are distracting. I probabily would have cropped closer to the face.  The eyes are Amazing!</td>', 'Nice Picture, beautiful pose. The face is a bit too soft and the arms are distracting. I probabily would have cropped closer to the face.  The eyes are Amazing!', '2005-09-12 21:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701442, 228376, 40386, '<td valign="top">Nice "real life moment portrait"a nd a good idea, I like the reflection of the monitor on his face.</td>', 'Nice "real life moment portrait"a nd a good idea, I like the reflection of the monitor on his face.', '2005-09-12 21:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701445, 230154, 41675, '<td valign="top">Hee hee hee - how cute! Nice refreshing change from people portraits. I like it - it makes me smile.</td>', 'Hee hee hee - how cute! Nice refreshing change from people portraits. I like it - it makes me smile.', '2005-09-12 22:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701446, 228849, 40386, '<td valign="top">Cute shot, just wish you had maybe used a bit of fill flash to make it pop a bit.</td>', 'Cute shot, just wish you had maybe used a bit of fill flash to make it pop a bit.', '2005-09-12 22:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701447, 228788, 42638, '<td valign="top">Awww... Now this is the life! Such a cutie. Not much I would do to improve this except crop out a bit closer from top. Very Nice!!</td>', 'Awww... Now this is the life! Such a cutie. Not much I would do to improve this except crop out a bit closer from top. Very Nice!!', '2005-09-12 22:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701448, 229999, 41066, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning natural shot.  I love the colors of the top against the colors of the background.  And those eyes!  They sure do smile.   Well Done!</td>', 'This is a stunning natural shot.  I love the colors of the top against the colors of the background.  And those eyes!  They sure do smile.   Well Done!', '2005-09-12 22:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701450, 228773, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the color of the eyes with the color of the veil and the tree. Very professionally done, nice whites too. Good luck in the challenge, I''m sure this will do well. 9</td>', 'I like the color of the eyes with the color of the veil and the tree. Very professionally done, nice whites too. Good luck in the challenge, I''m sure this will do well. 9', '2005-09-12 22:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701452, 230066, 30605, '<td valign="top">Nice subdue lighting creates interesting shadows. Make a change from harsh lighting often seen here. Interesting decor.</td>', 'Nice subdue lighting creates interesting shadows. Make a change from harsh lighting often seen here. Interesting decor.', '2005-09-12 22:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701456, 230306, 42638, '<td valign="top">Love this shot but find the shirt distracting. Try cropping up a bit. Other than that its Great!</td>', 'Love this shot but find the shirt distracting. Try cropping up a bit. Other than that its Great!', '2005-09-12 22:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701457, 227437, 41066, '<td valign="top">Way too over sharpened for my liking.  It is a pity because I really think this could have been a lovely natural shot.  I would recommend redoing it without so much sharpening as this photo would definately be a keeper.</td>', 'Way too over sharpened for my liking.  It is a pity because I really think this could have been a lovely natural shot.  I would recommend redoing it without so much sharpening as this photo would definately be a keeper.', '2005-09-12 22:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701458, 230299, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wow, What an expression with her eyes. Great Shot!</td>', 'Wow, What an expression with her eyes. Great Shot!', '2005-09-12 22:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701459, 229749, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, a natural looking portrait as opposed to some stereotypical beautiful model. Well done.</td>', 'I like the composition, a natural looking portrait as opposed to some stereotypical beautiful model. Well done.', '2005-09-12 22:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701460, 229791, 41675, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems a little too harsh, but nice tight closeup.</td>', 'The lighting seems a little too harsh, but nice tight closeup.', '2005-09-12 22:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701463, 230156, 41675, '<td valign="top">Hee hee hee..too bad the tongue is blurry. Cute kitty.</td>', 'Hee hee hee..too bad the tongue is blurry. Cute kitty.', '2005-09-12 22:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701466, 230113, 42638, '<td valign="top">OK, Nothing I can say with this one. Just plain CUTE!! Love the title, eyes, use of space, ears...everything. Excellent Job, Awesome picture!!</td>', 'OK, Nothing I can say with this one. Just plain CUTE!! Love the title, eyes, use of space, ears...everything. Excellent Job, Awesome picture!!', '2005-09-12 22:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701468, 228703, 41675, '<td valign="top">Ya know...I like it. Slightly different take - not being able to see the facial features, etc....and I like it. Good job. Nice touch with the hairline border being orange also.</td>', 'Ya know...I like it. Slightly different take - not being able to see the facial features, etc....and I like it. Good job. Nice touch with the hairline border being orange also.', '2005-09-12 22:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701469, 230326, 41675, '<td valign="top">Seems slightly out of focus to me, but I like his expression.</td>', 'Seems slightly out of focus to me, but I like his expression.', '2005-09-12 22:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701470, 230271, 41675, '<td valign="top">Thanks! You''re photo made me chuckle - something I needed after a long day at work. He looks like a handful.</td>', 'Thanks! You''re photo made me chuckle - something I needed after a long day at work. He looks like a handful.', '2005-09-12 22:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701475, 229265, 41675, '<td valign="top">Poor little guy looks exhausted. I wonder what this would look like if cropped a bit more at the top of bottom so the main subject wasn''t in the absolute center of the photo?</td>', 'Poor little guy looks exhausted. I wonder what this would look like if cropped a bit more at the top of bottom so the main subject wasn''t in the absolute center of the photo?', '2005-09-12 22:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701478, 229945, 41675, '<td valign="top">A nice, natural model - pretty smile, and I like the contrasting thin, black border.</td>', 'A nice, natural model - pretty smile, and I like the contrasting thin, black border.', '2005-09-12 22:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701482, 230246, 41675, '<td valign="top">Awwwwww...what a sweet, sweet photo. The outer black border is a bit too thick for my taste, but I really like the bubble shadow on the nose. Good luck in the challenge. 7</td>', 'Awwwwww...what a sweet, sweet photo. The outer black border is a bit too thick for my taste, but I really like the bubble shadow on the nose. Good luck in the challenge. 7', '2005-09-12 22:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701484, 230356, 40386, '<td valign="top">Nice even lighting and moody shot, spot the cobweb by her fingers, hope she isnt scared of spiders</td>', 'Nice even lighting and moody shot, spot the cobweb by her fingers, hope she isnt scared of spiders', '2005-09-12 22:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701488, 229772, 41675, '<td valign="top">A good photo-journalist portrait feel. Your photo says alot. I like that about it.</td>', 'A good photo-journalist portrait feel. Your photo says alot. I like that about it.', '2005-09-12 22:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701490, 230236, 41675, '<td valign="top">I love the title....hunter at rest apparently...very cute.</td>', 'I love the title....hunter at rest apparently...very cute.', '2005-09-12 22:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701494, 229647, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, the lighting is a bit too bright, and I wish I could see more of the...uniform? I like the sky background.</td>', 'For me, the lighting is a bit too bright, and I wish I could see more of the...uniform? I like the sky background.', '2005-09-12 22:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701498, 229864, 30605, '<td valign="top">Great smile. Good composition. Lighting a bit strong; almost wash out the teeths on the right side.</td>', 'Great smile. Good composition. Lighting a bit strong; almost wash out the teeths on the right side.', '2005-09-12 22:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701499, 228939, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like this. Good color, nice contrasting areas and composition. Good luck in the challenge....one of my first thoughts was a Jedi Knight in training. :-) 8</td>', 'I like this. Good color, nice contrasting areas and composition. Good luck in the challenge....one of my first thoughts was a Jedi Knight in training. :-) 8', '2005-09-12 22:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701500, 229471, 40386, '<td valign="top">Nice moody shot, wish he had smiled a bit, the point of focus appears to be on the bark slightly behind him rather than on his face</td>', 'Nice moody shot, wish he had smiled a bit, the point of focus appears to be on the bark slightly behind him rather than on his face', '2005-09-12 22:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701502, 230149, 41675, '<td valign="top">If the flash wasn''t quite so harsh, I would have scored this higher. Very cool closeup though. I like the orange of the eyes.</td>', 'If the flash wasn''t quite so harsh, I would have scored this higher. Very cool closeup though. I like the orange of the eyes.', '2005-09-12 22:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701506, 228910, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like this one alot. I like the space around her as opposed to being tightly cropped. I also like the leaves on the ground against the bright flowers of her outfit. I hope this does very well in the challenge - good luck! 10 :-)</td>', 'I like this one alot. I like the space around her as opposed to being tightly cropped. I also like the leaves on the ground against the bright flowers of her outfit. I hope this does very well in the challenge - good luck! 10 :-)', '2005-09-12 22:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701507, 229383, 41675, '<td valign="top">A nice portrait...a bit too dark overall for my taste, but a nice shot.</td>', 'A nice portrait...a bit too dark overall for my taste, but a nice shot.', '2005-09-12 22:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701513, 229729, 40386, '<td valign="top">Great idea, maybe a bit more burning in of the mouth area?  The reflection in the glasses, not too sure if it is a softbox or something, spoils it.  If the eyes had been in sharper focus with no reflection in the glasses it would have had a lot more impact</td>', 'Great idea, maybe a bit more burning in of the mouth area?  The reflection in the glasses, not too sure if it is a softbox or something, spoils it.  If the eyes had been in sharper focus with no reflection in the glasses it would have had a lot more impact', '2005-09-12 22:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701514, 228978, 30605, '<td valign="top">I am sure you got tons of comments on the plastic look. I am sure some like it and other don''t. I am in the "don''t" camp. That would have been a very good picture with an original and unusual composition, cute model and good lighting. <br/>I still have a feeling it will finish close to the top here.</td>', 'I am sure you got tons of comments on the plastic look. I am sure some like it and other don''t. I am in the "don''t" camp. That would have been a very good picture with an original and unusual composition, cute model and good lighting. I still have a feeling it will finish close to the top here.', '2005-09-12 22:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701517, 230324, 39664, '<td valign="top">Wow....different!</td>', 'Wow....different!', '2005-09-12 22:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701520, 229602, 32754, '<td valign="top">This is remarkable and touching..I like this portrait a lot. It is a depiction of the struggles of living, as evidenced by her lined face..</td>', 'This is remarkable and touching..I like this portrait a lot. It is a depiction of the struggles of living, as evidenced by her lined face..', '2005-09-12 22:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701524, 230212, 32754, '<td valign="top">good capture and great expression on handler.</td>', 'good capture and great expression on handler.', '2005-09-12 22:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701528, 230310, 32754, '<td valign="top">I like the use of light from right and fading to darkness on left..excellent composition and expression..beautifully realized.</td>', 'I like the use of light from right and fading to darkness on left..excellent composition and expression..beautifully realized.', '2005-09-12 22:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701533, 229471, 41675, '<td valign="top">A nice portrait of a very serious looking boy, I like the off center composition.</td>', 'A nice portrait of a very serious looking boy, I like the off center composition.', '2005-09-12 22:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701534, 230233, 39664, '<td valign="top">Wow this is so ugly and good!  A 10 for me!</td>', 'Wow this is so ugly and good!  A 10 for me!', '2005-09-12 22:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701535, 230350, 40386, '<td valign="top">Cute boy, the collar being crooked is the sort of thing that you need to watch for a formal portrait, but for informal it works.  It would have been better IMO if the lighting wasnt quite so flat, a bit of fill flash or if you used fill, a slightly stronger fill.  The leaf in the bottom right corner draws my eye away from his face.</td>', 'Cute boy, the collar being crooked is the sort of thing that you need to watch for a formal portrait, but for informal it works.  It would have been better IMO if the lighting wasnt quite so flat, a bit of fill flash or if you used fill, a slightly stronger fill.  The leaf in the bottom right corner draws my eye away from his face.', '2005-09-12 22:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701536, 229724, 38198, '<td valign="top">Love this shot!! what an expression.  What makes it all come to gether is good technique.</td>', 'Love this shot!! what an expression.  What makes it all come to gether is good technique.', '2005-09-12 22:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701538, 230280, 32754, '<td valign="top">This is one very striking portrait, since it is composed of four individual people with a heck of an attitude problem!  I love it and their expressions; background is very appropriate..well done color and composition...one of the best.</td>', 'This is one very striking portrait, since it is composed of four individual people with a heck of an attitude problem!  I love it and their expressions; background is very appropriate..well done color and composition...one of the best.', '2005-09-12 22:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701539, 229608, 38198, '<td valign="top">Sweet, makes you feel good to look at this one.</td>', 'Sweet, makes you feel good to look at this one.', '2005-09-12 22:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701541, 229865, 37961, '<td valign="top">I guess this photo begs the question, one year after what?</td>', 'I guess this photo begs the question, one year after what?', '2005-09-12 22:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701549, 230376, 32754, '<td valign="top">this is a good  portrait..even though the brick seems to blend into her skin, it works here as background.  I like the way you positioned her face, the lighting is very soft and flattering.</td>', 'this is a good  portrait..even though the brick seems to blend into her skin, it works here as background.  I like the way you positioned her face, the lighting is very soft and flattering.', '2005-09-12 22:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701550, 229696, 38198, '<td valign="top">Nice I like the look and the warm color. The retouch on the face is a bit too much.</td>', 'Nice I like the look and the warm color. The retouch on the face is a bit too much.', '2005-09-12 22:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701553, 229864, 32754, '<td valign="top">Very nice fill the frame portrait..good color and natural expression.</td>', 'Very nice fill the frame portrait..good color and natural expression.', '2005-09-12 22:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701555, 229026, 38198, '<td valign="top">I would love to know the story about this photo, very nice!</td>', 'I would love to know the story about this photo, very nice!', '2005-09-12 22:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701557, 228849, 32754, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  I like her pony in the picture, too; it adds something indefinable..good expression and lighting on face.</td>', 'Nice shot!  I like her pony in the picture, too; it adds something indefinable..good expression and lighting on face.', '2005-09-12 22:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701561, 228810, 40386, '<td valign="top">I am not too sure about the reflection in her eyes, wish it had just been a catchlight rather than such a large area of her eye and also it appears that you have dodged over her nose area a bit too much compared to the rest of her face maybe to get a soft focus effect?  A bit of burning on her lips would have made her lips look a bit more voluptuous.  It also appears that you have tried to blur the green behind her but this has bled into her hair.  Hope this helps.</td>', 'I am not too sure about the reflection in her eyes, wish it had just been a catchlight rather than such a large area of her eye and also it appears that you have dodged over her nose area a bit too much compared to the rest of her face maybe to get a soft focus effect?  A bit of burning on her lips would have made her lips look a bit more voluptuous.  It also appears that you have tried to blur the green behind her but this has bled into her hair.  Hope this helps.', '2005-09-12 22:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701563, 228762, 38198, '<td valign="top">Photo is some what soft, but this is a wonderful emotional photo. I think it has a perfect title.</td>', 'Photo is some what soft, but this is a wonderful emotional photo. I think it has a perfect title.', '2005-09-12 22:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701564, 229337, 40386, '<td valign="top">Cute portrait, hope baby is doing well.</td>', 'Cute portrait, hope baby is doing well.', '2005-09-12 22:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701566, 229832, 39664, '<td valign="top">This looks like a snapshot, not a portrait.</td>', 'This looks like a snapshot, not a portrait.', '2005-09-12 22:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701569, 230113, 38198, '<td valign="top">Wow, those eyes are soo cool!</td>', 'Wow, those eyes are soo cool!', '2005-09-12 22:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701570, 230359, 35357, '<td valign="top">Whoops!</td>', 'Whoops!', '2005-09-12 22:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701573, 228502, 39664, '<td valign="top">It''s like...."What are you looking at fool?"  So serious looking!<br/> <br/>Personally, this is a cute photo but I think it is more candid than portrait.</td>', 'It''s like...."What are you looking at fool?"  So serious looking! Personally, this is a cute photo but I think it is more candid than portrait.', '2005-09-12 22:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701576, 229051, 38198, '<td valign="top">Nice, good looking guy. I like how he seems to look right at you. Very personal.</td>', 'Nice, good looking guy. I like how he seems to look right at you. Very personal.', '2005-09-12 22:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701577, 230132, 40386, '<td valign="top">Cute family shot, just wish you had tried to shoot it outside with more natural daylight and fill flash</td>', 'Cute family shot, just wish you had tried to shoot it outside with more natural daylight and fill flash', '2005-09-12 22:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701579, 229770, 19982, '<td valign="top">I like the idea... I just wish I could see her face.  How would you do that?  I dunno... hold the camera down like you''re about to use it?  Or maybe put the camera on the other eye?  Something.</td>', 'I like the idea... I just wish I could see her face.  How would you do that?  I dunno... hold the camera down like you''re about to use it?  Or maybe put the camera on the other eye?  Something.', '2005-09-12 22:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701580, 229655, 40386, '<td valign="top">The low angle on this shot has put the collar and chin in focus but the eyes are soft which is a pity.</td>', 'The low angle on this shot has put the collar and chin in focus but the eyes are soft which is a pity.', '2005-09-12 22:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701586, 230220, 38198, '<td valign="top">Love all the color, patterns every where. Good expression, good light.</td>', 'Love all the color, patterns every where. Good expression, good light.', '2005-09-12 22:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701587, 228504, 19982, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  It may be a bit overprocessed, but this one at least made me stop and look at it for awhile!</td>', 'Interesting.  It may be a bit overprocessed, but this one at least made me stop and look at it for awhile!', '2005-09-12 22:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
