(1701611, 230161, 40386, '<td valign="top">This would have been a wonderful shot if the exposure and sharpness had been better.  Fill flash would have punched this up quite a bit, there is just too much variation between the highlights and lowlights. It appears that this was underexposed and you tried to bring out the detail in the shadow usinga picture editing package which had just blown out the highlights and left the shadow areas milky and soft.  Hope this helps</td>', 'This would have been a wonderful shot if the exposure and sharpness had been better.  Fill flash would have punched this up quite a bit, there is just too much variation between the highlights and lowlights. It appears that this was underexposed and you tried to bring out the detail in the shadow usinga picture editing package which had just blown out the highlights and left the shadow areas milky and soft.  Hope this helps', '2005-09-12 22:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701613, 230265, 40386, '<td valign="top">Lovely, wish she had been smiling LOL</td>', 'Lovely, wish she had been smiling LOL', '2005-09-12 22:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701614, 230373, 39664, '<td valign="top">He seems rather regal!  The furry thing he is laying on really takes away from his colors.  Wonder if you could crop the bottom off to his paws and eliminate some of the distraction?</td>', 'He seems rather regal!  The furry thing he is laying on really takes away from his colors.  Wonder if you could crop the bottom off to his paws and eliminate some of the distraction?', '2005-09-12 22:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701617, 228591, 40386, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful, good luck.</td>', 'This is wonderful, good luck.', '2005-09-12 22:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701619, 230071, 39664, '<td valign="top">Too much red tones......the whole photo has a pinkish cast to it.  Awesome intensity in the eyes.</td>', 'Too much red tones......the whole photo has a pinkish cast to it.  Awesome intensity in the eyes.', '2005-09-12 22:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701621, 229744, 38198, '<td valign="top">Super shot, Good Job. The color are so bright it just comes alive.</td>', 'Super shot, Good Job. The color are so bright it just comes alive.', '2005-09-12 22:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701625, 227837, 39664, '<td valign="top">What a doll!  I would have liked to see more of her face and head rather than the blurred out hand, but that is just me.  She''s a keeper!</td>', 'What a doll!  I would have liked to see more of her face and head rather than the blurred out hand, but that is just me.  She''s a keeper!', '2005-09-12 22:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
