(1701632, 228644, 40386, '<td valign="top">I am trying to make up my mind if you shot this on a red backdrop or if you cut the dog out and put him on a red background (not sure if this is allowed if this is the case even in advanced editing?)  The muzzle is too overexposed and it lacks focus.</td>', 'I am trying to make up my mind if you shot this on a red backdrop or if you cut the dog out and put him on a red background (not sure if this is allowed if this is the case even in advanced editing?)  The muzzle is too overexposed and it lacks focus.', '2005-09-12 22:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701636, 230214, 40386, '<td valign="top">Cute, the lighting is a bit flat and it appears yellow on my screen.</td>', 'Cute, the lighting is a bit flat and it appears yellow on my screen.', '2005-09-12 22:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701642, 229475, 38198, '<td valign="top">What a super photo, nice expression.</td>', 'What a super photo, nice expression.', '2005-09-12 22:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701643, 229565, 40386, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, end of the day last rays of sunlight with just the right amount of fill flash.  Very real.</td>', 'I like this shot, end of the day last rays of sunlight with just the right amount of fill flash.  Very real.', '2005-09-12 22:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701645, 229089, 40386, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective of this shot, she has wonderful eyes, nice capture.</td>', 'I like the perspective of this shot, she has wonderful eyes, nice capture.', '2005-09-12 22:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701646, 228502, 35142, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous comp! Your shot just caught my eye...the colors, clarity and darling expression. Definately a good example of how centered composition can work well.</td>', 'This is gorgeous comp! Your shot just caught my eye...the colors, clarity and darling expression. Definately a good example of how centered composition can work well.', '2005-09-12 22:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701653, 229711, 40386, '<td valign="top">If you had cropped out more of the tree, or maybe framed it with less tree and more space in front of the child  it would have been a better composition.  It appears out of focus and has a bad green cast.  Fill flash would have helped you here too.</td>', 'If you had cropped out more of the tree, or maybe framed it with less tree and more space in front of the child  it would have been a better composition.  It appears out of focus and has a bad green cast.  Fill flash would have helped you here too.', '2005-09-12 22:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701654, 230376, 19982, '<td valign="top">I lovethe color of her skin and the fact that you didn''t plasticize it with PhotoShop.  I think a lighter background could have complemented her a little more, but the "roughness" of the background serves as a good contrast to the softness of her skin.  Well done.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I lovethe color of her skin and the fact that you didn''t plasticize it with PhotoShop.  I think a lighter background could have complemented her a little more, but the "roughness" of the background serves as a good contrast to the softness of her skin.  Well done.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-09-12 22:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701659, 229906, 41522, '<td valign="top">Fabulous composition.  Great olour.  Excellent mesmerizing eyes.  This could have been perfect except for the strands of hair over the left eye.</td>', 'Fabulous composition.  Great olour.  Excellent mesmerizing eyes.  This could have been perfect except for the strands of hair over the left eye.', '2005-09-12 22:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701664, 229966, 40386, '<td valign="top">Underexposed, fill flash would have punched this up a bit more.  I am no sure if the underexposure has caused the softness but it lacks focus.</td>', 'Underexposed, fill flash would have punched this up a bit more.  I am no sure if the underexposure has caused the softness but it lacks focus.', '2005-09-12 22:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701665, 230299, 38198, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why but I just love this shot, the eyes, and the contrast of the red hair.</td>', 'I don''t know why but I just love this shot, the eyes, and the contrast of the red hair.', '2005-09-12 22:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701668, 230356, 19982, '<td valign="top">Cute girl.  Nice use of shallow DOF.  Good sharpness in the eyes where it counts.  Nice coloring.  A little more "three dimensional light" could be helpful, but this is a really nice natural light photo.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Cute girl.  Nice use of shallow DOF.  Good sharpness in the eyes where it counts.  Nice coloring.  A little more "three dimensional light" could be helpful, but this is a really nice natural light photo.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-09-12 22:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701669, 230335, 41522, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot and the obscured view is unique!!  I wish you could have found a way to make the eyes a little less oscured ... I know that sounds a little contradictory, but the eyes could have made this pop.</td>', 'I really like this shot and the obscured view is unique!!  I wish you could have found a way to make the eyes a little less oscured ... I know that sounds a little contradictory, but the eyes could have made this pop.', '2005-09-12 22:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701671, 229884, 14620, '<td valign="top">The processing on this is a little out there.  Composition is alright, maybe a little tight.  The eyes and her expression are nice.  Definitely an "out of the box" type portrait. :-)</td>', 'The processing on this is a little out there.  Composition is alright, maybe a little tight.  The eyes and her expression are nice.  Definitely an "out of the box" type portrait. :-)', '2005-09-12 22:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701672, 228978, 41522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful high key image.  Love the tones and the colour of the eye!  Good work.</td>', 'Wonderful high key image.  Love the tones and the colour of the eye!  Good work.', '2005-09-12 22:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701676, 229842, 39664, '<td valign="top">This has a nice softness to it that doesn''t look plastic.  Very nice lighting.  This would do nicely in any model''s portfolio as a beauty shot.</td>', 'This has a nice softness to it that doesn''t look plastic.  Very nice lighting.  This would do nicely in any model''s portfolio as a beauty shot.', '2005-09-12 22:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701678, 229026, 19982, '<td valign="top">I''m one who''s not afraid to crop into someone''s face or hairline... I think it often is to good effect.  In this case, you''ve missed just a "sliver" of his ear which makes it look more accidental than purposeful.  So that, is my minor nit.  The rest of the image is WONDERFUL.  Nice candid expression on his face.  Great lighting, excellent use of shallow DOF while preserving the ambience.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I''m one who''s not afraid to crop into someone''s face or hairline... I think it often is to good effect.  In this case, you''ve missed just a "sliver" of his ear which makes it look more accidental than purposeful.  So that, is my minor nit.  The rest of the image is WONDERFUL.  Nice candid expression on his face.  Great lighting, excellent use of shallow DOF while preserving the ambience.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-09-12 22:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701679, 229252, 40386, '<td valign="top">I would not have shot this directly from the front like this as it has made your son''s knees and legsdominate the shot.  Perhaps a different crop on the picture taking out the legs, cropping from just under the bands and arms would have made it a far nicer picture.</td>', 'I would not have shot this directly from the front like this as it has made your son''s knees and legsdominate the shot.  Perhaps a different crop on the picture taking out the legs, cropping from just under the bands and arms would have made it a far nicer picture.', '2005-09-12 22:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701680, 228408, 38198, '<td valign="top">What an Idea! I love to see creativity!</td>', 'What an Idea! I love to see creativity!', '2005-09-12 22:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701681, 227575, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is a little small in size and not really enough of a face to be considered a portrait, I don''t think.  I like the idea of the flower.  Would just like to see a little more face to go along with it.  You should definitely use the full 640 size when submitting.  It will help us to see more of the details of your photo. :-)</td>', 'This is a little small in size and not really enough of a face to be considered a portrait, I don''t think.  I like the idea of the flower.  Would just like to see a little more face to go along with it.  You should definitely use the full 640 size when submitting.  It will help us to see more of the details of your photo. :-)', '2005-09-12 22:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701682, 230341, 41522, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot.  The reflection in the glasses is a great bonus.  Good focus and nice colour.   I think that a tighter crop might have made a more dynamic image ... perhaps cropping some from the left side and the top.</td>', 'This is a good shot.  The reflection in the glasses is a great bonus.  Good focus and nice colour.   I think that a tighter crop might have made a more dynamic image ... perhaps cropping some from the left side and the top.', '2005-09-12 22:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701684, 229439, 39664, '<td valign="top">There is a greenish cast to her skin that is bothersome and since this is advanced editing, it would have been nice if you would have evened the skin tones out.  I like the portrait a lot otherwise.</td>', 'There is a greenish cast to her skin that is bothersome and since this is advanced editing, it would have been nice if you would have evened the skin tones out.  I like the portrait a lot otherwise.', '2005-09-12 22:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701688, 228531, 40386, '<td valign="top">I dont like this effect at all.  I am not sure if you were trying to get a cross processed effect?  Pity because she is a real cutie and I cant help but feel it would have been beautiful in its original form.</td>', 'I dont like this effect at all.  I am not sure if you were trying to get a cross processed effect?  Pity because she is a real cutie and I cant help but feel it would have been beautiful in its original form.', '2005-09-12 22:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701689, 230158, 40386, '<td valign="top">Wow she looks mad at something LOL. Cute shot.</td>', 'Wow she looks mad at something LOL. Cute shot.', '2005-09-12 22:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701690, 229744, 39664, '<td valign="top">Clowns are scary and this one is no exception!  Cool photo but it seems more like a candid rather than a portrait.  The colors are rocking!</td>', 'Clowns are scary and this one is no exception!  Cool photo but it seems more like a candid rather than a portrait.  The colors are rocking!', '2005-09-12 22:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701692, 229795, 14620, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect.  Not sure I like the yellow too much, but I think that''s just a personal thing.  What might help the composition here would either be to have  the subject exactly center or off to one side or the other.  As it is, it''s not quite either.  Interesting idea for a portrait.</td>', 'Interesting effect.  Not sure I like the yellow too much, but I think that''s just a personal thing.  What might help the composition here would either be to have  the subject exactly center or off to one side or the other.  As it is, it''s not quite either.  Interesting idea for a portrait.', '2005-09-12 22:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701694, 229471, 41522, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I really like the composition.  The longer I lk at this, the more it looks to me that focus is stronger on the tree trunk than on the boys eyes.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I really like the composition.  The longer I lk at this, the more it looks to me that focus is stronger on the tree trunk than on the boys eyes.', '2005-09-12 22:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701695, 228197, 19982, '<td valign="top">I apologize for not recognizing the painting.  My one critique of this interpretation of it would be the use of shallow DOF.  I think shallow DOF can work very well in a portrait.  But I believe you generally want the near eye to be the one in focus, rather than the far eye (in this case, her right eye appears to be more in focus than her left).</td>', 'I apologize for not recognizing the painting.  My one critique of this interpretation of it would be the use of shallow DOF.  I think shallow DOF can work very well in a portrait.  But I believe you generally want the near eye to be the one in focus, rather than the far eye (in this case, her right eye appears to be more in focus than her left).', '2005-09-12 22:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701696, 229677, 39664, '<td valign="top">Nice glam portrait!</td>', 'Nice glam portrait!', '2005-09-12 22:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701698, 229989, 39664, '<td valign="top">I see this as a candid rather than a portrait.</td>', 'I see this as a candid rather than a portrait.', '2005-09-12 22:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701700, 228835, 40386, '<td valign="top">I am not too mad about the crop here, I would have liked to see more of the right side of his face and his hands.  As a rule I never cut the hands or fingers off in a shot if I can help it.</td>', 'I am not too mad about the crop here, I would have liked to see more of the right side of his face and his hands.  As a rule I never cut the hands or fingers off in a shot if I can help it.', '2005-09-12 22:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701703, 230044, 40386, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I like the expression and the flat lighting and color works well for me here.  Good luck</td>', 'Nice shot, I like the expression and the flat lighting and color works well for me here.  Good luck', '2005-09-12 22:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701706, 230369, 39664, '<td valign="top">Somehow a fair skinned, blue eyed person just doesn''t "fit" the whole exotic veiled thing.  Much rather see this face popping bubble gum.</td>', 'Somehow a fair skinned, blue eyed person just doesn''t "fit" the whole exotic veiled thing.  Much rather see this face popping bubble gum.', '2005-09-12 22:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701708, 230324, 14620, '<td valign="top">Some things I like about this photo would be the vibrant colors and the composition is alright.  Some things I might do differently, would be less processing, it almost looks like a painting but not quite.  Also, the sunglasses don''t really seem to go with the traditional scarf.  It''s hard to tell due to the editing but it looks like the light might be a little harsh.  Placing the subject farther away from the background will help with minimizing shadows.</td>', 'Some things I like about this photo would be the vibrant colors and the composition is alright.  Some things I might do differently, would be less processing, it almost looks like a painting but not quite.  Also, the sunglasses don''t really seem to go with the traditional scarf.  It''s hard to tell due to the editing but it looks like the light might be a little harsh.  Placing the subject farther away from the background will help with minimizing shadows.', '2005-09-12 22:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701709, 230138, 43930, '<td valign="top">Didnt notice that it was a mirror! Nice.</td>', 'Didnt notice that it was a mirror! Nice.', '2005-09-12 22:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701710, 228242, 39664, '<td valign="top">Way overblown on the colors.  Lighting is harsh.  Photo is flat and not very interesting.</td>', 'Way overblown on the colors.  Lighting is harsh.  Photo is flat and not very interesting.', '2005-09-12 22:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701711, 229401, 40386, '<td valign="top">Personally I would have liked for this to be in sharper focus.  Portraiture and soft focus go hand in hand but with the colors in this shot I think it would have popped off the screen if it had been sharp.</td>', 'Personally I would have liked for this to be in sharper focus.  Portraiture and soft focus go hand in hand but with the colors in this shot I think it would have popped off the screen if it had been sharp.', '2005-09-12 22:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701712, 230057, 43930, '<td valign="top">Great level of detail, can''t notice the flash until looking at it carefully, nice fill.</td>', 'Great level of detail, can''t notice the flash until looking at it carefully, nice fill.', '2005-09-12 22:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701713, 229518, 43930, '<td valign="top">Nice pic, but way too much sharpening.</td>', 'Nice pic, but way too much sharpening.', '2005-09-12 23:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701716, 230223, 39664, '<td valign="top">Very unusual setting here.  I think it would have been nice to see her other beautiful brown eye.  The colors are fabulous and the headdress is very unique.  This could be a shot for a hair show!</td>', 'Very unusual setting here.  I think it would have been nice to see her other beautiful brown eye.  The colors are fabulous and the headdress is very unique.  This could be a shot for a hair show!', '2005-09-12 23:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701718, 229252, 43930, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, great sharpnes</td>', 'Nice picture, great sharpnes', '2005-09-12 23:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701719, 230172, 43930, '<td valign="top">great tonality, sharpness, and lightling! Great expression!</td>', 'great tonality, sharpness, and lightling! Great expression!', '2005-09-12 23:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701720, 230364, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cool as a digital art type piece.  Not quite sure it fits for a portrait challenge though.  The colors are very cool and I like how you can''t see any faces.  I like it being overexposed and how the last guy doesn''t really quite fit in with the others.  But for this challenge it doesn''t seem to work, for me anyways.   It''s still cool though. :-)</td>', 'This is pretty cool as a digital art type piece.  Not quite sure it fits for a portrait challenge though.  The colors are very cool and I like how you can''t see any faces.  I like it being overexposed and how the last guy doesn''t really quite fit in with the others.  But for this challenge it doesn''t seem to work, for me anyways.   It''s still cool though. :-)', '2005-09-12 23:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701721, 230344, 19982, '<td valign="top">Fairly nice lighting...  but the shadow from the nose is very distinct (sharp edges) which means a point source of light rather than a large softbox was used (or else the diffuse light was too far away from teh subject).  While you generally worry more about soft lighting for women than for men, in this case, I think the hard line is drawing just a bit too much attention, especially since everything else looks so well done.  Anyway, that''s my "nit" for this image.  Otherwise I like it a lot.  The colors, the sharpness, the contrast, etc.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Fairly nice lighting...  but the shadow from the nose is very distinct (sharp edges) which means a point source of light rather than a large softbox was used (or else the diffuse light was too far away from teh subject).  While you generally worry more about soft lighting for women than for men, in this case, I think the hard line is drawing just a bit too much attention, especially since everything else looks so well done.  Anyway, that''s my "nit" for this image.  Otherwise I like it a lot.  The colors, the sharpness, the contrast, etc.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-09-12 23:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701723, 230298, 43930, '<td valign="top">That guy is happy! Nice candit</td>', 'That guy is happy! Nice candit', '2005-09-12 23:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701724, 230336, 39664, '<td valign="top">The lighting is too harsh on the red head.  Her skin is so translucent and fair, the lighting makes it too washed out.</td>', 'The lighting is too harsh on the red head.  Her skin is so translucent and fair, the lighting makes it too washed out.', '2005-09-12 23:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1701727, 230174, 43930, '<td valign="top">wow great picture!</td>', 'wow great picture!', '2005-09-12 23:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
