(1701926, 228647, 42638, '<td valign="top">Beautiful pose. Its a bit soft but would probabily work better if you could see her eyes. Love the texture, it really adds to the portrait but not too much to distract. Good job!</td>', 'Beautiful pose. Its a bit soft but would probabily work better if you could see her eyes. Love the texture, it really adds to the portrait but not too much to distract. Good job!', '2005-09-12 23:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
