(1702173, 228788, 19982, '<td valign="top">I understand pictures of babies don''t do well on this site.  Well, perhaps it''s because the pictures have never been as well done as this one.  This is awesome.  An image to be treasured on the wall and in the family album.  I hope you do well in this challenge.  Good luck!<br/> <br/> <br/>Edit: This image made my top-5 list.  GOOD LUCK!</td>', 'I understand pictures of babies don''t do well on this site.  Well, perhaps it''s because the pictures have never been as well done as this one.  This is awesome.  An image to be treasured on the wall and in the family album.  I hope you do well in this challenge.  Good luck!  Edit: This image made my top-5 list.  GOOD LUCK!', '2005-09-13 00:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1702175, 227851, 19982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image.  If not a ribbon, then should be right up there!<br/> <br/> <br/>Edit: This image made my top-5 list.  GOOD LUCK!<br/></td>', 'Wonderful image.  If not a ribbon, then should be right up there!  Edit: This image made my top-5 list.  GOOD LUCK!', '2005-09-13 00:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1702176, 229867, 19982, '<td valign="top">One word:  CUTE!!!<br/> <br/>Well, that sums up the girl and her pose and the look on her face.<br/> <br/>As for the portrait ... Love the three dimensional lighting (visible in her face and hair and on her legs).  Love the colors, they really pop.  Especially against that white background.  And what do you have her standing on?  It looks like the surface is reflective...  very nicely done.<br/> <br/> <br/>Edit: This image made my top-5 list.  GOOD LUCK!<br/></td>', 'One word:  CUTE!!! Well, that sums up the girl and her pose and the look on her face. As for the portrait ... Love the three dimensional lighting (visible in her face and hair and on her legs).  Love the colors, they really pop.  Especially against that white background.  And what do you have her standing on?  It looks like the surface is reflective...  very nicely done.  Edit: This image made my top-5 list.  GOOD LUCK!', '2005-09-13 00:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
