(1702528, 230233, 19746, '<td valign="top">If this doesn''t win it''ll be an absolute travesty.  Amazing shot - brilliant use of negative space and the lighting is incredible.  I like how you''ve given the head a ''severed'' feel and the model expression is brilliant.  This is one of my favourite DPC shots ever - great work.<br/> <br/>Alex<br/> <br/>EDIT:  Oh yes...10</td>', 'If this doesn''t win it''ll be an absolute travesty.  Amazing shot - brilliant use of negative space and the lighting is incredible.  I like how you''ve given the head a ''severed'' feel and the model expression is brilliant.  This is one of my favourite DPC shots ever - great work. Alex EDIT:  Oh yes...10', '2005-09-13 03:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1702529, 229729, 19746, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea to expose for the sunglasses.  Although I''d be lying if I said I found this shot aesthetically pleasing (purely because of all the blown highlights)  - 6 for your original take, though.  Nice thinking.<br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'Interesting idea to expose for the sunglasses.  Although I''d be lying if I said I found this shot aesthetically pleasing (purely because of all the blown highlights)  - 6 for your original take, though.  Nice thinking. Alex', '2005-09-13 03:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1702531, 228531, 19746, '<td valign="top">Does that girl have one blue and one green eye?  Would have liked to see that!  Nice composition...why the heavy colour cast (I can see it was obviously done intentionally)?  Ruins a great shot in my opinion.  5</td>', 'Does that girl have one blue and one green eye?  Would have liked to see that!  Nice composition...why the heavy colour cast (I can see it was obviously done intentionally)?  Ruins a great shot in my opinion.  5', '2005-09-13 03:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1702533, 228952, 19746, '<td valign="top">Could be a little sharper around the eyes, ideally, but nicely composed.  I would have maybe put her a little further right in the frame and I think this would benefit from a little more brightness.  That being said, there''s very little else wrong with this shot.  Nice work!<br/> <br/>7</td>', 'Could be a little sharper around the eyes, ideally, but nicely composed.  I would have maybe put her a little further right in the frame and I think this would benefit from a little more brightness.  That being said, there''s very little else wrong with this shot.  Nice work! 7', '2005-09-13 03:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1702535, 229725, 19746, '<td valign="top">Despite the angel wings (no offense!) to which I have a persoanl aversion (probably a product of being a dA member for so long!) this is a very slick shot.  Great lighting and beautiful model.  A little underexposed for me although I think it facilitates the juxtaposition between light/dark, angel etc.<br/> <br/> I would have maybe gone for a slightly closer crop...trimmed off the very top of her head, and lost the negative space to the left and right, but this came out nicely. 8<br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'Despite the angel wings (no offense!) to which I have a persoanl aversion (probably a product of being a dA member for so long!) this is a very slick shot.  Great lighting and beautiful model.  A little underexposed for me although I think it facilitates the juxtaposition between light/dark, angel etc.  I would have maybe gone for a slightly closer crop...trimmed off the very top of her head, and lost the negative space to the left and right, but this came out nicely. 8 Alex', '2005-09-13 03:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1702537, 230158, 19746, '<td valign="top">I find this a little compositionally bland, would have maybe placed her less centrally.  You''ve exposed this perfectly, I''d really like to have seen you bring out the existing colours and tones in this shot in post-processing!  A solid portrait - 7<br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'I find this a little compositionally bland, would have maybe placed her less centrally.  You''ve exposed this perfectly, I''d really like to have seen you bring out the existing colours and tones in this shot in post-processing!  A solid portrait - 7 Alex', '2005-09-13 03:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1702542, 229906, 19746, '<td valign="top">I find the detached feeling of the head a little disconcerting but it''s nothing more than a minor gripe in an otherwise compositionally fantastic shot!  <br/> <br/>The pretty model, however, doesn''t hurt!  <br/> <br/>The eyes look a little overprocessed as does the skin, but that''s how things are done, I guess.  A little oversharpened as well.  I think your post-processing let you down a little bit because you may have got carried away...the eyes look a little fake.  I think with more subtle processing this could have been a 9 or 10 - as it stands, though...a 7 from me.<br/> <br/>Good luck<br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'I find the detached feeling of the head a little disconcerting but it''s nothing more than a minor gripe in an otherwise compositionally fantastic shot!   The pretty model, however, doesn''t hurt!   The eyes look a little overprocessed as does the skin, but that''s how things are done, I guess.  A little oversharpened as well.  I think your post-processing let you down a little bit because you may have got carried away...the eyes look a little fake.  I think with more subtle processing this could have been a 9 or 10 - as it stands, though...a 7 from me. Good luck Alex', '2005-09-13 03:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1702543, 228388, 19746, '<td valign="top">Different, colourful, pensive...<br/> <br/>fantastic!  7</td>', 'Different, colourful, pensive... fantastic!  7', '2005-09-13 03:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1702545, 228408, 19746, '<td valign="top">Would have maybe cropped the bottom left of the shot off - that little bit of background peeping through is slightly distracting...other than that you''ve executed this shot fantastically well.  Don''t let his friends at school get hold of this, hehe.<br/> <br/>8</td>', 'Would have maybe cropped the bottom left of the shot off - that little bit of background peeping through is slightly distracting...other than that you''ve executed this shot fantastically well.  Don''t let his friends at school get hold of this, hehe. 8', '2005-09-13 03:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1702549, 228943, 19746, '<td valign="top">Underexposed and washed out.   Looks a bit like a snapshot.  Try avoid using the flash when shooting and although you''ve captured a nice moment here there''re just too many distracting elements for me (the dog, the chains, the background).  Hopefully you''ll receive some more constructive critique and good luck for future shooting.<br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'Underexposed and washed out.   Looks a bit like a snapshot.  Try avoid using the flash when shooting and although you''ve captured a nice moment here there''re just too many distracting elements for me (the dog, the chains, the background).  Hopefully you''ll receive some more constructive critique and good luck for future shooting. Alex', '2005-09-13 03:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1702553, 228125, 19746, '<td valign="top">Simple but obviously effective.  Strange effect created by the bokeh on the background and the hair as they amalgamate...it looks cool.  Something about her right cheek is a little oversharp, maybe?  Anyhow, great shot, nice and simple.<br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'Simple but obviously effective.  Strange effect created by the bokeh on the background and the hair as they amalgamate...it looks cool.  Something about her right cheek is a little oversharp, maybe?  Anyhow, great shot, nice and simple. Alex', '2005-09-13 03:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1702555, 228340, 13602, '<td valign="top">In a portrait the subject''s facial expression is the most important. I can barely see it here.</td>', 'In a portrait the subject''s facial expression is the most important. I can barely see it here.', '2005-09-13 03:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
