(1702578, 229541, 23203, '<td valign="top">If you''re going to enter a slightly out-of-the-box entry, it better be really unique to score well. Something taken outdoors, with a nice background, probably a closeup, would have worked better. Good luck in the future!<br/></td>', 'If you''re going to enter a slightly out-of-the-box entry, it better be really unique to score well. Something taken outdoors, with a nice background, probably a closeup, would have worked better. Good luck in the future!', '2005-09-13 04:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
