(1702615, 228591, 23203, '<td valign="top">Very nice protrait. I had tried something similar in the portrait mentorship thread, and got a useful comment - try shooting from lower angle - that would allow you to focus more on the model and not have the blue jeans distracting.<br/></td>', 'Very nice protrait. I had tried something similar in the portrait mentorship thread, and got a useful comment - try shooting from lower angle - that would allow you to focus more on the model and not have the blue jeans distracting.', '2005-09-13 04:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
