(1702660, 230356, 17507, '<td valign="top">lovely colors in this one, and the title fits her expression and pose very well. the roughness of the concrete contasts nicely with the smoothness of her skin. and of course, she''s all kinds of cute :)</td>', 'lovely colors in this one, and the title fits her expression and pose very well. the roughness of the concrete contasts nicely with the smoothness of her skin. and of course, she''s all kinds of cute :)', '2005-09-13 05:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1702663, 230108, 17507, '<td valign="top">the bright parts of this image are beautiful, and i like the grass filling out the bottom right. I wish there were more visible detail in the shadows. if you use photoshop, try this-<br/>hit ctrl - alt - ~ (tilde) to select highlights<br/>invert the selection<br/>ctrl - j to duplicate selection to new layer<br/>set layer blending to screen<br/>... and adjust from there. if you do any re-edits post-challenge, I''d love to see them!</td>', 'the bright parts of this image are beautiful, and i like the grass filling out the bottom right. I wish there were more visible detail in the shadows. if you use photoshop, try this-hit ctrl - alt - ~ (tilde) to select highlightsinvert the selectionctrl - j to duplicate selection to new layerset layer blending to screen... and adjust from there. if you do any re-edits post-challenge, I''d love to see them!', '2005-09-13 05:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1702666, 230321, 17507, '<td valign="top">boy, he looks like he''s as ready as anyone can be. framing is admittedly awkward. but his expression is perfect.</td>', 'boy, he looks like he''s as ready as anyone can be. framing is admittedly awkward. but his expression is perfect.', '2005-09-13 05:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1702667, 229004, 17507, '<td valign="top">beautiful location. your model''s casual elegance and strength are quite attractive.</td>', 'beautiful location. your model''s casual elegance and strength are quite attractive.', '2005-09-13 05:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1702668, 228857, 20608, '<td valign="top">I bet you''re getting some flack about the neat imaging, I like this shot though even though its a bit soft i think the crop saved you 8.</td>', 'I bet you''re getting some flack about the neat imaging, I like this shot though even though its a bit soft i think the crop saved you 8.', '2005-09-13 05:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1702670, 229810, 17507, '<td valign="top">lovely picture, very serene. if the characters on the wall are his (yours?) then his calligraphy is impressive. there are a few things that could have helped this in the post processing:<br/> <br/>1. cloning out the bright spot in lower left<br/>2. increasing the contrast on the image<br/>3. a bit of sharpening<br/> <br/>- but this remains a very good photograph in any case. 8</td>', 'lovely picture, very serene. if the characters on the wall are his (yours?) then his calligraphy is impressive. there are a few things that could have helped this in the post processing: 1. cloning out the bright spot in lower left2. increasing the contrast on the image3. a bit of sharpening - but this remains a very good photograph in any case. 8', '2005-09-13 05:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1702671, 229089, 20608, '<td valign="top">this is off-center otherwise a great shot and worthy of a higher score - 5</td>', 'this is off-center otherwise a great shot and worthy of a higher score - 5', '2005-09-13 05:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1702676, 230071, 17507, '<td valign="top">exposure and tonal range are good. shadows are a bit too dark on the right of his face. the use of a reflecting card or the like (e.g., big piece of white cardboard, a white cloth) held outside the frame can work wonders in shadow reduction.</td>', 'exposure and tonal range are good. shadows are a bit too dark on the right of his face. the use of a reflecting card or the like (e.g., big piece of white cardboard, a white cloth) held outside the frame can work wonders in shadow reduction.', '2005-09-13 05:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1702680, 228781, 17507, '<td valign="top">that young lady has one intense gaze.</td>', 'that young lady has one intense gaze.', '2005-09-13 05:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1702682, 230310, 20608, '<td valign="top">very stylish - 8</td>', 'very stylish - 8', '2005-09-13 05:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
