(1703160, 229378, 41066, '<td valign="top">I love this photograph.  I once taught kids who really remind me of this little boy with the cheeky look in his eyes.  The photograph is sharp in just the right areas and blurred in the areas you don''t need. (with the exception of the apple, I think I would have liked to have seen that a little sharper).  Good Luck in the Challenge!</td>', 'I love this photograph.  I once taught kids who really remind me of this little boy with the cheeky look in his eyes.  The photograph is sharp in just the right areas and blurred in the areas you don''t need. (with the exception of the apple, I think I would have liked to have seen that a little sharper).  Good Luck in the Challenge!', '2005-09-13 10:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1703163, 229967, 41066, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely natural shot.  I like the natural lighting and the dull background which in turn helps make the boy stand out so much more!  I think your title is very appropriate for this photograph because I can just picture him saying that! hehe  Good Luck in the challenge!</td>', 'This is a lovely natural shot.  I like the natural lighting and the dull background which in turn helps make the boy stand out so much more!  I think your title is very appropriate for this photograph because I can just picture him saying that! hehe  Good Luck in the challenge!', '2005-09-13 10:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1703164, 229045, 41066, '<td valign="top">I think I would have like to have seen this without so much of the soft blur on it.  It still is a fantastic shot and I love the look in the girls eyes.  Good Luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I think I would have like to have seen this without so much of the soft blur on it.  It still is a fantastic shot and I love the look in the girls eyes.  Good Luck in the challenge!', '2005-09-13 10:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
