(1703232, 230018, 14620, '<td valign="top">Has a very nice fashion feel to it.  Nice pose, elegant and I like her aloof expression.  The contrasts betwen the casual attire and the jewelry and her attitude is nice.  Colors are good and lighting is nice (although the slight shadow is a wee bit of an distraction)  But overall a cool fashion portrait.  8</td>', 'Has a very nice fashion feel to it.  Nice pose, elegant and I like her aloof expression.  The contrasts betwen the casual attire and the jewelry and her attitude is nice.  Colors are good and lighting is nice (although the slight shadow is a wee bit of an distraction)  But overall a cool fashion portrait.  8', '2005-09-13 11:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
