(1703243, 228978, 14620, '<td valign="top">I love her expression, her eyes convey alot.  I like the composition and the colors and lighting  are good.  Her skin is a little too smooth and hair a bit to sharp for my tastes, but that''s just a personal taste.   Overall, I think she''s gorgeous and you photographed her well. 8</td>', 'I love her expression, her eyes convey alot.  I like the composition and the colors and lighting  are good.  Her skin is a little too smooth and hair a bit to sharp for my tastes, but that''s just a personal taste.   Overall, I think she''s gorgeous and you photographed her well. 8', '2005-09-13 11:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1703248, 228340, 10263, '<td valign="top">Love the tree :) The shot is more like a snapshot than a portrait I think. Also the light road is quite distracting. Possibly a different angle might have worked better. The model is also too centered in the photo. The rule of thirds should have been applied here I believe.</td>', 'Love the tree :) The shot is more like a snapshot than a portrait I think. Also the light road is quite distracting. Possibly a different angle might have worked better. The model is also too centered in the photo. The rule of thirds should have been applied here I believe.', '2005-09-13 11:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1703249, 228910, 14620, '<td valign="top">You''re blessed to have such wonderfully expressive models.  And they are blessed to have you to capture the beauty and joys of their childhood.  This is really beautiful.  The cheerful colors contrast nicely with the drab desolate scene she is posed in.  Great composition.  Nice job!</td>', 'You''re blessed to have such wonderfully expressive models.  And they are blessed to have you to capture the beauty and joys of their childhood.  This is really beautiful.  The cheerful colors contrast nicely with the drab desolate scene she is posed in.  Great composition.  Nice job!', '2005-09-13 11:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
