(1703354, 227575, 35545, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  Nice juxtaposition of elements, but I think a portrait should be of the whole face.  I want to say the picture should be larger, but I''m not sure I want to look at a huge set of lips.</td>', 'Interesting.  Nice juxtaposition of elements, but I think a portrait should be of the whole face.  I want to say the picture should be larger, but I''m not sure I want to look at a huge set of lips.', '2005-09-13 12:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1703355, 230044, 14620, '<td valign="top">What a great portrait.  Nice natural looking expression, great smile and you seem to have captured her personality well, an important thing for a portrait, I think anyways.  One thing I might do differently is drop the reds just a little bit.  The shirt seems to be grabbing to much of my attention away from her and drawing my eyes down.  I also might use the healing tool to get rid of the that little hair on her nose.   Overall, a very nice portrait.</td>', 'What a great portrait.  Nice natural looking expression, great smile and you seem to have captured her personality well, an important thing for a portrait, I think anyways.  One thing I might do differently is drop the reds just a little bit.  The shirt seems to be grabbing to much of my attention away from her and drawing my eyes down.  I also might use the healing tool to get rid of the that little hair on her nose.   Overall, a very nice portrait.', '2005-09-13 12:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
