(1703836, 230111, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Great photo.  Congratulations.   I can''t help but be drawn to her eyes, and sorry if this is rude, but it appears her left eye (our right when viewing) appears larger.  The white space makes it more evident.<br/> <br/>Anyway...very pretty girl.  Nice lighting, composition and DOF.  Good luck on the challenge.</td>', 'Wow!  Great photo.  Congratulations.   I can''t help but be drawn to her eyes, and sorry if this is rude, but it appears her left eye (our right when viewing) appears larger.  The white space makes it more evident. Anyway...very pretty girl.  Nice lighting, composition and DOF.  Good luck on the challenge.', '2005-09-13 13:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1703837, 228161, 37961, '<td valign="top">You caught a really good expression here with her. Lighting is wonderful. What a cute kid.</td>', 'You caught a really good expression here with her. Lighting is wonderful. What a cute kid.', '2005-09-13 13:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1703838, 230329, 28882, '<td valign="top">the dark shirt and the black background make his head appear to be floating.  cool shot though</td>', 'the dark shirt and the black background make his head appear to be floating.  cool shot though', '2005-09-13 13:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1703842, 229945, 28882, '<td valign="top">great subject, just needs work on lighting and sharpness some</td>', 'great subject, just needs work on lighting and sharpness some', '2005-09-13 13:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1703847, 229663, 28882, '<td valign="top">try taking/cropping vertically, see what you think, and a tripod or more steady support.</td>', 'try taking/cropping vertically, see what you think, and a tripod or more steady support.', '2005-09-13 13:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1703848, 230280, 43565, '<td valign="top">I have viewed this picture several times, and my first thought every time is I hope I don''t meet these people when I am walking alone. I wasn''t sure how to vote, but a lot of what I have been looking for is personality or emotion, and that is certainly present here.</td>', 'I have viewed this picture several times, and my first thought every time is I hope I don''t meet these people when I am walking alone. I wasn''t sure how to vote, but a lot of what I have been looking for is personality or emotion, and that is certainly present here.', '2005-09-13 13:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1703849, 228850, 35739, '<td valign="top">Not too sure about the glare on the young mans head.</td>', 'Not too sure about the glare on the young mans head.', '2005-09-13 13:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1703852, 229711, 28882, '<td valign="top">nice tree.</td>', 'nice tree.', '2005-09-13 13:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
