(1704000, 230218, 43565, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like the pose, as the brown in his face gets lost against his body and the saddle.</td>', 'I don''t really like the pose, as the brown in his face gets lost against his body and the saddle.', '2005-09-13 14:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
