(1704037, 230280, 16106, '<td valign="top">good use of a narrow palate of colors, but whatever is going on over the fence is distracting fron the guys. given the attitued on display i don''t know if you could have gotten them to sit down , but this would have worked better if all that was behind them was a fence.</td>', 'good use of a narrow palate of colors, but whatever is going on over the fence is distracting fron the guys. given the attitued on display i don''t know if you could have gotten them to sit down , but this would have worked better if all that was behind them was a fence.', '2005-09-13 14:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704040, 230265, 43565, '<td valign="top">I don''t see any personality here.</td>', 'I don''t see any personality here.', '2005-09-13 14:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704057, 229563, 35545, '<td valign="top">I don''t mind that the subject is standing in an alley, but there''s a lot of distracting stuff in the background.  Nice expression on the girl''s face and good colors.</td>', 'I don''t mind that the subject is standing in an alley, but there''s a lot of distracting stuff in the background.  Nice expression on the girl''s face and good colors.', '2005-09-13 14:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704062, 230336, 14986, '<td valign="top">Cute idea and it works somewhat for me.   The lighting seems to be well done, although the lighter complexion seems maybe a bit washed out.  Colors and tones seem really good other than that, and I especially like that the eyes stand out.  I would really have preferred just one model right side up, laying down.   The two model pose is unique (somewhat) but just hard to look at for me. <br/> <br/></td>', 'Cute idea and it works somewhat for me.   The lighting seems to be well done, although the lighter complexion seems maybe a bit washed out.  Colors and tones seem really good other than that, and I especially like that the eyes stand out.  I would really have preferred just one model right side up, laying down.   The two model pose is unique (somewhat) but just hard to look at for me.  ', '2005-09-13 14:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704068, 228388, 14986, '<td valign="top">Interesting portrait.  It doesn''t fit my usual understanding of portrait...it seems more journalistic, but that is very subjective (isn''t it all?) so my score is not affected by that.   <br/> <br/>The model and the expression are compelling and captured well.   The background, even though blurred, is still a bit distracting for me.  I like seeing some of the people - it does set the model off a bit - but the composition as is has the backgroud crowd and the model competing too much for my attention I think.<br/> <br/>Good colors and lighting.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Interesting portrait.  It doesn''t fit my usual understanding of portrait...it seems more journalistic, but that is very subjective (isn''t it all?) so my score is not affected by that.    The model and the expression are compelling and captured well.   The background, even though blurred, is still a bit distracting for me.  I like seeing some of the people - it does set the model off a bit - but the composition as is has the backgroud crowd and the model competing too much for my attention I think. Good colors and lighting.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-09-13 14:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704076, 228781, 14986, '<td valign="top">For some reason, this one feels just a bit too much "in my face"....too close.   I don''t really know why that is because I like the portrait.  The lighting is good, the clarity and focus are excellent.  Good job bringing attention to the eyes.   I just keep thinking I would like it better backed off just a bit.</td>', 'For some reason, this one feels just a bit too much "in my face"....too close.   I don''t really know why that is because I like the portrait.  The lighting is good, the clarity and focus are excellent.  Good job bringing attention to the eyes.   I just keep thinking I would like it better backed off just a bit.', '2005-09-13 14:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704079, 230376, 26364, '<td valign="top">should have the subject further away from the brick background and blur the background out</td>', 'should have the subject further away from the brick background and blur the background out', '2005-09-13 14:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704082, 227640, 14986, '<td valign="top">IMO, this would be much better if we could see the eyes.  They are there, but very dark in that shadow.  The way the lighting is now, and the angle, brings the nose to my attention and I don''t think that''s the best feature to focus on.  Colors are good, maybe just a bit oversaturated but I suppose it depends on the look you''re going for.   For me, the grass chewing is also kind of distracting.  I think there would be better ways to bring out personality.   I hope this is helpful.   Just one woman''s opinion!  :)</td>', 'IMO, this would be much better if we could see the eyes.  They are there, but very dark in that shadow.  The way the lighting is now, and the angle, brings the nose to my attention and I don''t think that''s the best feature to focus on.  Colors are good, maybe just a bit oversaturated but I suppose it depends on the look you''re going for.   For me, the grass chewing is also kind of distracting.  I think there would be better ways to bring out personality.   I hope this is helpful.   Just one woman''s opinion!  :)', '2005-09-13 14:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704088, 229683, 14986, '<td valign="top">Nice soft lighting.  The pattern in the material he''s resting on takes away my attention a bit, but other than that the facial features are photographed very well.  Nice catchlights.  Expression is rather bland or sad, but not too bad really.   Overall very nice job, I would just change that front pattern.    Hope this is helpful!</td>', 'Nice soft lighting.  The pattern in the material he''s resting on takes away my attention a bit, but other than that the facial features are photographed very well.  Nice catchlights.  Expression is rather bland or sad, but not too bad really.   Overall very nice job, I would just change that front pattern.    Hope this is helpful!', '2005-09-13 14:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704093, 230111, 26364, '<td valign="top">very nice, I like the skin tones and shade of lip gloss. Very delicate looking</td>', 'very nice, I like the skin tones and shade of lip gloss. Very delicate looking', '2005-09-13 14:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704094, 228504, 16046, '<td valign="top">devilish image, well done, should place high</td>', 'devilish image, well done, should place high', '2005-09-13 14:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704104, 229634, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely lady, but  I would like see more focus on her freatures and less on the background and apparel.  She is dark in comparison to the background and my eyes are first drawn to the bright green in the sunshine.  Her eyes kind of get lost as the lighting on her is all evenly dark.   Her expression also doesn''t seem to fit with what she''s wearing.  With sparkle and cleavage like that I would like to see a more playful, sexy look.   She just seems bored to me here.   Also, although she appears to be very tan,  the tone seems very red hued.  <br/> <br/>She''s a lovely model and hopefully you''ll have the chance to keep working with her to practice more portrait work.   Just one woman''s opinion but I hope this is helpful.</td>', 'This is a lovely lady, but  I would like see more focus on her freatures and less on the background and apparel.  She is dark in comparison to the background and my eyes are first drawn to the bright green in the sunshine.  Her eyes kind of get lost as the lighting on her is all evenly dark.   Her expression also doesn''t seem to fit with what she''s wearing.  With sparkle and cleavage like that I would like to see a more playful, sexy look.   She just seems bored to me here.   Also, although she appears to be very tan,  the tone seems very red hued.   She''s a lovely model and hopefully you''ll have the chance to keep working with her to practice more portrait work.   Just one woman''s opinion but I hope this is helpful.', '2005-09-13 14:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704106, 230357, 11895, '<td valign="top">this strikes me as a well executed shot that has suffered from to much manipulation, the darkening in the corners, and the lightness of her face are anything but subtle; maybe a tighter crop would have woked better</td>', 'this strikes me as a well executed shot that has suffered from to much manipulation, the darkening in the corners, and the lightness of her face are anything but subtle; maybe a tighter crop would have woked better', '2005-09-13 14:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704112, 230223, 16046, '<td valign="top">creative, great model</td>', 'creative, great model', '2005-09-13 14:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704116, 229954, 14986, '<td valign="top">This shot has interest...makes the viewer wonder what she''s looking at.   It doesn''t really fit my definition of "portrait", but the score is not affected by that.  This seems more candid or photojournalistic in nature.  <br/> <br/>I like the contrast and colors.  I can''t decide if that guy in the background helps or distracts...maybe a little of both?   Anyway,  I like the fact that this is different, that the focus is definitely on the model and that we see some expression of interest on her face.    Just one woman''s opinion but I hope this is helpful.</td>', 'This shot has interest...makes the viewer wonder what she''s looking at.   It doesn''t really fit my definition of "portrait", but the score is not affected by that.  This seems more candid or photojournalistic in nature.   I like the contrast and colors.  I can''t decide if that guy in the background helps or distracts...maybe a little of both?   Anyway,  I like the fact that this is different, that the focus is definitely on the model and that we see some expression of interest on her face.    Just one woman''s opinion but I hope this is helpful.', '2005-09-13 14:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704120, 229949, 24913, '<td valign="top">Would like the eyes to be in focus....</td>', 'Would like the eyes to be in focus....', '2005-09-13 15:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704121, 228978, 11254, '<td valign="top">nice:)</td>', 'nice:)', '2005-09-13 15:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704130, 230058, 14986, '<td valign="top">A couple of suggestions I would give for this one.   The overall feel, while I''m sure is meant to be soft, also feels out of focus to me.  I think a big part of that is from the large fall of hair on her shoulder that is all out of focus.  <br/> <br/>The eyes also seem dark.   The muted tones can work, but I would still like to see more lightness in the whites of the eyes.  As it is, the whites almost match the skin tone, which really loses the focus on them.    The muted tones also seem to make the bottom rim of the eyes kinda pink, like she''s been crying or something.<br/>  Just one woman''s opinion but I hope this is helpful.<br/></td>', 'A couple of suggestions I would give for this one.   The overall feel, while I''m sure is meant to be soft, also feels out of focus to me.  I think a big part of that is from the large fall of hair on her shoulder that is all out of focus.   The eyes also seem dark.   The muted tones can work, but I would still like to see more lightness in the whites of the eyes.  As it is, the whites almost match the skin tone, which really loses the focus on them.    The muted tones also seem to make the bottom rim of the eyes kinda pink, like she''s been crying or something.  Just one woman''s opinion but I hope this is helpful.', '2005-09-13 15:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704133, 230370, 11254, '<td valign="top">how obvious....a photoshop filter...</td>', 'how obvious....a photoshop filter...', '2005-09-13 15:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
