(1704149, 230270, 714, '<td valign="top">Very pretty blue eyes.  It has a different hue tone to it.  almost to much magenta.</td>', 'Very pretty blue eyes.  It has a different hue tone to it.  almost to much magenta.', '2005-09-13 15:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
