(1704437, 228531, 43565, '<td valign="top">By definition this is a portrait, but I don''t really learn anything about her and the subject seems to be the blue not the person.</td>', 'By definition this is a portrait, but I don''t really learn anything about her and the subject seems to be the blue not the person.', '2005-09-13 16:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704439, 227430, 29748, '<td valign="top">A little blurry</td>', 'A little blurry', '2005-09-13 16:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704442, 229696, 29748, '<td valign="top">nice contrast, but eyes are clear, and cheeks and forehead are blurred or soft.</td>', 'nice contrast, but eyes are clear, and cheeks and forehead are blurred or soft.', '2005-09-13 16:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704444, 228847, 29748, '<td valign="top">too much red on skin</td>', 'too much red on skin', '2005-09-13 16:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704446, 229608, 29748, '<td valign="top">very sweet</td>', 'very sweet', '2005-09-13 16:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704447, 229795, 40819, '<td valign="top">Isn''t a portrait a face?</td>', 'Isn''t a portrait a face?', '2005-09-13 16:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704449, 229902, 29748, '<td valign="top">great job.</td>', 'great job.', '2005-09-13 16:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704450, 230058, 43565, '<td valign="top">This looks like a sepia portrait with green eyes instead of a color portrait.</td>', 'This looks like a sepia portrait with green eyes instead of a color portrait.', '2005-09-13 16:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704451, 229446, 26756, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites.  Hope it does well.  Love the wood wall, the shadows and the mood.</td>', 'One of my favorites.  Hope it does well.  Love the wood wall, the shadows and the mood.', '2005-09-13 16:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704452, 230233, 29748, '<td valign="top">???</td>', '???', '2005-09-13 16:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704454, 229083, 26756, '<td valign="top">Caught a perfect expression, awesome pic.</td>', 'Caught a perfect expression, awesome pic.', '2005-09-13 16:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704455, 230172, 29748, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, good tones and colors.</td>', 'Beautiful, good tones and colors.', '2005-09-13 16:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704456, 229729, 43565, '<td valign="top">Neat idea. I don''t really like the glare on the lenses since the eyes are the focal point. I am also not sure this is really a portrait.</td>', 'Neat idea. I don''t really like the glare on the lenses since the eyes are the focal point. I am also not sure this is really a portrait.', '2005-09-13 16:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704458, 229710, 29748, '<td valign="top">Hat band in the backround behind ear is very distracting.</td>', 'Hat band in the backround behind ear is very distracting.', '2005-09-13 16:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704459, 230363, 40819, '<td valign="top">Not a portrai.</td>', 'Not a portrai.', '2005-09-13 16:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704463, 229967, 29748, '<td valign="top">Cute but light reflection on side of face is a little distracting.</td>', 'Cute but light reflection on side of face is a little distracting.', '2005-09-13 16:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704464, 227656, 29748, '<td valign="top">wow, beautiful</td>', 'wow, beautiful', '2005-09-13 16:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704466, 229884, 40819, '<td valign="top">How to screw up a cute face, sometimes a little knowledge is dangerous. Sorry I don''t like this I know it wasn''t easy but still not for me.</td>', 'How to screw up a cute face, sometimes a little knowledge is dangerous. Sorry I don''t like this I know it wasn''t easy but still not for me.', '2005-09-13 16:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704468, 230174, 26756, '<td valign="top">One of the most interesting shots.  This took a lot of work and is very artistic.  I think you chose correctly with keeping her eyes shut, not sure.  Beautiful colors and very interesting composition.  For some reason I have a feeling it won''t be well received but I like it.</td>', 'One of the most interesting shots.  This took a lot of work and is very artistic.  I think you chose correctly with keeping her eyes shut, not sure.  Beautiful colors and very interesting composition.  For some reason I have a feeling it won''t be well received but I like it.', '2005-09-13 16:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704471, 229795, 43565, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of emotion here, but it is not what I consider a portrait.</td>', 'There is a lot of emotion here, but it is not what I consider a portrait.', '2005-09-13 16:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704473, 230370, 40819, '<td valign="top">yuck another where to many hands spoiled the soup. I bet she is really pretty and it would have been better to let her inner beauty shine.</td>', 'yuck another where to many hands spoiled the soup. I bet she is really pretty and it would have been better to let her inner beauty shine.', '2005-09-13 16:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704475, 229673, 40819, '<td valign="top">OMG She is cute</td>', 'OMG She is cute', '2005-09-13 16:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704481, 229902, 26756, '<td valign="top">Simple, clean and straightforward.  Lighting is nice in most areas of the pic.  Maybe a half stop hot in some places but not bad.  Lighting in the hair is great.  Like the dark on dark look.</td>', 'Simple, clean and straightforward.  Lighting is nice in most areas of the pic.  Maybe a half stop hot in some places but not bad.  Lighting in the hair is great.  Like the dark on dark look.', '2005-09-13 16:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704485, 229865, 18349, '<td valign="top">...and you remain beautiful!  Pink is a great color for you as well!  Wonderful light, great sharpness, and unique.  Wonderful job, Mambe!  :) :) :)</td>', '...and you remain beautiful!  Pink is a great color for you as well!  Wonderful light, great sharpness, and unique.  Wonderful job, Mambe!  :) :) :)', '2005-09-13 16:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704486, 230361, 43565, '<td valign="top">This is a snapshot, not a portrait. There is no interaction between mother and child, no control of the background, and the only emotion seems to be boredom.</td>', 'This is a snapshot, not a portrait. There is no interaction between mother and child, no control of the background, and the only emotion seems to be boredom.', '2005-09-13 16:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704487, 229673, 26756, '<td valign="top">Yeah I''d say so.  Like all of it.  Nice pose and striking eyes.  Love the colors against the black background.  Really well executed.</td>', 'Yeah I''d say so.  Like all of it.  Nice pose and striking eyes.  Love the colors against the black background.  Really well executed.', '2005-09-13 16:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704489, 230101, 43565, '<td valign="top">Interesting ides, but for a portrait I would rather see his eyes.</td>', 'Interesting ides, but for a portrait I would rather see his eyes.', '2005-09-13 16:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704492, 230115, 43565, '<td valign="top">But they are not in focus! I also don''t like the sun/shadow effect.</td>', 'But they are not in focus! I also don''t like the sun/shadow effect.', '2005-09-13 16:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704494, 229751, 26756, '<td valign="top">Technically perfect. Love the green color against her face, great focus and well composed.  Not crazy about the gray background compared to the rest of the photo.</td>', 'Technically perfect. Love the green color against her face, great focus and well composed.  Not crazy about the gray background compared to the rest of the photo.', '2005-09-13 16:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704497, 227575, 43565, '<td valign="top">I do not think this is a portrait.</td>', 'I do not think this is a portrait.', '2005-09-13 16:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704501, 230231, 31443, '<td valign="top">Best of the bunch!</td>', 'Best of the bunch!', '2005-09-13 16:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704502, 230066, 18349, '<td valign="top">One of my personal favorites in the challenge.  Emotive, telling, and technically well-executed.  Lovely treatment as well.  Excellent work.  :)</td>', 'One of my personal favorites in the challenge.  Emotive, telling, and technically well-executed.  Lovely treatment as well.  Excellent work.  :)', '2005-09-13 16:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704504, 230083, 41098, '<td valign="top">the colors are so vivid and crisp... wow. I love the "what?" factor this photo offers, good use of creativity!</td>', 'the colors are so vivid and crisp... wow. I love the "what?" factor this photo offers, good use of creativity!', '2005-09-13 16:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704505, 230324, 29748, '<td valign="top">way too much contrast, edges are grainy.</td>', 'way too much contrast, edges are grainy.', '2005-09-13 16:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704506, 228197, 31443, '<td valign="top">What a nice idea, nice lighting but a little too soft..</td>', 'What a nice idea, nice lighting but a little too soft..', '2005-09-13 16:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704507, 229906, 41098, '<td valign="top">Now, I know who you are because of your beautiful "Tapanga" model. She is so capturing! If she isn''t in modeling yet... get her there. Her eyes are priceless and your use of color to contrast them is great</td>', 'Now, I know who you are because of your beautiful "Tapanga" model. She is so capturing! If she isn''t in modeling yet... get her there. Her eyes are priceless and your use of color to contrast them is great', '2005-09-13 16:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704508, 230100, 5286, '<td valign="top">A nice picture of a very sweet girl. The light here is very warm, and her hair and cheeks are lit up. IMO, using a warmly colored background in this light rather than the neutral-cool green-gray would have enhanced this picture tremendously. Also the focus on the eyes could be a little sharper. I''d also try a tighter crop from the top and right.</td>', 'A nice picture of a very sweet girl. The light here is very warm, and her hair and cheeks are lit up. IMO, using a warmly colored background in this light rather than the neutral-cool green-gray would have enhanced this picture tremendously. Also the focus on the eyes could be a little sharper. I''d also try a tighter crop from the top and right.', '2005-09-13 16:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704509, 230111, 41098, '<td valign="top">Wow... she will be killer when she gets older! I love the perspective and use of natural colors. The overall composition is good and the focus is fantastic. Perhaps some lip gloss to balance the shiney eyes. ?</td>', 'Wow... she will be killer when she gets older! I love the perspective and use of natural colors. The overall composition is good and the focus is fantastic. Perhaps some lip gloss to balance the shiney eyes. ?', '2005-09-13 16:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704512, 228978, 41098, '<td valign="top">So fiesty... I love the personality and use of the person not just typical tools like color and background. :)</td>', 'So fiesty... I love the personality and use of the person not just typical tools like color and background. :)', '2005-09-13 16:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704513, 230113, 41098, '<td valign="top">I love the use of the picture spacing and the title... his little eyes ar so gordeous. Great work</td>', 'I love the use of the picture spacing and the title... his little eyes ar so gordeous. Great work', '2005-09-13 16:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704514, 229000, 41098, '<td valign="top">Gosh does she look like the actress off of beetlejuice.... wow. The colors and focus are great and the lipstick is so.... um, different!</td>', 'Gosh does she look like the actress off of beetlejuice.... wow. The colors and focus are great and the lipstick is so.... um, different!', '2005-09-13 16:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704516, 228939, 5286, '<td valign="top">There''s definitely some intensity that''s been captured here. The noise on the right isn''t very appealing though, and given the dark mood of the picture, it might have been better with a darker background in place of the white on the right.</td>', 'There''s definitely some intensity that''s been captured here. The noise on the right isn''t very appealing though, and given the dark mood of the picture, it might have been better with a darker background in place of the white on the right.', '2005-09-13 16:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704518, 229774, 31443, '<td valign="top">What a cute contrast, beautiful!</td>', 'What a cute contrast, beautiful!', '2005-09-13 17:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704519, 229906, 18349, '<td valign="top">Just stunning, as usual!!!!  I think you and she make an exquisite team.  You''re both going places!!!!  :)</td>', 'Just stunning, as usual!!!!  I think you and she make an exquisite team.  You''re both going places!!!!  :)', '2005-09-13 17:00:30.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1704520, 230233, 41098, '<td valign="top">wow, so dark and demanding. I love the emotion that flows with the picture. Great creativity!</td>', 'wow, so dark and demanding. I love the emotion that flows with the picture. Great creativity!', '2005-09-13 17:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704521, 229574, 29748, '<td valign="top">blinds in backround distract from subject</td>', 'blinds in backround distract from subject', '2005-09-13 17:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704524, 230336, 41098, '<td valign="top">Unique pose and use of two models.... I think if their facial color were the same or more different or perhaps if they had matching lipstick it would bring them even closer together.</td>', 'Unique pose and use of two models.... I think if their facial color were the same or more different or perhaps if they had matching lipstick it would bring them even closer together.', '2005-09-13 17:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704525, 227855, 5286, '<td valign="top">Pretty model, and nice catchlights in her eyes! The lighting on the face is nice too!  IMO, though, the expression is a little too intense to speak of innocence. I also wonder why the red shawl/scarf is used, since it does not add to the picture in any way except to give it a snapshotty look. I''d also have left more space on the top and less at the bottom, to focus more easily on the eyes.</td>', 'Pretty model, and nice catchlights in her eyes! The lighting on the face is nice too!  IMO, though, the expression is a little too intense to speak of innocence. I also wonder why the red shawl/scarf is used, since it does not add to the picture in any way except to give it a snapshotty look. I''d also have left more space on the top and less at the bottom, to focus more easily on the eyes.', '2005-09-13 17:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704527, 228161, 5286, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit OOF or is it just me? I''d also try a tighter crop from the top.</td>', 'Seems a bit OOF or is it just me? I''d also try a tighter crop from the top.', '2005-09-13 17:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704530, 230341, 39249, '<td valign="top">Wow. Maybe someday I''ll reack this level of photographic genius. Or was it luck? I dunno. Awesome shot, awesome color. Wow.</td>', 'Wow. Maybe someday I''ll reack this level of photographic genius. Or was it luck? I dunno. Awesome shot, awesome color. Wow.', '2005-09-13 17:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704532, 228591, 18349, '<td valign="top">Hopper, to not only have exceptional photographic talent but also such a beautiful model at your fingertips is just a double blessing!!!  Wonderful image, as usual.  :)</td>', 'Hopper, to not only have exceptional photographic talent but also such a beautiful model at your fingertips is just a double blessing!!!  Wonderful image, as usual.  :)', '2005-09-13 17:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704533, 228591, 41098, '<td valign="top">I think this particular pose makes her arms look really fat... not very flattering to the model. Perhaps a hands on the arms facial shot, because she is so pretty. Also, the lines in the background are very distracting, but great focus and centering</td>', 'I think this particular pose makes her arms look really fat... not very flattering to the model. Perhaps a hands on the arms facial shot, because she is so pretty. Also, the lines in the background are very distracting, but great focus and centering', '2005-09-13 17:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704534, 229727, 18349, '<td valign="top">Joey, she''s just as lovely in this image as in the others I''ve seen you post before.  Wonderful portrait, technically well-executed, and interesting surroundings that match the feel of the image.  Very nice work.  :)</td>', 'Joey, she''s just as lovely in this image as in the others I''ve seen you post before.  Wonderful portrait, technically well-executed, and interesting surroundings that match the feel of the image.  Very nice work.  :)', '2005-09-13 17:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704536, 230370, 41098, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been nearly a 6 or 7 if you hadn''t used the warp effect. I love the models emotion and unique pose... grrrrrr</td>', 'I think this would have been nearly a 6 or 7 if you hadn''t used the warp effect. I love the models emotion and unique pose... grrrrrr', '2005-09-13 17:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704539, 230111, 40819, '<td valign="top">One of the first rules I learned about photography was, when you think you are close enough, move closer. This image proves that is correct. Very well done and she is cute too. Good for you.</td>', 'One of the first rules I learned about photography was, when you think you are close enough, move closer. This image proves that is correct. Very well done and she is cute too. Good for you.', '2005-09-13 17:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704540, 229751, 5286, '<td valign="top">Very nice skin :P. Just realized that the catchlights in the eyes are a little spread out. Also, I''m not liking the green color and how it goes with the gray of the background. Perhaps a darker shawl would work better? Also, I''m noticing (sorry so late :P) a pixelation/unsmoothness near (her) right lip...</td>', 'Very nice skin :P. Just realized that the catchlights in the eyes are a little spread out. Also, I''m not liking the green color and how it goes with the gray of the background. Perhaps a darker shawl would work better? Also, I''m noticing (sorry so late :P) a pixelation/unsmoothness near (her) right lip...', '2005-09-13 17:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704544, 228847, 18349, '<td valign="top">Cher, this is really cute and it does look "just like you!"  I can see your skills as a photographer developing over time.  Very well done.  I might suggest to work on the eyes a tiny bit more to remove the red, but that could also be enhanced by this crappy monitor I have at work so ignore me.  ;)  Anyway, great shot.  :)</td>', 'Cher, this is really cute and it does look "just like you!"  I can see your skills as a photographer developing over time.  Very well done.  I might suggest to work on the eyes a tiny bit more to remove the red, but that could also be enhanced by this crappy monitor I have at work so ignore me.  ;)  Anyway, great shot.  :)', '2005-09-13 17:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704545, 229949, 5286, '<td valign="top">Why the title? I feel the focus could have been sharper on the eyes. Also, the crop feels just a bit too tight...</td>', 'Why the title? I feel the focus could have been sharper on the eyes. Also, the crop feels just a bit too tight...', '2005-09-13 17:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704546, 230278, 5286, '<td valign="top">Great idea, great lighting. Wish more of the eye would show, though.</td>', 'Great idea, great lighting. Wish more of the eye would show, though.', '2005-09-13 17:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704547, 230108, 31443, '<td valign="top">Really nice photo, hope this will be appreciated as a portrait..</td>', 'Really nice photo, hope this will be appreciated as a portrait..', '2005-09-13 17:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704548, 230145, 5286, '<td valign="top">Very pretty model, and nice lighting on her. I feel the background is more distracting, esp. so because of the border. A close crop on this same picture on her face would be a lot more interesting photographically.</td>', 'Very pretty model, and nice lighting on her. I feel the background is more distracting, esp. so because of the border. A close crop on this same picture on her face would be a lot more interesting photographically.', '2005-09-13 17:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704551, 230172, 5286, '<td valign="top">Almost a painting like quality. Great colors too, with the gold of the hair and the blue of the eyes. Jus tone little nit: the focus seems to be sharpest somewhere _between_ the eye and the lips, and not at the eyes. I''d have liked at least one eye to be sharper...</td>', 'Almost a painting like quality. Great colors too, with the gold of the hair and the blue of the eyes. Jus tone little nit: the focus seems to be sharpest somewhere _between_ the eye and the lips, and not at the eyes. I''d have liked at least one eye to be sharper...', '2005-09-13 17:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704552, 229711, 43565, '<td valign="top">I would like to see more Aiden and less tree. The three fences in the baackground are a little distracting</td>', 'I would like to see more Aiden and less tree. The three fences in the baackground are a little distracting', '2005-09-13 17:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704554, 230272, 5286, '<td valign="top">Very nice light and focus. But I don''t see the need for the left hand side at all. Although I guess you wanted it to convey the mode of relaxation, it''s just a blown out patch of white and is more distracting.</td>', 'Very nice light and focus. But I don''t see the need for the left hand side at all. Although I guess you wanted it to convey the mode of relaxation, it''s just a blown out patch of white and is more distracting.', '2005-09-13 17:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704556, 229884, 43565, '<td valign="top">This is interesting, but a little too far out for me</td>', 'This is interesting, but a little too far out for me', '2005-09-13 17:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704558, 230083, 29658, '<td valign="top">That''s simply perfect: 10 (I can''t give more).</td>', 'That''s simply perfect: 10 (I can''t give more).', '2005-09-13 17:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704560, 228197, 34930, '<td valign="top">beautiful. The lighting and the model capture the true emotions of the paiting. Lovely work.</td>', 'beautiful. The lighting and the model capture the true emotions of the paiting. Lovely work.', '2005-09-13 17:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704562, 229744, 43565, '<td valign="top">I am distracted by all the color. I think if the backgound had been black or a really dark color this would have worked better.</td>', 'I am distracted by all the color. I think if the backgound had been black or a really dark color this would have worked better.', '2005-09-13 17:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704563, 230367, 29658, '<td valign="top">The picture is not sharp, but it doesn''t seem a problem with DOF (maybe focus?)</td>', 'The picture is not sharp, but it doesn''t seem a problem with DOF (maybe focus?)', '2005-09-13 17:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704567, 229378, 14509, '<td valign="top">I think this is the cutest pose so far. Lovely. I hope you reach the top 10.</td>', 'I think this is the cutest pose so far. Lovely. I hope you reach the top 10.', '2005-09-13 17:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704569, 230359, 29658, '<td valign="top">Should it be in another challenge?</td>', 'Should it be in another challenge?', '2005-09-13 17:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704571, 230229, 43565, '<td valign="top">I think in a portrait with more than one person they should be connected somehow.</td>', 'I think in a portrait with more than one person they should be connected somehow.', '2005-09-13 17:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704572, 228857, 14509, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait. I like the softness of her skin, yet her eyes are perfectly sharp. Well done. Hope this reaches the top 10.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait. I like the softness of her skin, yet her eyes are perfectly sharp. Well done. Hope this reaches the top 10.', '2005-09-13 17:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704573, 228910, 29658, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and the atmosphere, but I''d have cropped it differently.</td>', 'I like the subject and the atmosphere, but I''d have cropped it differently.', '2005-09-13 17:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704574, 230153, 43565, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this is a portrait</td>', 'I don''t think this is a portrait', '2005-09-13 17:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704576, 228826, 43565, '<td valign="top">Would like a crisper image</td>', 'Would like a crisper image', '2005-09-13 17:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704578, 230336, 14509, '<td valign="top">They are beautiful and having amazing eyes. I like their opposing poses. Great point of view. Hope this reaches the top 10.</td>', 'They are beautiful and having amazing eyes. I like their opposing poses. Great point of view. Hope this reaches the top 10.', '2005-09-13 17:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704579, 230363, 29658, '<td valign="top">You have some dust in the sensor! Nice picture!</td>', 'You have some dust in the sensor! Nice picture!', '2005-09-13 17:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704580, 229691, 43565, '<td valign="top">This looks like a picture taken while trying to get a portrait shot!</td>', 'This looks like a picture taken while trying to get a portrait shot!', '2005-09-13 17:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704581, 229083, 14509, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Love his expression. Good composition and colours. Well done.</td>', 'Great shot! Love his expression. Good composition and colours. Well done.', '2005-09-13 17:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704582, 229089, 5286, '<td valign="top">Killer shot. Would have been a winner in the perspective challenge too. Great angle, great light, great model! Hope this does really well!</td>', 'Killer shot. Would have been a winner in the perspective challenge too. Great angle, great light, great model! Hope this does really well!', '2005-09-13 17:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704583, 229004, 14509, '<td valign="top">Very pleasing shot.</td>', 'Very pleasing shot.', '2005-09-13 17:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1704587, 230297, 34930, '<td valign="top">This photograph brought back a sudden tumble of memories of what it felt like to be a small again, playing out side in the autumn air as the sun is sinking low. Her expression tells it all like a story book come to life. Wonderful.</td>', 'This photograph brought back a sudden tumble of memories of what it felt like to be a small again, playing out side in the autumn air as the sun is sinking low. Her expression tells it all like a story book come to life. Wonderful.', '2005-09-13 17:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
