(1705257, 228703, 27514, '<td valign="top">I love your vision for this shot. this is almost flawless tech., aside from a little noise you hit it just right. the pose lacks though. first of all the hands are very confusing and makes it stressful to view. The hair is very messy and that adds to the stress level in the frame the face does look very good though. the shirt in the back makes the shot seem unbalanced. overall great vision for the frame though</td>', 'I love your vision for this shot. this is almost flawless tech., aside from a little noise you hit it just right. the pose lacks though. first of all the hands are very confusing and makes it stressful to view. The hair is very messy and that adds to the stress level in the frame the face does look very good though. the shirt in the back makes the shot seem unbalanced. overall great vision for the frame though', '2005-09-13 21:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1705258, 229980, 7304, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Composed well. Just a bit harsh on the flash. It shows in the cheeks and forearm.</td>', 'Nice image. Composed well. Just a bit harsh on the flash. It shows in the cheeks and forearm.', '2005-09-13 21:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1705261, 229941, 7304, '<td valign="top">Different approach but fun. Nice and crisp. Well balanced. 8</td>', 'Different approach but fun. Nice and crisp. Well balanced. 8', '2005-09-13 21:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1705264, 230369, 30018, '<td valign="top">A beautiful image.  Love the red veil against the black background.  The skin tones pick up the red from the veil as well, and the eyes are piercing.  The texture in the veil is outstanding, as is the detail in the face itself.  This image should do quite well.  Good luck!  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'A beautiful image.  Love the red veil against the black background.  The skin tones pick up the red from the veil as well, and the eyes are piercing.  The texture in the veil is outstanding, as is the detail in the face itself.  This image should do quite well.  Good luck!  <8>', '2005-09-13 21:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1705269, 229578, 7304, '<td valign="top">Cute image but the big black border competes with the black hair of the beautiful girl. Stll good. 7</td>', 'Cute image but the big black border competes with the black hair of the beautiful girl. Stll good. 7', '2005-09-13 21:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1705271, 229971, 30018, '<td valign="top">The Bright Orange is outstanding against the dark background, but the White Balance seems to be off a touch, as the model''s skin looks a tad yellow.  Nice composition.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'The Bright Orange is outstanding against the dark background, but the White Balance seems to be off a touch, as the model''s skin looks a tad yellow.  Nice composition.  <7>', '2005-09-13 21:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
