(1705282, 227597, 30018, '<td valign="top">Just Turned Eight?!?!?  Daddy, I feel sorry for you.  This very beautiful man-killer is not only incredibly beautiful for her age, but also seems to know a little about modeling.  Wonderful capture of the colors in her hari, and face.  All of that against the black background make for a very outstanding image.  Nice job with the fan to blow the hair and take this image a notch higher!  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'Just Turned Eight?!?!?  Daddy, I feel sorry for you.  This very beautiful man-killer is not only incredibly beautiful for her age, but also seems to know a little about modeling.  Wonderful capture of the colors in her hari, and face.  All of that against the black background make for a very outstanding image.  Nice job with the fan to blow the hair and take this image a notch higher!  <8>', '2005-09-13 21:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1705283, 229673, 7304, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Love the red hair and freckles. Composed well. 9</td>', 'Nice image. Love the red hair and freckles. Composed well. 9', '2005-09-13 21:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1705290, 228857, 30018, '<td valign="top">Incredible eyes, and lushess lips.  Beautiful model, and you''ve captured some beautiful colors in this portrait.  The range of colors and the fine composition will carry this image far.  Wow, what eyes!  &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'Incredible eyes, and lushess lips.  Beautiful model, and you''ve captured some beautiful colors in this portrait.  The range of colors and the fine composition will carry this image far.  Wow, what eyes!  <9>', '2005-09-13 22:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1705292, 230071, 30018, '<td valign="top">Great color, and great expression  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Great color, and great expression  <7>', '2005-09-13 22:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1705293, 228591, 27514, '<td valign="top">I like the look in the models eyes. The shot is done very well tech. kudos on that. Now lets talk about the pose. The hand is stretching the face way out of proportion and the length of the pose is pulling focal points way to far back in the grame. the crease in the arm on the left side is distracting and the shade of lipstick doesn''t match the skin tone. I do like the hiar and light on the face. I like where the left hand is also  great shot overall</td>', 'I like the look in the models eyes. The shot is done very well tech. kudos on that. Now lets talk about the pose. The hand is stretching the face way out of proportion and the length of the pose is pulling focal points way to far back in the grame. the crease in the arm on the left side is distracting and the shade of lipstick doesn''t match the skin tone. I do like the hiar and light on the face. I like where the left hand is also  great shot overall', '2005-09-13 22:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1705296, 230347, 554, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done portrate....just the right amount of softness...10<br/></td>', 'Very nicely done portrate....just the right amount of softness...10', '2005-09-13 22:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
