(1705305, 230299, 7304, '<td valign="top">Like this shot and the feeling it gives but it is a bit burned out with flash or light of some kind. I would have rated it higher than a 6 because it had so much potential.</td>', 'Like this shot and the feeling it gives but it is a bit burned out with flash or light of some kind. I would have rated it higher than a 6 because it had so much potential.', '2005-09-13 22:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
