(1705376, 230046, 41522, '<td valign="top">f I can be so bold as to make a few suggestions ... the centre composition of your model is a bit static -  would have liked to have seen a off-centred composiion.  The background is a bi of a distraction - there is no rule that the background has to be blurred but in this case, the details of the background take too much focus from your model.  Finally, the expression, to me, doesn''t match your title.</td>', 'f I can be so bold as to make a few suggestions ... the centre composition of your model is a bit static -  would have liked to have seen a off-centred composiion.  The background is a bi of a distraction - there is no rule that the background has to be blurred but in this case, the details of the background take too much focus from your model.  Finally, the expression, to me, doesn''t match your title.', '2005-09-13 22:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
