(1705595, 229727, 33899, '<td valign="top">great shot. i like how the top of the picture starts out as kind of a spot light (upper left) but i wish the bottom had less light. have you heard of the term go-bo? it''s a flag or some board that goes between the light source and the subject to block off light. in your case, i think blocking off a lot of the light below spongebob would have been better.</td>', 'great shot. i like how the top of the picture starts out as kind of a spot light (upper left) but i wish the bottom had less light. have you heard of the term go-bo? it''s a flag or some board that goes between the light source and the subject to block off light. in your case, i think blocking off a lot of the light below spongebob would have been better.', '2005-09-13 23:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
