(1705615, 229980, 33899, '<td valign="top">hmm i dunno if i''m liking the crop on her arm. it''s kind of in between being in the picture and not. the vertical length seems good though. i think the inclusion of the arm would have been better though. it would also have acted more of a frame around her head as well. i like this shot though, great colors and you''ll probably get a lot of comments about bad white balance or warm tones, but i think it goes well with the casualness of this shot</td>', 'hmm i dunno if i''m liking the crop on her arm. it''s kind of in between being in the picture and not. the vertical length seems good though. i think the inclusion of the arm would have been better though. it would also have acted more of a frame around her head as well. i like this shot though, great colors and you''ll probably get a lot of comments about bad white balance or warm tones, but i think it goes well with the casualness of this shot', '2005-09-13 23:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
