(1706177, 229937, 41675, '<td valign="top">With a bit more focus and toning down the highlights on the eyes, I would have scored this higher. Good, tight composition though.</td>', 'With a bit more focus and toning down the highlights on the eyes, I would have scored this higher. Good, tight composition though.', '2005-09-14 00:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1706183, 230359, 41675, '<td valign="top">At first glance, it looked like the log is sitting on top of the wterfall at the left from the angle you shot the photo. Pretty scene though. Honestly, hard for me to score after seeing so many people portraits.....</td>', 'At first glance, it looked like the log is sitting on top of the wterfall at the left from the angle you shot the photo. Pretty scene though. Honestly, hard for me to score after seeing so many people portraits.....', '2005-09-14 00:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1706184, 228978, 7485, '<td valign="top">Okay, that''s just scary. Please tell me that''s wax or plastic and not a fantastically smoothed human skin? Still a 6, because the lighting, composition, and expression are all very good (in fact, could have been a 10 with human looking skin)</td>', 'Okay, that''s just scary. Please tell me that''s wax or plastic and not a fantastically smoothed human skin? Still a 6, because the lighting, composition, and expression are all very good (in fact, could have been a 10 with human looking skin)', '2005-09-14 00:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
