(1706660, 230122, 15511, '<td valign="top">She''s beautiful, and this had a lot of potential, but the colors are wrong, and could (should) have been adjusted, <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=231391" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">like this.</a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-09-19 19:10:58.</i></td>', 'She''s beautiful, and this had a lot of potential, but the colors are wrong, and could (should) have been adjusted, like this.', '2005-09-14 02:05:49.000000', '2005-09-19 20:10:58.000000', 1),
