(1707024, 230158, 37844, '<td valign="top">Profiles are nice sometimes, but often don''t turn out as natural as we would like. It seemed more posed than natural to me because  I feel that her eyes are turned a bit too far showing too much white and her neck  seems like it is also turned past a natural position.  Some catch lights in her eyes would bring more life to the photo.</td>', 'Profiles are nice sometimes, but often don''t turn out as natural as we would like. It seemed more posed than natural to me because  I feel that her eyes are turned a bit too far showing too much white and her neck  seems like it is also turned past a natural position.  Some catch lights in her eyes would bring more life to the photo.', '2005-09-14 03:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707030, 228647, 37844, '<td valign="top">This has a lovely old fashion feel. I think it could have been improved with some reflected light bounced back into her face to  enhance her beauty even more.  I love the pose and the softness of the scene.</td>', 'This has a lovely old fashion feel. I think it could have been improved with some reflected light bounced back into her face to  enhance her beauty even more.  I love the pose and the softness of the scene.', '2005-09-14 03:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707044, 229906, 29269, '<td valign="top">elsapo? Your beautiful model came through beautifully.  Imperfections: one hair above the right eye; right edge of the photo has some noise that could have been either cloned or curved-out.</td>', 'elsapo? Your beautiful model came through beautifully.  Imperfections: one hair above the right eye; right edge of the photo has some noise that could have been either cloned or curved-out.', '2005-09-14 03:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707048, 230145, 37844, '<td valign="top">I feel this photo could be great, but the angle is causing her chest to become the focal point  along with what appears to be the indention of her bra instead of her beautiful eyes.  I feel that if you had turned her body in more toward the camera it would  have took away the too harsh outline of the white against the dark water and at the same time would have erased some of the lines that are running across her neck. This is a lovely model and a great background. The exposure was done very well.</td>', 'I feel this photo could be great, but the angle is causing her chest to become the focal point  along with what appears to be the indention of her bra instead of her beautiful eyes.  I feel that if you had turned her body in more toward the camera it would  have took away the too harsh outline of the white against the dark water and at the same time would have erased some of the lines that are running across her neck. This is a lovely model and a great background. The exposure was done very well.', '2005-09-14 03:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707050, 230172, 37844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and composition.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and composition.', '2005-09-14 03:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707051, 227701, 37844, '<td valign="top">I feel your subject is too far down in your frame and the boy in the background  appears too close to the one in front to make this composition work well. The expression and light on his face make it an interesting photograph.</td>', 'I feel your subject is too far down in your frame and the boy in the background  appears too close to the one in front to make this composition work well. The expression and light on his face make it an interesting photograph.', '2005-09-14 03:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707053, 229383, 37844, '<td valign="top">a nice composition but I am not  seeing anything to give the photo any real punch.</td>', 'a nice composition but I am not  seeing anything to give the photo any real punch.', '2005-09-14 03:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707066, 229981, 37844, '<td valign="top">There seems a slight blur in one of the bottom lens of his glasses that is attracting my eyes, but basically this portrait show as lot of character. Nice job.</td>', 'There seems a slight blur in one of the bottom lens of his glasses that is attracting my eyes, but basically this portrait show as lot of character. Nice job.', '2005-09-14 03:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707068, 228773, 37844, '<td valign="top">I felt that her eyes should have been a bit more sharp in focus  Lovely girl, nice colors.</td>', 'I felt that her eyes should have been a bit more sharp in focus  Lovely girl, nice colors.', '2005-09-14 03:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707072, 227575, 37844, '<td valign="top">The light is hitting the upper lip and I feel it is claiming the attention  instead of the lips and the flower. Nice concept though.</td>', 'The light is hitting the upper lip and I feel it is claiming the attention  instead of the lips and the flower. Nice concept though.', '2005-09-14 03:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707076, 230142, 37844, '<td valign="top">I feel that this would have been more effective for you if your model  had been in darker clothes to connect with her surroundings. as it is, the white is overpowering the scene, taking the focus from the models face and eyes where it should be. a bit  of some catchlights in her eyes would have brought some attention back to her face, but the appear to be lifeless. But I do like your overall theory here and your model is perfect for the scene.</td>', 'I feel that this would have been more effective for you if your model  had been in darker clothes to connect with her surroundings. as it is, the white is overpowering the scene, taking the focus from the models face and eyes where it should be. a bit  of some catchlights in her eyes would have brought some attention back to her face, but the appear to be lifeless. But I do like your overall theory here and your model is perfect for the scene.', '2005-09-14 04:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707078, 229062, 37844, '<td valign="top">What a look!! She''s great.  maybe a tiny bit more light in her left eye to give it as much impact as the right one. But still 10.</td>', 'What a look!! She''s great.  maybe a tiny bit more light in her left eye to give it as much impact as the right one. But still 10.', '2005-09-14 04:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707080, 229937, 37844, '<td valign="top">This is a great capture!1 What an expression. I feel that it is under exposed though.</td>', 'This is a great capture!1 What an expression. I feel that it is under exposed though.', '2005-09-14 04:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707081, 230057, 37844, '<td valign="top">Very good lighting and exposure.</td>', 'Very good lighting and exposure.', '2005-09-14 04:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707084, 230044, 37844, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done, You brought her in close enough  to keep all the focus on her instead of the background which could have been distracting otherwise.  I love the light in her eyes and the smile on her face. I think the lighting you chose fits perfectly and the hairstyle helps to add character.  Good for you, 10.</td>', 'Very nicely done, You brought her in close enough  to keep all the focus on her instead of the background which could have been distracting otherwise.  I love the light in her eyes and the smile on her face. I think the lighting you chose fits perfectly and the hairstyle helps to add character.  Good for you, 10.', '2005-09-14 04:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707089, 229629, 37844, '<td valign="top">This photo appears to be underexposed. The overall appearance is sort of lack luster. the light on his neck appears to separate his head from his torso.</td>', 'This photo appears to be underexposed. The overall appearance is sort of lack luster. the light on his neck appears to separate his head from his torso.', '2005-09-14 04:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707095, 229841, 37844, '<td valign="top">I can see where you were going  with this  having taken several photos of my father similar to this. It''s hard to get that thoughtful , far away look . I think you almost have it here, but his expression is a bit tight, making him look pensive or worried.  Still a great character profile.</td>', 'I can see where you were going  with this  having taken several photos of my father similar to this. It''s hard to get that thoughtful , far away look . I think you almost have it here, but his expression is a bit tight, making him look pensive or worried.  Still a great character profile.', '2005-09-14 04:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
