(1707109, 229252, 37844, '<td valign="top">Only a few small things that I see that could use some tweaking. One is the scarf, it isn''t adding value and appears to be in the way. Another is, even though I love it that he is barefoot, his legs being closer to the camera than the models heads are causing them to overpower somewhat and look out of portion with their bodies. The last thing is the light color knee of the Mom''s jeans. It  isn''t flowing with the overall colors, causing it to stick out too much.  The pose and the expressions are some of the best I have seen here so far .</td>', 'Only a few small things that I see that could use some tweaking. One is the scarf, it isn''t adding value and appears to be in the way. Another is, even though I love it that he is barefoot, his legs being closer to the camera than the models heads are causing them to overpower somewhat and look out of portion with their bodies. The last thing is the light color knee of the Mom''s jeans. It  isn''t flowing with the overall colors, causing it to stick out too much.  The pose and the expressions are some of the best I have seen here so far .', '2005-09-14 04:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
