(1707170, 227989, 37844, '<td valign="top">This is excellent. The position in the frame, although more to the bottom helps to give a reason for the upward eyes. The eyes are the clear focal point. The lighting is beautiful and the fur is adding a soft texture that is veruy appealing.  Would love to know your lighting set up. 10</td>', 'This is excellent. The position in the frame, although more to the bottom helps to give a reason for the upward eyes. The eyes are the clear focal point. The lighting is beautiful and the fur is adding a soft texture that is veruy appealing.  Would love to know your lighting set up. 10', '2005-09-14 04:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707195, 230072, 37844, '<td valign="top">Composition and lighting are good, it''s aggressive and extreme. Can''t say it''s one of my favorites but at the same time I can appreciate the creativity and boldness.</td>', 'Composition and lighting are good, it''s aggressive and extreme. Can''t say it''s one of my favorites but at the same time I can appreciate the creativity and boldness.', '2005-09-14 04:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707209, 229691, 37844, '<td valign="top">These kids are precious. It could be my eyesight but it appears that the little one in back isn''t as clearly focused as the two out front. Possibly a bit more depth of field needed?   i don''t know how you got them to stay still that long.</td>', 'These kids are precious. It could be my eyesight but it appears that the little one in back isn''t as clearly focused as the two out front. Possibly a bit more depth of field needed?   i don''t know how you got them to stay still that long.', '2005-09-14 04:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707223, 228781, 37844, '<td valign="top">IThis is a lovely little lady, but I find the thick dark eyeliner on a child that looks this young to be a bit much. Instead of enhancing her eyes in a positive way, it appears to make them scream at you in a negative way. It seems that the overall photo has a bit too much saturation or contrast  making it seem too  harsh. I do feel it was a good choice to  fill the frame with your subject.</td>', 'IThis is a lovely little lady, but I find the thick dark eyeliner on a child that looks this young to be a bit much. Instead of enhancing her eyes in a positive way, it appears to make them scream at you in a negative way. It seems that the overall photo has a bit too much saturation or contrast  making it seem too  harsh. I do feel it was a good choice to  fill the frame with your subject.', '2005-09-14 04:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707226, 228197, 37844, '<td valign="top">This  seems like a good start, but your model appears out of focus and her lips look as though she was speaking.</td>', 'This  seems like a good start, but your model appears out of focus and her lips look as though she was speaking.', '2005-09-14 04:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707253, 229045, 37844, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Beautiful child, I would have liked to see a bit more light on her face, perhaps if you had used a reflector to bounce some light into it .  Background is a bit busy, but not a real problem.</td>', 'Great capture. Beautiful child, I would have liked to see a bit more light on her face, perhaps if you had used a reflector to bounce some light into it .  Background is a bit busy, but not a real problem.', '2005-09-14 05:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
