(1707269, 229954, 42234, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic shot.  I''m a big fan of the focused model in fron tf the un-focused model.  I always try to include one of these shots when I''m shooting engagement pictures.   All of my clients have loved them.  This one was done really great.  Hope you do well.</td>', 'This is a fantastic shot.  I''m a big fan of the focused model in fron tf the un-focused model.  I always try to include one of these shots when I''m shooting engagement pictures.   All of my clients have loved them.  This one was done really great.  Hope you do well.', '2005-09-14 05:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
