(1707317, 230098, 39163, '<td valign="top">Very plastic look</td>', 'Very plastic look', '2005-09-14 05:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707319, 227430, 37844, '<td valign="top">I feel the background has ruined an otherwise excellent portrait.  The color and texture are clashing with the young man''s shirt. The flash is bouncing harshly off the wall to his right and casting a little more shadow than needs to be on his right.  To avoid unwanted shadows, it''s usually best to have your subject several feet away from the background.</td>', 'I feel the background has ruined an otherwise excellent portrait.  The color and texture are clashing with the young man''s shirt. The flash is bouncing harshly off the wall to his right and casting a little more shadow than needs to be on his right.  To avoid unwanted shadows, it''s usually best to have your subject several feet away from the background.', '2005-09-14 06:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707320, 229753, 39163, '<td valign="top">Nice subject.  I''d have preferred a little more contrast in the face (shadows a little darker to highlight the contours better)</td>', 'Nice subject.  I''d have preferred a little more contrast in the face (shadows a little darker to highlight the contours better)', '2005-09-14 06:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707321, 230082, 39163, '<td valign="top">A little blurry - was it oversmoothed?</td>', 'A little blurry - was it oversmoothed?', '2005-09-14 06:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707323, 228731, 37844, '<td valign="top">The focus should be on her eyes to really make this photo stand out. The color and composition are good.</td>', 'The focus should be on her eyes to really make this photo stand out. The color and composition are good.', '2005-09-14 06:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707324, 230113, 39163, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but I hate the eyes</td>', 'Nice idea, but I hate the eyes', '2005-09-14 06:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707325, 227206, 37844, '<td valign="top">Soft , sweet, and closeup. All good.</td>', 'Soft , sweet, and closeup. All good.', '2005-09-14 06:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707326, 229865, 39163, '<td valign="top">She hasn''t changed</td>', 'She hasn''t changed', '2005-09-14 06:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707327, 230174, 37844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and colors. Reminds me of another challenge photo. Great concept and executed to perfect. Love to here about your lighting set up. 10</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and colors. Reminds me of another challenge photo. Great concept and executed to perfect. Love to here about your lighting set up. 10', '2005-09-14 06:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707328, 228513, 39163, '<td valign="top">Cute, but were the eyes a little overdone?</td>', 'Cute, but were the eyes a little overdone?', '2005-09-14 06:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707332, 230071, 37844, '<td valign="top">The dramatic look is great, but I would have liked to have seen just a bit more of the left side of his face. It could be my monitor, but all I see there is a pin point of light from his eye and it is distracting instead of adding value.</td>', 'The dramatic look is great, but I would have liked to have seen just a bit more of the left side of his face. It could be my monitor, but all I see there is a pin point of light from his eye and it is distracting instead of adding value.', '2005-09-14 06:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707333, 227897, 39163, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photot and I wish I had taken it - I would also have entered it  - I will give higher scores for those who managed to get recalcitrant people to pose for them though</td>', 'Beautiful photot and I wish I had taken it - I would also have entered it  - I will give higher scores for those who managed to get recalcitrant people to pose for them though', '2005-09-14 06:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707335, 230174, 39163, '<td valign="top">Beautiful setting</td>', 'Beautiful setting', '2005-09-14 06:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707336, 229677, 37844, '<td valign="top">You have lighting , composition and catchlights in here eyes. All is good. I would guess you have a studio and you sell  your portraits.</td>', 'You have lighting , composition and catchlights in here eyes. All is good. I would guess you have a studio and you sell  your portraits.', '2005-09-14 06:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707338, 230310, 37844, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting. Color and tone are beautiful, not to mention the model is too. Great job. 10</td>', 'Excellent lighting. Color and tone are beautiful, not to mention the model is too. Great job. 10', '2005-09-14 06:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707341, 230076, 39163, '<td valign="top">Nice expression - was the lighting intentional?</td>', 'Nice expression - was the lighting intentional?', '2005-09-14 06:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707344, 229332, 39163, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition - Appears very smoothed though</td>', 'Lovely composition - Appears very smoothed though', '2005-09-14 06:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707345, 230144, 39163, '<td valign="top">Great charachter - lighting could have been better</td>', 'Great charachter - lighting could have been better', '2005-09-14 06:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707348, 229062, 39163, '<td valign="top">Cute but what did you do to the eyes?</td>', 'Cute but what did you do to the eyes?', '2005-09-14 06:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707349, 229663, 37844, '<td valign="top">You have a very nice looking model. This photo could be improved by moving her at a more interesting angle, possibly getting yourself in a position a bit higher than your model. This usually gives a more flattering angle than straight on. The depth of field is very good . The shadows on her eyes not so good. The eyes should have some light in them to bring life to the portrait. You could possible use some fill flash here, if it wasn''t too bright or a better choice would be a relector to bounce the light back into her face. PM me if you need any information on this technique, I would love to  assit if I could.</td>', 'You have a very nice looking model. This photo could be improved by moving her at a more interesting angle, possibly getting yourself in a position a bit higher than your model. This usually gives a more flattering angle than straight on. The depth of field is very good . The shadows on her eyes not so good. The eyes should have some light in them to bring life to the portrait. You could possible use some fill flash here, if it wasn''t too bright or a better choice would be a relector to bounce the light back into her face. PM me if you need any information on this technique, I would love to  assit if I could.', '2005-09-14 06:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707351, 228197, 39163, '<td valign="top">Great idea</td>', 'Great idea', '2005-09-14 06:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707352, 228703, 37844, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting. Her hair is a bit distracting. Doesn''t go with the smooth flow that the rest of the photo has. Beautiful color.</td>', 'Very nice lighting. Her hair is a bit distracting. Doesn''t go with the smooth flow that the rest of the photo has. Beautiful color.', '2005-09-14 06:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707353, 229518, 37844, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting perspective. I didn''t think I would likeit when i saw the thumbnail but i do.  The blood vessels in her eyes are very distracting though.  Great that you filled the frame with your model and lighting is right on.</td>', 'This is an interesting perspective. I didn''t think I would likeit when i saw the thumbnail but i do.  The blood vessels in her eyes are very distracting though.  Great that you filled the frame with your model and lighting is right on.', '2005-09-14 06:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707354, 228952, 39163, '<td valign="top">Very smoothed.  Great lighting</td>', 'Very smoothed.  Great lighting', '2005-09-14 06:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707357, 229729, 37844, '<td valign="top">Very abstract and original. I like this very much. The sunglasses bring it all together ! Love to here about this technique.</td>', 'Very abstract and original. I like this very much. The sunglasses bring it all together ! Love to here about this technique.', '2005-09-14 06:25:21.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1707359, 230358, 39163, '<td valign="top">Beautiful subject.  I will reserve higher marks for those who managed to persuade recalcitrant humans to pose for them though</td>', 'Beautiful subject.  I will reserve higher marks for those who managed to persuade recalcitrant humans to pose for them though', '2005-09-14 06:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707360, 230347, 37844, '<td valign="top">The lighting and composition are very good as is the depth of field. The expression looks a bit anxious  and the hat has some distracting  areas in the center of her forehead.</td>', 'The lighting and composition are very good as is the depth of field. The expression looks a bit anxious  and the hat has some distracting  areas in the center of her forehead.', '2005-09-14 06:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707365, 228857, 37844, '<td valign="top">Soft and lovely light. Focus on eyes as it should be. One of my  favorites. Would love to hear your lighting set up. 10</td>', 'Soft and lovely light. Focus on eyes as it should be. One of my  favorites. Would love to hear your lighting set up. 10', '2005-09-14 06:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707366, 229905, 39163, '<td valign="top">I thought of trying this but never got around to doing so.  Good thinking.</td>', 'I thought of trying this but never got around to doing so.  Good thinking.', '2005-09-14 06:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707367, 229332, 37844, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting you used, not too crazy about the overall composition although i like the angle of her face.  Some fuzziness on the left cheek  right out from her nose is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Love the lighting you used, not too crazy about the overall composition although i like the angle of her face.  Some fuzziness on the left cheek  right out from her nose is a bit distracting.', '2005-09-14 06:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707369, 229727, 30173, '<td valign="top">cool....the background fits well together with the model</td>', 'cool....the background fits well together with the model', '2005-09-14 06:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707373, 230289, 37844, '<td valign="top">This is a good character study. I like the lighting, and the pose. i don''t feel the car is adding any value to the overall feel of the photo and therefore should have been left out.</td>', 'This is a good character study. I like the lighting, and the pose. i don''t feel the car is adding any value to the overall feel of the photo and therefore should have been left out.', '2005-09-14 06:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707375, 229610, 39163, '<td valign="top">Appears a  little oversaturated - did you up the contrast or saturation?</td>', 'Appears a  little oversaturated - did you up the contrast or saturation?', '2005-09-14 06:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707378, 229722, 37844, '<td valign="top">This is a great capture. Perfect lighting on the ground hog, perfect out of focus master of the ceremony in the background. This looks like "Groundhog''s Day"  Feb 2, here in the USA, what was the occasion  for this fellow to be out?</td>', 'This is a great capture. Perfect lighting on the ground hog, perfect out of focus master of the ceremony in the background. This looks like "Groundhog''s Day"  Feb 2, here in the USA, what was the occasion  for this fellow to be out?', '2005-09-14 06:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707380, 230335, 37844, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting photo with a good concept behind it. I  feel it would have been slightly more effective if the eyes had not been as dark as they turned out (at least per my monitor)  He almost looks like he is wearing a Halloween mask from a distance.  Still good composition.</td>', 'This is a very interesting photo with a good concept behind it. I  feel it would have been slightly more effective if the eyes had not been as dark as they turned out (at least per my monitor)  He almost looks like he is wearing a Halloween mask from a distance.  Still good composition.', '2005-09-14 06:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707381, 229945, 37844, '<td valign="top">This is a cute girl with a cute pose. Would like to have seen a bit more light in her left eye. Maybe slightly out of focus.</td>', 'This is a cute girl with a cute pose. Would like to have seen a bit more light in her left eye. Maybe slightly out of focus.', '2005-09-14 06:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707382, 230270, 37844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful eyes. You filled the frame and that is vey good.</td>', 'Beautiful eyes. You filled the frame and that is vey good.', '2005-09-14 06:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707383, 229949, 37844, '<td valign="top">I love the natural look of this photo, saw a similar one that appeared hard and harsh. This one feels very natural . Feeling up frame with your subject and focusing on the eyes. Excellent job. 10</td>', 'I love the natural look of this photo, saw a similar one that appeared hard and harsh. This one feels very natural . Feeling up frame with your subject and focusing on the eyes. Excellent job. 10', '2005-09-14 06:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707384, 227597, 37844, '<td valign="top">Lovely light, model and composition. Love to know your camera and lighting set up. My guess is you sell your portraits.10</td>', 'Lovely light, model and composition. Love to know your camera and lighting set up. My guess is you sell your portraits.10', '2005-09-14 06:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707385, 228408, 37844, '<td valign="top">Good composition, lighting and very original. good for you. 10</td>', 'Good composition, lighting and very original. good for you. 10', '2005-09-14 06:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707387, 229809, 35947, '<td valign="top">Well composed!  Great job!</td>', 'Well composed!  Great job!', '2005-09-14 06:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707388, 229725, 35947, '<td valign="top">Very cool!  Nice lighting!</td>', 'Very cool!  Nice lighting!', '2005-09-14 06:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707390, 229265, 37844, '<td valign="top">wonderful sad expression. Looks a bit under exposed.  Photo appears sort of flat due to lack of  light.</td>', 'wonderful sad expression. Looks a bit under exposed.  Photo appears sort of flat due to lack of  light.', '2005-09-14 06:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707391, 230271, 35947, '<td valign="top">Great expression!  Background is distracting though IMHO.</td>', 'Great expression!  Background is distracting though IMHO.', '2005-09-14 06:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707393, 230223, 35947, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting!  She has very pretty eyes!</td>', 'Wonderful lighting!  She has very pretty eyes!', '2005-09-14 06:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707394, 227851, 37844, '<td valign="top">This pose has been done many times, but it is always good if done right. i feel you did it right.</td>', 'This pose has been done many times, but it is always good if done right. i feel you did it right.', '2005-09-14 06:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707395, 228857, 35947, '<td valign="top">Love the fill of frame.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Love the fill of frame.  Nicely done!', '2005-09-14 06:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707397, 230113, 35947, '<td valign="top">Too Cute!  Great shot!</td>', 'Too Cute!  Great shot!', '2005-09-14 06:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707399, 229795, 35947, '<td valign="top">Very out of the box.  Not what I would expect to see in a portrait challange.</td>', 'Very out of the box.  Not what I would expect to see in a portrait challange.', '2005-09-14 06:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707401, 230299, 35947, '<td valign="top">Great capture of expression.  Lighting seems a little off IMHO.</td>', 'Great capture of expression.  Lighting seems a little off IMHO.', '2005-09-14 06:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707402, 230233, 35947, '<td valign="top">Great shot!</td>', 'Great shot!', '2005-09-14 06:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707403, 230363, 37844, '<td valign="top">Great composition but looks a bit dangerous. Seems a tad out of focus. Not sure it meets my idea of a portrait but still a great capture.</td>', 'Great composition but looks a bit dangerous. Seems a tad out of focus. Not sure it meets my idea of a portrait but still a great capture.', '2005-09-14 06:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707404, 229884, 35947, '<td valign="top">Very artistic!</td>', 'Very artistic!', '2005-09-14 06:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707407, 230353, 37844, '<td valign="top">I like profile portraits but they always seem more effective if the  models eyes are not turned too far in the opposite direction.  This has great lighting. very good exposure , just wish his eyes were more centered or looking toward me.</td>', 'I like profile portraits but they always seem more effective if the  models eyes are not turned too far in the opposite direction.  This has great lighting. very good exposure , just wish his eyes were more centered or looking toward me.', '2005-09-14 06:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707413, 228206, 37844, '<td valign="top">Great eye contact and expression. Love the wrap. I think it would have been absolutely beautiful if you had moved in closer filling up the frame with her and  catching a bit more light in her eyes and on her face. 8</td>', 'Great eye contact and expression. Love the wrap. I think it would have been absolutely beautiful if you had moved in closer filling up the frame with her and  catching a bit more light in her eyes and on her face. 8', '2005-09-14 06:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707414, 229989, 37844, '<td valign="top">Good character capture. A bit grainy but it totally works in this photo.</td>', 'Good character capture. A bit grainy but it totally works in this photo.', '2005-09-14 06:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707417, 228340, 37844, '<td valign="top">I''m not going to tell you that this is too far away, maybe that was the point in the title.  Good looking tree, can''t tell anything about the model.</td>', 'I''m not going to tell you that this is too far away, maybe that was the point in the title.  Good looking tree, can''t tell anything about the model.', '2005-09-14 06:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707421, 228939, 37844, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure that your title fits the expression in my opinion, but that''s ok, cause I am not voting solely on my opinion or the title, although sometimes it does make me lean to the high side if its a good title. This is beautifully done.  Easily a 10.</td>', 'I''m not sure that your title fits the expression in my opinion, but that''s ok, cause I am not voting solely on my opinion or the title, although sometimes it does make me lean to the high side if its a good title. This is beautifully done.  Easily a 10.', '2005-09-14 07:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707423, 229774, 37844, '<td valign="top">Up close and terrific.  One of the best here.  10</td>', 'Up close and terrific.  One of the best here.  10', '2005-09-14 07:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707425, 229378, 37844, '<td valign="top">I love the  expression. this is a great looking little guy. i don''t feel that the apple in hte hand is adding anything to this though, actually distracting from his great face.</td>', 'I love the  expression. this is a great looking little guy. i don''t feel that the apple in hte hand is adding anything to this though, actually distracting from his great face.', '2005-09-14 07:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707427, 230306, 37844, '<td valign="top">The light coming from the bottom left seems abit too obviously staged but the rest of the portrait is very fine.</td>', 'The light coming from the bottom left seems abit too obviously staged but the rest of the portrait is very fine.', '2005-09-14 07:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707431, 229727, 37844, '<td valign="top">I liked this very much til i got down to the bottom where her fingers are on her knee. They seem somehow too posed.  Maybe if her hands hand been linked together there it would have seemed a bit more natural.  Still, i love the lighting, the angle and the background. 9</td>', 'I liked this very much til i got down to the bottom where her fingers are on her knee. They seem somehow too posed.  Maybe if her hands hand been linked together there it would have seemed a bit more natural.  Still, i love the lighting, the angle and the background. 9', '2005-09-14 07:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707434, 230223, 37844, '<td valign="top">Fun photo. Well done. Do you do glamour shots  as a job?</td>', 'Fun photo. Well done. Do you do glamour shots  as a job?', '2005-09-14 07:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707437, 229761, 37844, '<td valign="top">Lovely girl, nice all around photo. Strands of hair in her a face a bit distracting.</td>', 'Lovely girl, nice all around photo. Strands of hair in her a face a bit distracting.', '2005-09-14 07:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707441, 229725, 37844, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo. The dark and light go well together. I don''t like the  flower on her shoulder, I don''t htink it is adding any value and is taking  the viewers attention away from the model''s face. Still, really nicely done..</td>', 'I really like this photo. The dark and light go well together. I don''t like the  flower on her shoulder, I don''t htink it is adding any value and is taking  the viewers attention away from the model''s face. Still, really nicely done..', '2005-09-14 07:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707444, 229362, 37844, '<td valign="top">Very cute boy. Seems a little soft focused. Seems like it should be sharper around the eyed. Cute expression and good angle.</td>', 'Very cute boy. Seems a little soft focused. Seems like it should be sharper around the eyed. Cute expression and good angle.', '2005-09-14 07:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707459, 229906, 22011, '<td valign="top">:-).   Your Muse has great eyes....<br/> <br/>The dark in the bottom right corner isn''t quite working for me though, it seems to detract a bit...  Maybe a lighter top / Skin or a tighter crop..  Still a stunning headshot.  8</td>', ':-).   Your Muse has great eyes.... The dark in the bottom right corner isn''t quite working for me though, it seems to detract a bit...  Maybe a lighter top / Skin or a tighter crop..  Still a stunning headshot.  8', '2005-09-14 07:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707465, 229518, 30364, '<td valign="top">Well it''s a good idea and a potentially appealing pose, but I think something seems to have gone wrong between camera and DPC.  I know that you''ve gone for this look deliberately, but she appears a little muppet-like to me.  I''m prepared to suffer your wrath about my comment ... I take that risk only because I think you''ve taken a very good portrait of a very good model, and then slipped.  Still worth a 6 from me, but should have been higher.  Sorry!</td>', 'Well it''s a good idea and a potentially appealing pose, but I think something seems to have gone wrong between camera and DPC.  I know that you''ve gone for this look deliberately, but she appears a little muppet-like to me.  I''m prepared to suffer your wrath about my comment ... I take that risk only because I think you''ve taken a very good portrait of a very good model, and then slipped.  Still worth a 6 from me, but should have been higher.  Sorry!', '2005-09-14 07:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707486, 227640, 11895, '<td valign="top">the graininess is excessive, but I think this may have been a very good photo without it, or with a much more moderate amount of it</td>', 'the graininess is excessive, but I think this may have been a very good photo without it, or with a much more moderate amount of it', '2005-09-14 07:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707490, 230296, 27901, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait, good setup and happy face. Great! 9</td>', 'Beautiful portrait, good setup and happy face. Great! 9', '2005-09-14 07:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707492, 228952, 27901, '<td valign="top">Great portrait, wonderful face and good photography 9</td>', 'Great portrait, wonderful face and good photography 9', '2005-09-14 07:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707493, 229337, 27901, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful face for such a little child, it is difficult to take good photo through the glass, great work! 8</td>', 'What a beautiful face for such a little child, it is difficult to take good photo through the glass, great work! 8', '2005-09-14 07:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707495, 230335, 27901, '<td valign="top">Great setup, great picture! 9</td>', 'Great setup, great picture! 9', '2005-09-14 07:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707497, 228857, 27901, '<td valign="top">This is beautifully done, the model is mysterious and the picture catching! 10</td>', 'This is beautifully done, the model is mysterious and the picture catching! 10', '2005-09-14 07:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707500, 228978, 27901, '<td valign="top">Wow these eyes are something, great hair well done 10</td>', 'Wow these eyes are something, great hair well done 10', '2005-09-14 07:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707513, 230100, 32848, '<td valign="top">Good focus and lighting.  Natural colours too, good job!</td>', 'Good focus and lighting.  Natural colours too, good job!', '2005-09-14 08:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707514, 228810, 32848, '<td valign="top">I like a good tight crop, gets you up close and personal.  Good focus, nice eyes.</td>', 'I like a good tight crop, gets you up close and personal.  Good focus, nice eyes.', '2005-09-14 08:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707518, 230356, 32848, '<td valign="top">Good exposure, nice setting.  Maybe too much concrete post for my liking, but I am fussy!</td>', 'Good exposure, nice setting.  Maybe too much concrete post for my liking, but I am fussy!', '2005-09-14 08:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707520, 228953, 32848, '<td valign="top">Good crop, but a tad too burnt out on the right, imo.  Difficult shot to capture, though.</td>', 'Good crop, but a tad too burnt out on the right, imo.  Difficult shot to capture, though.', '2005-09-14 08:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707521, 229574, 32848, '<td valign="top">It''s good when you can get someone to look directly into the camera, I struggle to get people to do this.</td>', 'It''s good when you can get someone to look directly into the camera, I struggle to get people to do this.', '2005-09-14 08:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707523, 230353, 32848, '<td valign="top">Good focus on the hair, the main subject going by the title.  Slightly more dof would have brought the beard, eyes and eyebrows into focus.  You may have been aiming for this effect, though.  If so, nice job.</td>', 'Good focus on the hair, the main subject going by the title.  Slightly more dof would have brought the beard, eyes and eyebrows into focus.  You may have been aiming for this effect, though.  If so, nice job.', '2005-09-14 08:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707526, 228683, 32848, '<td valign="top">Slightly too soft for my tastes, I''m afraid.</td>', 'Slightly too soft for my tastes, I''m afraid.', '2005-09-14 08:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707529, 228520, 32848, '<td valign="top">An interesting character for sure.  Pity the shirt is burnt out in several areas, but a good shot overall.</td>', 'An interesting character for sure.  Pity the shirt is burnt out in several areas, but a good shot overall.', '2005-09-14 08:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707535, 229087, 32848, '<td valign="top">Lovely (natural?) light shot.  I would have preferred slightly more dof to keep more in focus, but great detail in those lips!</td>', 'Lovely (natural?) light shot.  I would have preferred slightly more dof to keep more in focus, but great detail in those lips!', '2005-09-14 08:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707538, 230357, 32848, '<td valign="top">Unusual pose, but good nonetheless.  It''s nice to see something different.  I like the lighting, too.  Good shot.</td>', 'Unusual pose, but good nonetheless.  It''s nice to see something different.  I like the lighting, too.  Good shot.', '2005-09-14 08:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707540, 230145, 32848, '<td valign="top">This looks a little too sharp for the background.  Did you sharpen it at all?  Or is it lighting?  Something looks a little unatural somewhere...</td>', 'This looks a little too sharp for the background.  Did you sharpen it at all?  Or is it lighting?  Something looks a little unatural somewhere...', '2005-09-14 08:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707542, 230116, 32848, '<td valign="top">Nice background, good attitude!</td>', 'Nice background, good attitude!', '2005-09-14 08:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707543, 229971, 32848, '<td valign="top">Focus is on the nose and I would prefer it on the eyes.  I also know how difficult this can be, especially with AF.</td>', 'Focus is on the nose and I would prefer it on the eyes.  I also know how difficult this can be, especially with AF.', '2005-09-14 08:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707544, 229809, 32848, '<td valign="top">Great picture!  She has lovely eyes and hair and just that hint of a smile.  Good background, too.</td>', 'Great picture!  She has lovely eyes and hair and just that hint of a smile.  Good background, too.', '2005-09-14 08:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707556, 230179, 11895, '<td valign="top">this looks like a well planned shot except that it is over exposed, the large featureless area of her forehead and the background to the right look very blown out; including the bit of red in the scarf was a good idea</td>', 'this looks like a well planned shot except that it is over exposed, the large featureless area of her forehead and the background to the right look very blown out; including the bit of red in the scarf was a good idea', '2005-09-14 08:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707573, 230306, 32848, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and focus in this.  I particularly like the low level lighting and the highlights in her eyes.</td>', 'Good lighting and focus in this.  I particularly like the low level lighting and the highlights in her eyes.', '2005-09-14 08:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707574, 229748, 32848, '<td valign="top">Good picture although the smile looks a little unatural.</td>', 'Good picture although the smile looks a little unatural.', '2005-09-14 08:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707577, 230280, 30364, '<td valign="top">The models are hilarious (presumably deliberately so), but the photograph is very good.  7</td>', 'The models are hilarious (presumably deliberately so), but the photograph is very good.  7', '2005-09-14 08:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707578, 230354, 32848, '<td valign="top">Lovely smile!  Good focus and background too.</td>', 'Lovely smile!  Good focus and background too.', '2005-09-14 08:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707580, 229950, 32848, '<td valign="top">Good focus on the eyes.  Pity it wouldn''t smile for you...</td>', 'Good focus on the eyes.  Pity it wouldn''t smile for you...', '2005-09-14 08:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707584, 230198, 32848, '<td valign="top">Great colours and focus.</td>', 'Great colours and focus.', '2005-09-14 08:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707618, 229378, 25397, '<td valign="top">Hey les the large frame is cool I think. :-)<br/>Great candid, you rawk!</td>', 'Hey les the large frame is cool I think. :-)Great candid, you rawk!', '2005-09-14 08:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707647, 229749, 22656, '<td valign="top">Rugged and natural.</td>', 'Rugged and natural.', '2005-09-14 09:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707659, 230299, 30364, '<td valign="top">Nice restrained photograph of a lovely model.  I like the fact that you have suggested a quiet personality for the subject with your subtle exposure &amp; processing, but still managed to hint at the existence of an unruly side with the stray lock of hair.  8</td>', 'Nice restrained photograph of a lovely model.  I like the fact that you have suggested a quiet personality for the subject with your subtle exposure & processing, but still managed to hint at the existence of an unruly side with the stray lock of hair.  8', '2005-09-14 09:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707666, 230375, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s a lovely portrait, although the catch lights in the pupils are a little odd.  But the lighting and the simple, elegant composition seem exactly right for your subject ... it suggests something about her personality, which I think is the essence of a good portrait.  8</td>', 'It''s a lovely portrait, although the catch lights in the pupils are a little odd.  But the lighting and the simple, elegant composition seem exactly right for your subject ... it suggests something about her personality, which I think is the essence of a good portrait.  8', '2005-09-14 09:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707725, 230289, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a terrific portrait, much stronger than the many more technically onanistic entries.  The man''s body language and facial expression create an irresistible tension and command the viewer''s emotional involvement in the photograph.  There''s a definite feeling of loss and quiet despair about it.  The composition is casual and uncompromising, and the decision to not crop out the car was inspired.  I also applaud your processing choices (or I should say lack of them).  Alas, I suppose it will be overlooked among the dross.  10.</td>', 'This is a terrific portrait, much stronger than the many more technically onanistic entries.  The man''s body language and facial expression create an irresistible tension and command the viewer''s emotional involvement in the photograph.  There''s a definite feeling of loss and quiet despair about it.  The composition is casual and uncompromising, and the decision to not crop out the car was inspired.  I also applaud your processing choices (or I should say lack of them).  Alas, I suppose it will be overlooked among the dross.  10.', '2005-09-14 09:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707738, 230231, 30364, '<td valign="top">Lovely, deceptively simple portrait in which the photographer and the subject were equal and successful participants.  You each know what a seriously good portrait should do; provide an insight into the nature of the subject.  And you each delivered.  9</td>', 'Lovely, deceptively simple portrait in which the photographer and the subject were equal and successful participants.  You each know what a seriously good portrait should do; provide an insight into the nature of the subject.  And you each delivered.  9', '2005-09-14 09:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707745, 229954, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is not a technically flawless photograph (and bravo for that!)  But it is a very good portrait ... it''s interesting and intriguing.  It requires the viewer to actually think; to speculate about both the primary and secondary subjects ... who are they?  do they have some relationship?  is he just a voyeur?  what''s she looking at?  Stuff like that.  So much better than another Barbie &amp; Ken glamour shot!  9.</td>', 'This is not a technically flawless photograph (and bravo for that!)  But it is a very good portrait ... it''s interesting and intriguing.  It requires the viewer to actually think; to speculate about both the primary and secondary subjects ... who are they?  do they have some relationship?  is he just a voyeur?  what''s she looking at?  Stuff like that.  So much better than another Barbie & Ken glamour shot!  9.', '2005-09-14 09:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707754, 228647, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, timeless portrait.  The soft, ethereal feel is perfect for the subject, and the composition/crop gives it an intimacy that is also apposite.  9.</td>', 'Beautiful, timeless portrait.  The soft, ethereal feel is perfect for the subject, and the composition/crop gives it an intimacy that is also apposite.  9.', '2005-09-14 09:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707766, 229980, 28801, '<td valign="top">Like the colours, the soft-focus works well</td>', 'Like the colours, the soft-focus works well', '2005-09-14 10:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707770, 230083, 30364, '<td valign="top">Love this.  The harsh lighting and the brassy, high-key feel is terrific, and is also a welcome relief.  It''s a very pop-art kind of image.  Good, original thinking!  8.</td>', 'Love this.  The harsh lighting and the brassy, high-key feel is terrific, and is also a welcome relief.  It''s a very pop-art kind of image.  Good, original thinking!  8.', '2005-09-14 10:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707782, 230066, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a fabulous portrait.  It''s perfectly lit.  The composition is absolutely brilliant ... well conceived and meticulously executed.  And you have retained a totally appropriate soft and muted feel to it in processing, providing further evidence that the masterful composition was no fluke.  10.</td>', 'This is a fabulous portrait.  It''s perfectly lit.  The composition is absolutely brilliant ... well conceived and meticulously executed.  And you have retained a totally appropriate soft and muted feel to it in processing, providing further evidence that the masterful composition was no fluke.  10.', '2005-09-14 10:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707800, 229864, 28801, '<td valign="top">Nice soft-focus shot</td>', 'Nice soft-focus shot', '2005-09-14 10:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707814, 227701, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very good photograph.  I like the spare, empty composition ... it reinforces the expression of disquiet on the face of the primary subject.  And the inclusion of the second boy, whose body language also suggests uncertainty, completes the picture, literally.  This is the work of a photographer who understands what he/she is doing.  9.</td>', 'Very good photograph.  I like the spare, empty composition ... it reinforces the expression of disquiet on the face of the primary subject.  And the inclusion of the second boy, whose body language also suggests uncertainty, completes the picture, literally.  This is the work of a photographer who understands what he/she is doing.  9.', '2005-09-14 10:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707821, 229083, 30364, '<td valign="top">Such a brilliant, appealing subject, and you did total justice to this opportunity.  8</td>', 'Such a brilliant, appealing subject, and you did total justice to this opportunity.  8', '2005-09-14 10:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707848, 229602, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  A wonderful subject captured with simplicity and dignity.  You make it impossible for the viewer to avoid an emotional collision with this appealing, engaging person.  And that''s what makes it such a terrific protrait.  9</td>', 'Beautiful.  A wonderful subject captured with simplicity and dignity.  You make it impossible for the viewer to avoid an emotional collision with this appealing, engaging person.  And that''s what makes it such a terrific protrait.  9', '2005-09-14 10:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707851, 229124, 35947, '<td valign="top">Clever title</td>', 'Clever title', '2005-09-14 10:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707852, 228381, 38198, '<td valign="top">I like it, but there is something strange cut out looking or underexposed on the face. Over all I think it is a good immage.</td>', 'I like it, but there is something strange cut out looking or underexposed on the face. Over all I think it is a good immage.', '2005-09-14 10:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707857, 229378, 40341, '<td valign="top">Another nice pic there A.Les. just one word, professional photographer!</td>', 'Another nice pic there A.Les. just one word, professional photographer!', '2005-09-14 10:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707858, 229062, 38198, '<td valign="top">Good crisp immage, like the position and love what you did with the background.</td>', 'Good crisp immage, like the position and love what you did with the background.', '2005-09-14 10:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707862, 227851, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very fine, mesmerising portrait.  The simplicity of composition, lighting and processing is very appropriate.  8</td>', 'Very fine, mesmerising portrait.  The simplicity of composition, lighting and processing is very appropriate.  8', '2005-09-14 10:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707868, 229608, 43822, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Picture....Great Lighting<br/>A Perfectly Captured Gesture Of Affection.</td>', 'Beautiful Picture....Great LightingA Perfectly Captured Gesture Of Affection.', '2005-09-14 10:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707879, 230310, 38198, '<td valign="top">Love the light on her face &amp; the background.The only thing that I would do to it is the strands on hair on her forhead are a little distracting.</td>', 'Love the light on her face & the background.The only thing that I would do to it is the strands on hair on her forhead are a little distracting.', '2005-09-14 10:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707892, 230083, 38198, '<td valign="top">I would love to see a "How''d they do that?" on this photo. YOU are a master, this just rocks.</td>', 'I would love to see a "How''d they do that?" on this photo. YOU are a master, this just rocks.', '2005-09-14 10:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707906, 229325, 30364, '<td valign="top">Now that''s a nasty, smack-up-the-side-of-the-head image!  Far too much Neat Image on the nostrils and the negative space is way oversharpened.  On the other hand, the horizon''s crooked and your frame is not visible at all.  Overall, a terrific image.  Bravo!  9.</td>', 'Now that''s a nasty, smack-up-the-side-of-the-head image!  Far too much Neat Image on the nostrils and the negative space is way oversharpened.  On the other hand, the horizon''s crooked and your frame is not visible at all.  Overall, a terrific image.  Bravo!  9.', '2005-09-14 10:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707907, 227575, 38198, '<td valign="top">Good idea. Needs some work, just cleaned up in photoshop. Immage is very small. I had this problem too when I started someone sugested the tutorials on getting your immage ready for DPI. That comment helped me the most. Good Luck</td>', 'Good idea. Needs some work, just cleaned up in photoshop. Immage is very small. I had this problem too when I started someone sugested the tutorials on getting your immage ready for DPI. That comment helped me the most. Good Luck', '2005-09-14 10:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707924, 228826, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is the only ''over-processed'' entry I approve of.  I guess that''s because in this case it may not be over-processed at all.  This delightful subject seems all the more appealing for the nostalgic glow you''ve given her, especially as it was taken at sunset on a holiday.  8</td>', 'This is the only ''over-processed'' entry I approve of.  I guess that''s because in this case it may not be over-processed at all.  This delightful subject seems all the more appealing for the nostalgic glow you''ve given her, especially as it was taken at sunset on a holiday.  8', '2005-09-14 10:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707929, 229865, 30364, '<td valign="top">I remember it well (it''s not a full year yet). Stll love it.  As for the new composite image, it is perhaps less stylish than the original, but there''s still something about it ... like a hidden meaning, I think.  7</td>', 'I remember it well (it''s not a full year yet). Stll love it.  As for the new composite image, it is perhaps less stylish than the original, but there''s still something about it ... like a hidden meaning, I think.  7', '2005-09-14 10:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707939, 228644, 38198, '<td valign="top">Super Shot. love the colors.</td>', 'Super Shot. love the colors.', '2005-09-14 10:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707944, 228849, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s not a technically perfect photograph (thank goodness), but it is a really good portrait.  The viewer can''t help but smile at her happiness and her apparent close bond with her horse.  7</td>', 'It''s not a technically perfect photograph (thank goodness), but it is a really good portrait.  The viewer can''t help but smile at her happiness and her apparent close bond with her horse.  7', '2005-09-14 10:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707964, 229457, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a terrific candid portrait.  The simple composition and unpretentious, casual feel makes it a very fine and real-life image.  As a result, Janelle is a participant in the portrait, and not just a pretty prop.  8</td>', 'This is a terrific candid portrait.  The simple composition and unpretentious, casual feel makes it a very fine and real-life image.  As a result, Janelle is a participant in the portrait, and not just a pretty prop.  8', '2005-09-14 10:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1707985, 229954, 35739, '<td valign="top">Not to sure about the brightness between the two of them.  I do like the gentleman in the back.  Makes the photo.</td>', 'Not to sure about the brightness between the two of them.  I do like the gentleman in the back.  Makes the photo.', '2005-09-14 10:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708024, 229105, 28801, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful', '2005-09-14 11:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708034, 230272, 28801, '<td valign="top">Very nice warm tones. The use of existing light is excellent</td>', 'Very nice warm tones. The use of existing light is excellent', '2005-09-14 11:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708055, 230174, 28801, '<td valign="top">Fantastic framing shot</td>', 'Fantastic framing shot', '2005-09-14 11:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708089, 228531, 38198, '<td valign="top">The color just doesn''t work, would be nice with out the blue hue.</td>', 'The color just doesn''t work, would be nice with out the blue hue.', '2005-09-14 11:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
