(1708182, 229696, 28801, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait. The colours and angle work together very well.</td>', 'Very nice portrait. The colours and angle work together very well.', '2005-09-14 11:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708210, 230290, 32378, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture of her eyes, which there was a little more color to her skin tones.</td>', 'Beautiful capture of her eyes, which there was a little more color to her skin tones.', '2005-09-14 12:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708215, 229865, 32378, '<td valign="top">Unique concept, however I think the old picture distracts from your portrait of her.</td>', 'Unique concept, however I think the old picture distracts from your portrait of her.', '2005-09-14 12:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708224, 229045, 32378, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this cropped a little tighter.</td>', 'I would have liked this cropped a little tighter.', '2005-09-14 12:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708228, 229563, 32378, '<td valign="top">The background really hurts this image.</td>', 'The background really hurts this image.', '2005-09-14 12:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708240, 230246, 42638, '<td valign="top">Now thats just plain CUTE!,...OK, not so plain. Its a Wonderful shot. Love the tones, not too soft. They say the subject is supposed to be moving into the frame, but I really think this is an exception. Great job!</td>', 'Now thats just plain CUTE!,...OK, not so plain. Its a Wonderful shot. Love the tones, not too soft. They say the subject is supposed to be moving into the frame, but I really think this is an exception. Great job!', '2005-09-14 12:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708245, 230341, 42638, '<td valign="top">I Really like this picture. I can almost see the intensity in his eyes even though they are covered. Very powerful in my opinion. Excellent!</td>', 'I Really like this picture. I can almost see the intensity in his eyes even though they are covered. Very powerful in my opinion. Excellent!', '2005-09-14 12:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708254, 230296, 38198, '<td valign="top">I like the energy, and the lighting.</td>', 'I like the energy, and the lighting.', '2005-09-14 12:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708255, 229083, 42638, '<td valign="top">Very nice Picture. It says so much yet, is silent too. Excellent!</td>', 'Very nice Picture. It says so much yet, is silent too. Excellent!', '2005-09-14 12:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708257, 229791, 42638, '<td valign="top">Nice Picture but I think it would be better if the lighting came from the other side. Good Job!</td>', 'Nice Picture but I think it would be better if the lighting came from the other side. Good Job!', '2005-09-14 12:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708264, 228258, 28801, '<td valign="top">Very cleverly framed</td>', 'Very cleverly framed', '2005-09-14 12:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708271, 230198, 42638, '<td valign="top">Aww..what a cutie. Nice color.  Maybe a straight on shot wasn''t the best in this pose. Hard to appreciate the full dimension. Try shooting down and angled just a bit.</td>', 'Aww..what a cutie. Nice color.  Maybe a straight on shot wasn''t the best in this pose. Hard to appreciate the full dimension. Try shooting down and angled just a bit.', '2005-09-14 12:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708272, 230111, 32378, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, her eyes capture your attention, which I like.  The only suggestion I would make is to somehow adjust the lighting so that her pupils weren''t so large and you would then see more of the color of her eyes.</td>', 'Lovely shot, her eyes capture your attention, which I like.  The only suggestion I would make is to somehow adjust the lighting so that her pupils weren''t so large and you would then see more of the color of her eyes.', '2005-09-14 12:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708277, 230372, 42638, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. I sure wish the sail boat wasnt there, it really distracts. I do like the rest of the background there, no need to crop. It really accentuates him. Good job!</td>', 'Nice picture. I sure wish the sail boat wasnt there, it really distracts. I do like the rest of the background there, no need to crop. It really accentuates him. Good job!', '2005-09-14 12:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708281, 229980, 42638, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Love the color but the background yellow is a bit distracting from the subject.</td>', 'Beautiful! Love the color but the background yellow is a bit distracting from the subject.', '2005-09-14 12:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708289, 229089, 32378, '<td valign="top">Very cute subject.  Everything is done very well, except her head is out of proportion to the rest of her arms and shoulders.  Looks like it was shot close up with wide angle.</td>', 'Very cute subject.  Everything is done very well, except her head is out of proportion to the rest of her arms and shoulders.  Looks like it was shot close up with wide angle.', '2005-09-14 12:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708290, 229673, 40718, '<td valign="top">This is my ribbon winner.  I don''t know if it will do it, because people seem to like the angel-effect, but I like realism.  Everything about this portrait is classy and sharp as a tack.  If this girl is a family member, this one is for the wall...10</td>', 'This is my ribbon winner.  I don''t know if it will do it, because people seem to like the angel-effect, but I like realism.  Everything about this portrait is classy and sharp as a tack.  If this girl is a family member, this one is for the wall...10', '2005-09-14 12:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708293, 229629, 42638, '<td valign="top">Good pose! Its almost like you have 2 things going on here and its hard to connect them in my mind. The head and then the body. Both are distracting from the other. Try to crop out one or the other, I think you will find it more powerful.</td>', 'Good pose! Its almost like you have 2 things going on here and its hard to connect them in my mind. The head and then the body. Both are distracting from the other. Try to crop out one or the other, I think you will find it more powerful.', '2005-09-14 12:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708296, 229867, 40718, '<td valign="top">One of my top 3...the spunk, the attitude!  You can see so much about her in the portrait.  It isn''t cluttered by a distracting background and although her face is highlit, it doesn''t feel post-processed (if you did, you did well) 10.</td>', 'One of my top 3...the spunk, the attitude!  You can see so much about her in the portrait.  It isn''t cluttered by a distracting background and although her face is highlit, it doesn''t feel post-processed (if you did, you did well) 10.', '2005-09-14 12:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708298, 230179, 42638, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. A bit overexposed though. Powerful eyes. Nice!</td>', 'Beautiful. A bit overexposed though. Powerful eyes. Nice!', '2005-09-14 12:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708301, 228365, 40718, '<td valign="top">I have 3 tens after a bit of rearranging.  This is one of them.  Hope you don''t get too slammed for having an animal portrait, but there seem to be enough in the challenge that people will accept them.  The focus is spot on and the gorillas expression is more emotive than many of the humans in the challenge. 10.</td>', 'I have 3 tens after a bit of rearranging.  This is one of them.  Hope you don''t get too slammed for having an animal portrait, but there seem to be enough in the challenge that people will accept them.  The focus is spot on and the gorillas expression is more emotive than many of the humans in the challenge. 10.', '2005-09-14 12:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708302, 229729, 42638, '<td valign="top">Neat Picture. Love the eyes. The wiskers are a bit distracting from this great shot. It really reduces the power effect.</td>', 'Neat Picture. Love the eyes. The wiskers are a bit distracting from this great shot. It really reduces the power effect.', '2005-09-14 12:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708324, 229751, 32378, '<td valign="top">Overall a wonderful shot. I think it would have been even better if her pupils were a little smaller to see more of the color of her eyes.</td>', 'Overall a wonderful shot. I think it would have been even better if her pupils were a little smaller to see more of the color of her eyes.', '2005-09-14 12:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708342, 230179, 26189, '<td valign="top">Looks similar to another challenge entry.  Beautiful eyes, they draw you in.</td>', 'Looks similar to another challenge entry.  Beautiful eyes, they draw you in.', '2005-09-14 12:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708363, 229105, 23203, '<td valign="top">Lovely model. Nice portrait. I would like to see a tad more brightness. Good luck!<br/></td>', 'Lovely model. Nice portrait. I would like to see a tad more brightness. Good luck!', '2005-09-14 12:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708366, 230343, 32378, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  Her look is worth a thousand words.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  Her look is worth a thousand words.', '2005-09-14 12:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708412, 229906, 32378, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, the eyes do make the picture.  10</td>', 'Wonderful shot, the eyes do make the picture.  10', '2005-09-14 13:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708413, 229906, 40718, '<td valign="top">I''m not giving 10s to portraits with a lot of "angel effect" because I don''t really prefer it.  However, this portrait is excellent.  Her eyes are sharp as a tack and the portrait captures her very well. The post-proccessing isn''t too heavy and among the best of that genre. 9</td>', 'I''m not giving 10s to portraits with a lot of "angel effect" because I don''t really prefer it.  However, this portrait is excellent.  Her eyes are sharp as a tack and the portrait captures her very well. The post-proccessing isn''t too heavy and among the best of that genre. 9', '2005-09-14 13:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708414, 228952, 28801, '<td valign="top">Great colous, sharp and natural capture. I love it.</td>', 'Great colous, sharp and natural capture. I love it.', '2005-09-14 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708415, 230363, 32378, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites in this challenge.  I hope it does very well. 10</td>', 'This is one of my favorites in this challenge.  I hope it does very well. 10', '2005-09-14 13:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708418, 230172, 32378, '<td valign="top">Lovely smooth lighting, very well done.</td>', 'Lovely smooth lighting, very well done.', '2005-09-14 13:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708419, 230233, 28801, '<td valign="top">Quite artistic and original. One of the most creative I''ve seen here.</td>', 'Quite artistic and original. One of the most creative I''ve seen here.', '2005-09-14 13:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708420, 227597, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like her playful attitude, well done.</td>', 'I like her playful attitude, well done.', '2005-09-14 13:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708421, 230111, 40718, '<td valign="top">Apparently I''m a sucker for a beautiful face.  Eyes, naturally, make a portrait and her''s are wonderfully captured.  I have not given 10''s to portraits with post-processing to smooth the skin (I don''t tend to like the effect), but I''ll give you a 9.  Excellent job.</td>', 'Apparently I''m a sucker for a beautiful face.  Eyes, naturally, make a portrait and her''s are wonderfully captured.  I have not given 10''s to portraits with post-processing to smooth the skin (I don''t tend to like the effect), but I''ll give you a 9.  Excellent job.', '2005-09-14 13:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708426, 230223, 40718, '<td valign="top">Definitely a color portrait.  The post-processing is well handled and not overdone. 9</td>', 'Definitely a color portrait.  The post-processing is well handled and not overdone. 9', '2005-09-14 13:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708428, 229842, 40718, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture of her eyes. 9</td>', 'Excellent capture of her eyes. 9', '2005-09-14 13:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708431, 228857, 32378, '<td valign="top">Just a goregous shot.  Congratulations. Can''t really say anything more.</td>', 'Just a goregous shot.  Congratulations. Can''t really say anything more.', '2005-09-14 13:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708433, 229842, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this shot, very well done.  Hope it scores very high.</td>', 'I like everything about this shot, very well done.  Hope it scores very high.', '2005-09-14 13:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708437, 230174, 40718, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t capture enough of who the person is to rate super-high, but I like the effort and the focus is sharp. 7</td>', 'Doesn''t capture enough of who the person is to rate super-high, but I like the effort and the focus is sharp. 7', '2005-09-14 13:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708441, 228910, 32378, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  I had this as a 9 but have to give it a 10.</td>', 'Very well done.  I had this as a 9 but have to give it a 10.', '2005-09-14 13:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708444, 228781, 40718, '<td valign="top">I don''t think angel effect works well with freckles.  Look at the other obvious freckle portrait and you will see the difference.  6</td>', 'I don''t think angel effect works well with freckles.  Look at the other obvious freckle portrait and you will see the difference.  6', '2005-09-14 13:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708445, 229554, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, good clean lines.  Good masculine pose.  It should do very well.</td>', 'I like this a lot, good clean lines.  Good masculine pose.  It should do very well.', '2005-09-14 13:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708448, 230355, 40718, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture without all the post-processing. 8</td>', 'Excellent capture without all the post-processing. 8', '2005-09-14 13:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708450, 229727, 32378, '<td valign="top">I just like this shot a lot.  I like the angle you put the wall behind her, and the way you captured her eyes.</td>', 'I just like this shot a lot.  I like the angle you put the wall behind her, and the way you captured her eyes.', '2005-09-14 13:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708452, 228978, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like the effect on this shot a lot.  Its different and very well done.</td>', 'I like the effect on this shot a lot.  Its different and very well done.', '2005-09-14 13:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708458, 230131, 40718, '<td valign="top">Man, it''s not a person!  I''d have to vote it down if it weren''t so damn good. (Just kidding, I have an animal portrait as one of my ribbon winners)  The DOF is so choice in this picture.  Animal portraits are easier in the sense that you aren''t trying to capture a sepcific personality trait, but still, I have to give this a 9.</td>', 'Man, it''s not a person!  I''d have to vote it down if it weren''t so damn good. (Just kidding, I have an animal portrait as one of my ribbon winners)  The DOF is so choice in this picture.  Animal portraits are easier in the sense that you aren''t trying to capture a sepcific personality trait, but still, I have to give this a 9.', '2005-09-14 13:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708460, 229634, 32378, '<td valign="top">The model is stunning you captured her eyes wonderfully.  The back ground however takes away from the overall effect.</td>', 'The model is stunning you captured her eyes wonderfully.  The back ground however takes away from the overall effect.', '2005-09-14 13:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708461, 229026, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like the expression you captured in this.  The lighting is well done for this type of portrait.</td>', 'I like the expression you captured in this.  The lighting is well done for this type of portrait.', '2005-09-14 13:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708462, 227837, 28801, '<td valign="top">Really cute</td>', 'Really cute', '2005-09-14 13:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
