(1708485, 227855, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like the look you captured. The red on the left seems somehow out of place.  I think I would have shown a little wider view it tied together with the right.</td>', 'I like the look you captured. The red on the left seems somehow out of place.  I think I would have shown a little wider view it tied together with the right.', '2005-09-14 13:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
