(1708491, 229045, 38925, '<td valign="top">amazing shot</td>', 'amazing shot', '2005-09-14 13:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708492, 230149, 32378, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  My guess is some will mark you down because this isn''t a person.  I hope not.</td>', 'Very well done.  My guess is some will mark you down because this isn''t a person.  I hope not.', '2005-09-14 13:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708496, 230299, 40718, '<td valign="top">I love red hair and freckles, but the lighting diminishes the freckles instead of brings them out.  Her eyes are excellent, but I still would have preferred a different lighting arrangement. 7</td>', 'I love red hair and freckles, but the lighting diminishes the freckles instead of brings them out.  Her eyes are excellent, but I still would have preferred a different lighting arrangement. 7', '2005-09-14 13:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708500, 230351, 32378, '<td valign="top">Nice carefree look.  I may have made the eyes and teeth a little whiter, but not unnaturally white.</td>', 'Nice carefree look.  I may have made the eyes and teeth a little whiter, but not unnaturally white.', '2005-09-14 13:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708503, 228978, 38925, '<td valign="top">woooooow, Beautiful face, and amazing skin tone</td>', 'woooooow, Beautiful face, and amazing skin tone', '2005-09-14 13:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708508, 228952, 32378, '<td valign="top">This is overall very well done.  I think I would have liked a little more contrast between her and the background.</td>', 'This is overall very well done.  I think I would have liked a little more contrast between her and the background.', '2005-09-14 13:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708511, 228388, 40718, '<td valign="top">I usually don''t like a background in a portrait.  It distracts...but this one tells more of the story and adds to the persona of the subject.  I like it. 8.</td>', 'I usually don''t like a background in a portrait.  It distracts...but this one tells more of the story and adds to the persona of the subject.  I like it. 8.', '2005-09-14 13:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708513, 230066, 38925, '<td valign="top">amazing frame i really like it, good skin tone</td>', 'amazing frame i really like it, good skin tone', '2005-09-14 13:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708516, 230351, 40718, '<td valign="top">Natural and elegant. 8</td>', 'Natural and elegant. 8', '2005-09-14 13:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708517, 230363, 38925, '<td valign="top">amazing frame, i really like it</td>', 'amazing frame, i really like it', '2005-09-14 13:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708519, 229663, 32378, '<td valign="top">The background likghting is a little harsh for my taste.  I also think if you posed her other than straight on to create some diagional lines it would have helped the composition.</td>', 'The background likghting is a little harsh for my taste.  I also think if you posed her other than straight on to create some diagional lines it would have helped the composition.', '2005-09-14 13:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708527, 229772, 32378, '<td valign="top">As a portrat the wrist band, while making a point,  pulls my attention away from the model.</td>', 'As a portrat the wrist band, while making a point,  pulls my attention away from the model.', '2005-09-14 13:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708529, 230174, 38925, '<td valign="top">amazing frame</td>', 'amazing frame', '2005-09-14 13:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708534, 230266, 32378, '<td valign="top">Picture seems to have an overall blue cast, probably from the time of day.  Seems to busy for a portrait more attention needs to be drawn to the face of the cub.</td>', 'Picture seems to have an overall blue cast, probably from the time of day.  Seems to busy for a portrait more attention needs to be drawn to the face of the cub.', '2005-09-14 13:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708537, 227437, 32378, '<td valign="top">This appears to be very over processed.</td>', 'This appears to be very over processed.', '2005-09-14 13:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708544, 230329, 32378, '<td valign="top">Its funny pose, at first I thought his head was seperated from his body because his shirt blends into the background.  If he is flexing his muscle then I think we should see more of it in the picture.</td>', 'Its funny pose, at first I thought his head was seperated from his body because his shirt blends into the background.  If he is flexing his muscle then I think we should see more of it in the picture.', '2005-09-14 13:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708548, 229325, 32378, '<td valign="top">Sorry this just doesn''t do anything for me as a portrait.</td>', 'Sorry this just doesn''t do anything for me as a portrait.', '2005-09-14 13:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708553, 229744, 32378, '<td valign="top">Something makes this look too much like a snap shot.  I think it is the lighting and and positioning of the hand pulls my attention away from the face of the clown.</td>', 'Something makes this look too much like a snap shot.  I think it is the lighting and and positioning of the hand pulls my attention away from the face of the clown.', '2005-09-14 13:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708557, 230198, 32378, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been better if the mouth were closed.  Not sure what the white is on the bottom of the picture since his feet are cropped off.</td>', 'I think this would have been better if the mouth were closed.  Not sure what the white is on the bottom of the picture since his feet are cropped off.', '2005-09-14 13:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708561, 230161, 32378, '<td valign="top">I think there is too much contrast in the lighting.  The highlights are blown out and it is difficult to see in the shadows.</td>', 'I think there is too much contrast in the lighting.  The highlights are blown out and it is difficult to see in the shadows.', '2005-09-14 13:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708566, 229832, 32378, '<td valign="top">The shadows for the flash are distracting.  With every thing  in sharp focus this just appears to be a very busy picture.</td>', 'The shadows for the flash are distracting.  With every thing  in sharp focus this just appears to be a very busy picture.', '2005-09-14 13:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708567, 229772, 4411, '<td valign="top"><b>Make</b>Celebrities<b>History</b></td>', 'MakeCelebritiesHistory', '2005-09-14 13:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708571, 228847, 32378, '<td valign="top">I think I may have cropped this a little tighter.  Seems to have a red cast to it especially in the skin tone and in the eyes.</td>', 'I think I may have cropped this a little tighter.  Seems to have a red cast to it especially in the skin tone and in the eyes.', '2005-09-14 13:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708577, 230046, 32378, '<td valign="top">The back ground is distracting and too busy.  Would have like to seen less hair covering her face.</td>', 'The back ground is distracting and too busy.  Would have like to seen less hair covering her face.', '2005-09-14 13:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708581, 230091, 32378, '<td valign="top">As a portrait I would have cropped this much tighter or taken more of a close up.</td>', 'As a portrait I would have cropped this much tighter or taken more of a close up.', '2005-09-14 13:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708590, 228591, 32378, '<td valign="top">I hope this shot does well.  Very nicely done I really like the overall mood and the way you captured her eyes.</td>', 'I hope this shot does well.  Very nicely done I really like the overall mood and the way you captured her eyes.', '2005-09-14 13:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708629, 230364, 27421, '<td valign="top">Cool Shot....6.335</td>', 'Cool Shot....6.335', '2005-09-14 14:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708632, 228731, 27421, '<td valign="top">Blur &amp; non-focus does not work for me here.....4....</td>', 'Blur & non-focus does not work for me here.....4....', '2005-09-14 14:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708646, 230246, 27421, '<td valign="top">Wouldn''t ya know it...bubble contest the very next week....6</td>', 'Wouldn''t ya know it...bubble contest the very next week....6', '2005-09-14 14:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708676, 230046, 33400, '<td valign="top">If you go to my profile, you''ll see I can''t take a decent picture.  So I''m not too qualified to comment on your technique.  I''d like to see a little more light on the face and maybe a less busy background.  But like I said...<br/>However, I will comment on your title.  She looks angry or at least annoyed.  But I don''t see sultry.  By definition, sultry means sensual and/or voluptuous.  She appears a little young for that look in this shot. Just an opinion..</td>', 'If you go to my profile, you''ll see I can''t take a decent picture.  So I''m not too qualified to comment on your technique.  I''d like to see a little more light on the face and maybe a less busy background.  But like I said...However, I will comment on your title.  She looks angry or at least annoyed.  But I don''t see sultry.  By definition, sultry means sensual and/or voluptuous.  She appears a little young for that look in this shot. Just an opinion..', '2005-09-14 14:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708694, 229378, 15574, '<td valign="top">Good picture, but that border doesn''t do it for me.</td>', 'Good picture, but that border doesn''t do it for me.', '2005-09-14 14:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708697, 230265, 33400, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped at the shoulders.  The model is young and it almost seems like you are trying to make her more than a little girl (only a perception - nothing to read into it).  She is strikingly pretty and the shot is very well done.</td>', 'I would have cropped at the shoulders.  The model is young and it almost seems like you are trying to make her more than a little girl (only a perception - nothing to read into it).  She is strikingly pretty and the shot is very well done.', '2005-09-14 14:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708703, 230321, 42100, '<td valign="top">Highlight at bottom somewhat of a distraction.</td>', 'Highlight at bottom somewhat of a distraction.', '2005-09-14 14:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708704, 228340, 33400, '<td valign="top">Very surreal background - striking.  Not really a portrait though (IMO).  Still points for good shooting.</td>', 'Very surreal background - striking.  Not really a portrait though (IMO).  Still points for good shooting.', '2005-09-14 14:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708706, 230161, 27460, '<td valign="top">out of focus, poor lighting (entire right side of his face is burnt out (look to the left side of the pic). eyes need to be sharper. overall, colours are muted because of the intense light (assuming sunlight here). ALOT of potential here, but need to use a light disc and some shade to brighten his face and dampen his hair.</td>', 'out of focus, poor lighting (entire right side of his face is burnt out (look to the left side of the pic). eyes need to be sharper. overall, colours are muted because of the intense light (assuming sunlight here). ALOT of potential here, but need to use a light disc and some shade to brighten his face and dampen his hair.', '2005-09-14 14:28:23.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1708711, 229541, 33400, '<td valign="top">Need a little more light on Hershey''s snout.</td>', 'Need a little more light on Hershey''s snout.', '2005-09-14 14:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708717, 230354, 27460, '<td valign="top">funny shot. nice colour and composition. probably would crop a bit more from the left-side (perhaps make this shot into a square pic), seems like he''s just floating at the edge. a wee bit of burning along the moustache and wish you could have lit up his eyes a bit more. overall a good quality shot.</td>', 'funny shot. nice colour and composition. probably would crop a bit more from the left-side (perhaps make this shot into a square pic), seems like he''s just floating at the edge. a wee bit of burning along the moustache and wish you could have lit up his eyes a bit more. overall a good quality shot.', '2005-09-14 14:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708723, 229083, 27421, '<td valign="top">Great looking character....7</td>', 'Great looking character....7', '2005-09-14 14:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708725, 228762, 20577, '<td valign="top">This is a great portrait. I hope it isn''t getting voted down due to your use of soft focus.</td>', 'This is a great portrait. I hope it isn''t getting voted down due to your use of soft focus.', '2005-09-14 14:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708726, 228857, 27421, '<td valign="top">Nice soft post processing effect...7</td>', 'Nice soft post processing effect...7', '2005-09-14 14:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708728, 230373, 27421, '<td valign="top">Very nice looking cat... I will not detract for non-humanoid.....7</td>', 'Very nice looking cat... I will not detract for non-humanoid.....7', '2005-09-14 14:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708731, 229265, 33400, '<td valign="top">Not enough light to bring out the obvious striking features on this child.  I''m OK with the pose, but to get from snapshot to portrait, it needs a little more exposure on the face to bring out his features.</td>', 'Not enough light to bring out the obvious striking features on this child.  I''m OK with the pose, but to get from snapshot to portrait, it needs a little more exposure on the face to bring out his features.', '2005-09-14 14:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708734, 230357, 27421, '<td valign="top">Yeah, Baby !!!  :&gt;)   6 (Austin Powers quote...)</td>', 'Yeah, Baby !!!  :>)   6 (Austin Powers quote...)', '2005-09-14 14:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708743, 229944, 16493, '<td valign="top">minus for not having good focus on the eyes</td>', 'minus for not having good focus on the eyes', '2005-09-14 14:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708748, 230172, 30018, '<td valign="top">The only flaw, is the white speck over her left eye.  Otherwise, perfect.  Beautiful model. great lighting, sultery pose, eye-grabbing eyes.  Absolutely beautiful image.  I hpe it does well for you.  Good Luck  I''m a forgiving kinda guy when it comes to pretty women...I''m gonna pretend I missed that speck!  &lt;10&gt;</td>', 'The only flaw, is the white speck over her left eye.  Otherwise, perfect.  Beautiful model. great lighting, sultery pose, eye-grabbing eyes.  Absolutely beautiful image.  I hpe it does well for you.  Good Luck  I''m a forgiving kinda guy when it comes to pretty women...I''m gonna pretend I missed that speck!  <10>', '2005-09-14 14:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708754, 227989, 27460, '<td valign="top">gorgeous shot.</td>', 'gorgeous shot.', '2005-09-14 14:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708758, 230101, 9964, '<td valign="top">wondeful image</td>', 'wondeful image', '2005-09-14 14:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708763, 227967, 23312, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and pose, but the edges look a bit too sharpened/processed to me.</td>', 'I like the composition and pose, but the edges look a bit too sharpened/processed to me.', '2005-09-14 14:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708768, 230285, 33400, '<td valign="top">Good portrait.  One minor point on flag etiquette: The blue field should always be displayed in the upper left corner of the flag, even when hung down in this manner. (no points off for this though).</td>', 'Good portrait.  One minor point on flag etiquette: The blue field should always be displayed in the upper left corner of the flag, even when hung down in this manner. (no points off for this though).', '2005-09-14 14:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708772, 228206, 27460, '<td valign="top">a bit soft in the face but a very nice shot. excellent lighting and composition. nice warm colour. wish model was repositioned to block out-of-focus tree to the left. probably would crop a little bit from the top. 7/10</td>', 'a bit soft in the face but a very nice shot. excellent lighting and composition. nice warm colour. wish model was repositioned to block out-of-focus tree to the left. probably would crop a little bit from the top. 7/10', '2005-09-14 14:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708778, 227597, 20941, '<td valign="top">wonderful composition, lighting and model!</td>', 'wonderful composition, lighting and model!', '2005-09-14 14:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708779, 229774, 27460, '<td valign="top">a nice portrait. dont like the little girls hand "floating" around mom''s neck. i think the cropping is a little too tight in that respect. smile on little girls'' face looks a little "held" in that she''s waiting for the picture for a second or two too long. some slight burning along mom''s shoulder.  eyes are magnificantly captured. 6/10</td>', 'a nice portrait. dont like the little girls hand "floating" around mom''s neck. i think the cropping is a little too tight in that respect. smile on little girls'' face looks a little "held" in that she''s waiting for the picture for a second or two too long. some slight burning along mom''s shoulder.  eyes are magnificantly captured. 6/10', '2005-09-14 14:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708783, 229337, 27460, '<td valign="top">unfortunately, the glass around the baby is dilluting some of the colour and focus. a nice picture, good choice of composition around the baby''s face, although would prefer to see the buttons? moved so it isn''t in front of the baby''s chin/cheek. 6/10</td>', 'unfortunately, the glass around the baby is dilluting some of the colour and focus. a nice picture, good choice of composition around the baby''s face, although would prefer to see the buttons? moved so it isn''t in front of the baby''s chin/cheek. 6/10', '2005-09-14 14:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708792, 230172, 20941, '<td valign="top">if I were able to do work this well and this were my entry I would have cloned out that tiny white spot by her right eye... but I''m not this good so who am I to say! But I can say this is a beautiful portrait!</td>', 'if I were able to do work this well and this were my entry I would have cloned out that tiny white spot by her right eye... but I''m not this good so who am I to say! But I can say this is a beautiful portrait!', '2005-09-14 14:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708796, 229944, 11895, '<td valign="top">well done except for being too soft</td>', 'well done except for being too soft', '2005-09-14 14:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708800, 229004, 27460, '<td valign="top">nice picture, but needs more light brought into the subjects face. i think this shot might be downgraded for not cropping tightly around her face, which isn''t necessarily a requirement, but i think for this to be considered a portrait, you need to really highlight the model''s face. currently, i think her eyes are too dark and just sink into her face, removing any expression that could have been interpreted. a shame, because the background is lovely, and the model has a lot of potential. I''d try to reshoot this with a light reflector to get some more natural lighting. 5/10</td>', 'nice picture, but needs more light brought into the subjects face. i think this shot might be downgraded for not cropping tightly around her face, which isn''t necessarily a requirement, but i think for this to be considered a portrait, you need to really highlight the model''s face. currently, i think her eyes are too dark and just sink into her face, removing any expression that could have been interpreted. a shame, because the background is lovely, and the model has a lot of potential. I''d try to reshoot this with a light reflector to get some more natural lighting. 5/10', '2005-09-14 14:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708814, 228884, 27460, '<td valign="top">a good shot, but i think the angle is unfortunately cropping alot of the expression on his face out. also, the current colours in this shot are making the image blend into itself. i think if this shot was converted to b&amp;w, it would have a lot more aesthetic value (realize this is a colour contest). perhaps draping a black piece of fabric against the wall would have helped isolate the green of the shirt, instead of blending in with the wall. 4/10</td>', 'a good shot, but i think the angle is unfortunately cropping alot of the expression on his face out. also, the current colours in this shot are making the image blend into itself. i think if this shot was converted to b&w, it would have a lot more aesthetic value (realize this is a colour contest). perhaps draping a black piece of fabric against the wall would have helped isolate the green of the shirt, instead of blending in with the wall. 4/10', '2005-09-14 15:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708821, 229696, 27460, '<td valign="top">i think you''ve used a bit too much blur effect around the nose, as it looks unnaturally wispy. also, eyes need more lighting to really pick out the colour. they seem to be a bit too dark, especially in comparison with the black sweater. colour also seems to be a little "odd", almost as though he is wearing makeup/glamour shot-like.</td>', 'i think you''ve used a bit too much blur effect around the nose, as it looks unnaturally wispy. also, eyes need more lighting to really pick out the colour. they seem to be a bit too dark, especially in comparison with the black sweater. colour also seems to be a little "odd", almost as though he is wearing makeup/glamour shot-like.', '2005-09-14 15:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708827, 230266, 27460, '<td valign="top">cub''s face is too soft. lighting could use improvement, most of the picture has a grey-purple cast to it.</td>', 'cub''s face is too soft. lighting could use improvement, most of the picture has a grey-purple cast to it.', '2005-09-14 15:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1708830, 228644, 27460, '<td valign="top">i think the red in this shot really detracts from the final image and gives the dog a bit of a creepy look in the eyes. nose is a tad too dark, eyes could be sharper in focus.</td>', 'i think the red in this shot really detracts from the final image and gives the dog a bit of a creepy look in the eyes. nose is a tad too dark, eyes could be sharper in focus.', '2005-09-14 15:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
