(1710899, 229424, 27460, '<td valign="top">needs more light, expression on face is a little along the lines of "i''m not sure i want to be doing this...". blue background is pulling eye away from subject, perhaps too "busy" with the texture (and brown top is too much contrast in colour). should probably not use straight-on flash (can tell by reflection in her pupil). try moving the light a bit to the photographers'' right to fill in her face more with details.</td>', 'needs more light, expression on face is a little along the lines of "i''m not sure i want to be doing this...". blue background is pulling eye away from subject, perhaps too "busy" with the texture (and brown top is too much contrast in colour). should probably not use straight-on flash (can tell by reflection in her pupil). try moving the light a bit to the photographers'' right to fill in her face more with details.', '2005-09-15 08:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
