(1710923, 229729, 27460, '<td valign="top">i think its burnt out a little too much. i like the idea, i just think it looks a little odd how we can still see skin colour where the sunglasses are. i think that should have been blown out a bit as well and just the eye be in "colour". also, the effect looks "clippy" in the sense that you can see where you went over in photoshop and selected the edges of the glasses, which makes it feel unnatural. perhaps using a dithering technique wouldn''t make the glasses look so choppy (especially on the left lens).</td>', 'i think its burnt out a little too much. i like the idea, i just think it looks a little odd how we can still see skin colour where the sunglasses are. i think that should have been blown out a bit as well and just the eye be in "colour". also, the effect looks "clippy" in the sense that you can see where you went over in photoshop and selected the edges of the glasses, which makes it feel unnatural. perhaps using a dithering technique wouldn''t make the glasses look so choppy (especially on the left lens).', '2005-09-15 08:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
