(1711032, 229446, 41675, '<td valign="top">I''m not usually a fan of grain in a photo, but in this case it gives your photo a...gritty kind of feeling. Your shot sets a somber, contemplative mood for me. Nice job.</td>', 'I''m not usually a fan of grain in a photo, but in this case it gives your photo a...gritty kind of feeling. Your shot sets a somber, contemplative mood for me. Nice job.', '2005-09-15 09:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
