(1711041, 228788, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, I might have cropped out the blue portion of the blanket on the left and maybe a bit more "breathing" room above the head. I like the soft look, and such a sweet subject.</td>', 'For me, I might have cropped out the blue portion of the blanket on the left and maybe a bit more "breathing" room above the head. I like the soft look, and such a sweet subject.', '2005-09-15 09:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
