(1711133, 228502, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is so adorable.  I love the compositon and the way you set up the scene.  The colors from the hammock are a really nice touch as well as the mountains in the background.  The sunlight is just a tad on the harsh side, but it kind of adds to the outdoor environment you''ve set up.  Very nice.</td>', 'This is so adorable.  I love the compositon and the way you set up the scene.  The colors from the hammock are a really nice touch as well as the mountains in the background.  The sunlight is just a tad on the harsh side, but it kind of adds to the outdoor environment you''ve set up.  Very nice.', '2005-09-15 10:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1711142, 229999, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is so cute.  What a great expression, a great natural smile.  You did a good job capturing her personality.  Some things I noticed that might improve this shot, the colors seem just a tad flat, maybe boost contrasts or saturations a little, but not the reds as her mouth might look a little too red then.  Also, maybe a bit oversharpened as there is slight haloing around her eyes and shirt and lastly, I might crop a bit from the top to get rid of some of the bright sky as it doesn''t add much to the scene and maybe a little off the left.  But overall, you brought out her personality and I think that''s a very important part.  Well done.</td>', 'This is so cute.  What a great expression, a great natural smile.  You did a good job capturing her personality.  Some things I noticed that might improve this shot, the colors seem just a tad flat, maybe boost contrasts or saturations a little, but not the reds as her mouth might look a little too red then.  Also, maybe a bit oversharpened as there is slight haloing around her eyes and shirt and lastly, I might crop a bit from the top to get rid of some of the bright sky as it doesn''t add much to the scene and maybe a little off the left.  But overall, you brought out her personality and I think that''s a very important part.  Well done.', '2005-09-15 10:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1711144, 229941, 14620, '<td valign="top">This just makes me smile.  Very original and I love the major saturation.  Very cool.  I might clone out the loose hairs on her forehead and the focus  seems sharper on her hair than her eyes.  But minor things cause the attitude of this shot is enough to make it great!</td>', 'This just makes me smile.  Very original and I love the major saturation.  Very cool.  I might clone out the loose hairs on her forehead and the focus  seems sharper on her hair than her eyes.  But minor things cause the attitude of this shot is enough to make it great!', '2005-09-15 10:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1711146, 230214, 14620, '<td valign="top">Awwwww, so cute!  What a great little expression you captured.  The composition is good, nice that it''s off centered and the colors are nice.  Good lighting.</td>', 'Awwwww, so cute!  What a great little expression you captured.  The composition is good, nice that it''s off centered and the colors are nice.  Good lighting.', '2005-09-15 10:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
