(1711152, 228773, 14620, '<td valign="top">Beautiful eyes.  The colors in this are very nice and complimentary to her and the textures of the tree and the scarf(?) also add to the appeal.  Good composition and good use of natural light.</td>', 'Beautiful eyes.  The colors in this are very nice and complimentary to her and the textures of the tree and the scarf(?) also add to the appeal.  Good composition and good use of natural light.', '2005-09-15 10:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
