(1711531, 229914, 27460, '<td valign="top">very blurry, but alot of emotion captured in the eyes. only wish this shot were in better focus along the face. great "worry" lines in the brow.</td>', 'very blurry, but alot of emotion captured in the eyes. only wish this shot were in better focus along the face. great "worry" lines in the brow.', '2005-09-15 13:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
