(1711566, 230055, 33400, '<td valign="top">Very interesting image.  I like the lighting.  It looks like natural sunlight through a slotted window. But the non-lit area of the face is well done too.  congrats.</td>', 'Very interesting image.  I like the lighting.  It looks like natural sunlight through a slotted window. But the non-lit area of the face is well done too.  congrats.', '2005-09-15 14:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1711571, 230297, 33400, '<td valign="top">Very pretty girl.  Looks like a bit much post-process on the face?  can''t tell.  still a nice shot- well framed and nicely lit.</td>', 'Very pretty girl.  Looks like a bit much post-process on the face?  can''t tell.  still a nice shot- well framed and nicely lit.', '2005-09-15 14:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1711573, 229122, 33400, '<td valign="top">striking eyes.  good capture.</td>', 'striking eyes.  good capture.', '2005-09-15 14:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1711575, 227437, 33400, '<td valign="top">..Unless this is intentional.. seems a bit over-processed.  the picture looks to have a great deal of potential, but way too grainy and pixelated.  I onder if it''s a compression issue?  I''m still learning myself, so if I''m way off-base just disregard.</td>', '..Unless this is intentional.. seems a bit over-processed.  the picture looks to have a great deal of potential, but way too grainy and pixelated.  I onder if it''s a compression issue?  I''m still learning myself, so if I''m way off-base just disregard.', '2005-09-15 14:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1711577, 229325, 33400, '<td valign="top">Definitely taking a plunge... in the world of DPC risk.  I''m looking forward to the "how I did it"<br/>Very good image</td>', 'Definitely taking a plunge... in the world of DPC risk.  I''m looking forward to the "how I did it"Very good image', '2005-09-15 14:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1711587, 229838, 33400, '<td valign="top">Beautifu eyes, lighting, face... soft focus is well done.  I keep looking for something to criticize and I get nothing.  <br/>Well done</td>', 'Beautifu eyes, lighting, face... soft focus is well done.  I keep looking for something to criticize and I get nothing.  Well done', '2005-09-15 14:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
