(1711646, 230153, 33400, '<td valign="top">Really more of a candid than a protrait (IMO) but a good capture with a good title.  Nice job.</td>', 'Really more of a candid than a protrait (IMO) but a good capture with a good title.  Nice job.', '2005-09-15 14:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
