(1711753, 227989, 42792, '<td valign="top">I like the way this is done a lot but there''s something I can''t put my finger on that doesn''t seem quite right.  Just wondered if it''s not a bit off center.  I would maybe crop the right side just a wee bit more.  Still a great idea and shot!</td>', 'I like the way this is done a lot but there''s something I can''t put my finger on that doesn''t seem quite right.  Just wondered if it''s not a bit off center.  I would maybe crop the right side just a wee bit more.  Still a great idea and shot!', '2005-09-15 15:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
