(1711861, 229508, 42792, '<td valign="top">I think a closer shot without the upper darker right corner may have worked better, especially since there''s an interesting design and colour on the bottom half of the background that is almost a paler reflection of her sweater.</td>', 'I think a closer shot without the upper darker right corner may have worked better, especially since there''s an interesting design and colour on the bottom half of the background that is almost a paler reflection of her sweater.', '2005-09-15 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1711916, 230083, 44104, '<td valign="top">Good job on this photo.  I like the sharpness, simplicity, and blends of color - especially where the yellow syrup turns green with the blue background and the contrasting blue of the background and the red of the toungue and lips.  The only negative thing I would say is that I keep getting distracted by her hair on the lower-left corner of this picture.  It seems to "dead" in comparison to the liveliness of the rest of the photo.  Other than that, nice job.</td>', 'Good job on this photo.  I like the sharpness, simplicity, and blends of color - especially where the yellow syrup turns green with the blue background and the contrasting blue of the background and the red of the toungue and lips.  The only negative thing I would say is that I keep getting distracted by her hair on the lower-left corner of this picture.  It seems to "dead" in comparison to the liveliness of the rest of the photo.  Other than that, nice job.', '2005-09-15 16:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712004, 229083, 30881, '<td valign="top">Really like the smiling eyes, and the overall dark feel to this image. Would love to see this finish in the top three</td>', 'Really like the smiling eyes, and the overall dark feel to this image. Would love to see this finish in the top three', '2005-09-15 16:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
