(1712617, 230044, 40370, '<td valign="top">All the redheads get an extra point from me, 8, love the pic.</td>', 'All the redheads get an extra point from me, 8, love the pic.', '2005-09-15 20:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712618, 230336, 40370, '<td valign="top">Love the composition and upside down idea, all the redheads get an extra point, 8.</td>', 'Love the composition and upside down idea, all the redheads get an extra point, 8.', '2005-09-15 20:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712620, 230299, 16106, '<td valign="top">good shot but I think you failed it in the lighting, the post processing looks good on the incandessant lit side, but the natural light side is too blue and blown out. other than that a potential ribbon shot. 7</td>', 'good shot but I think you failed it in the lighting, the post processing looks good on the incandessant lit side, but the natural light side is too blue and blown out. other than that a potential ribbon shot. 7', '2005-09-15 20:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712623, 229089, 38032, '<td valign="top">this is a cute image and a really cute girl.  I hate being overly critical but the pose looks unnatural since the elbows aren''t resting on anything.  It is a great perspective though and a creative shot with nice lighting.  7</td>', 'this is a cute image and a really cute girl.  I hate being overly critical but the pose looks unnatural since the elbows aren''t resting on anything.  It is a great perspective though and a creative shot with nice lighting.  7', '2005-09-15 20:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712631, 229183, 16106, '<td valign="top">while you got the eyes in focus puuurrrfectly, the wiskers are just too fuzzy. a bit deeper plane of focus would have helped. I like the color if his (her?) coat, but the contrast with the blue backround is quite jarring, while the textuer is so similar that it just seems odd. pertty cat and a very nice pose you got out of him(her).</td>', 'while you got the eyes in focus puuurrrfectly, the wiskers are just too fuzzy. a bit deeper plane of focus would have helped. I like the color if his (her?) coat, but the contrast with the blue backround is quite jarring, while the textuer is so similar that it just seems odd. pertty cat and a very nice pose you got out of him(her).', '2005-09-15 20:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712671, 229602, 40019, '<td valign="top">Outstanding!  You can just see a lifetime of stories behind those eyes.  Color is very dramatic.</td>', 'Outstanding!  You can just see a lifetime of stories behind those eyes.  Color is very dramatic.', '2005-09-15 21:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712724, 228197, 25553, '<td valign="top">this is too out of focus for my taste and her eyes might look better if she wasnt looking so far behind her, also the tip of her nose blends in too much with her cheek..it looks like a painting :)</td>', 'this is too out of focus for my taste and her eyes might look better if she wasnt looking so far behind her, also the tip of her nose blends in too much with her cheek..it looks like a painting :)', '2005-09-15 21:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712727, 229838, 25553, '<td valign="top">very elegant.. i like the magazine look. i assume the softness is on purpose.</td>', 'very elegant.. i like the magazine look. i assume the softness is on purpose.', '2005-09-15 21:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712730, 230172, 25553, '<td valign="top">i like how the golden hair looks but im not too sure about the diffuse glow. what is that white dot by her eye?</td>', 'i like how the golden hair looks but im not too sure about the diffuse glow. what is that white dot by her eye?', '2005-09-15 21:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712732, 230341, 25553, '<td valign="top">good reflection on the glasses. how much did you have to crop this?</td>', 'good reflection on the glasses. how much did you have to crop this?', '2005-09-15 21:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712738, 228502, 25553, '<td valign="top">some diffusion on the key side and some kick back from the opposite side would be cool..</td>', 'some diffusion on the key side and some kick back from the opposite side would be cool..', '2005-09-15 21:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712740, 228644, 25553, '<td valign="top">what is the outline arround the dog? cute dog it mightve been cool to see a color that contrasted his eyes more... just a thought<br/></td>', 'what is the outline arround the dog? cute dog it mightve been cool to see a color that contrasted his eyes more... just a thought', '2005-09-15 21:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712763, 228125, 25553, '<td valign="top">amazing! beautiful girl, nice makeup and hair. the lighting isnt bad either... dont care too much for the white parts in the bushes.. nice use of the sun as a back light.. congrats and keep up the good work!!</td>', 'amazing! beautiful girl, nice makeup and hair. the lighting isnt bad either... dont care too much for the white parts in the bushes.. nice use of the sun as a back light.. congrats and keep up the good work!!', '2005-09-15 21:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712764, 228803, 25553, '<td valign="top">nice colors but i dont get why you have that weird blur in your bg..almost like distortion or pixelation..</td>', 'nice colors but i dont get why you have that weird blur in your bg..almost like distortion or pixelation..', '2005-09-15 21:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712765, 230361, 25553, '<td valign="top">mother and child.. dont get along? maybe he was being a brat.. the bg is distracting..</td>', 'mother and child.. dont get along? maybe he was being a brat.. the bg is distracting..', '2005-09-15 21:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712771, 229634, 25553, '<td valign="top">i like the use of the sun as a backlight but she doesnt seem too enthused about getting her picture taken..and the sikewalk is a bit distracting...</td>', 'i like the use of the sun as a backlight but she doesnt seem too enthused about getting her picture taken..and the sikewalk is a bit distracting...', '2005-09-15 22:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712800, 230363, 44299, '<td valign="top">I may be completely off base with this but from this end this picture appears to have had some very serious alterations.............</td>', 'I may be completely off base with this but from this end this picture appears to have had some very serious alterations.............', '2005-09-15 22:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712803, 228978, 44299, '<td valign="top">Mannequin???</td>', 'Mannequin???', '2005-09-15 22:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712808, 230272, 44299, '<td valign="top">Super picture!  The only downfall I see is the bleaching out of the fire...I don''t know how you''d do it any differently but I still think the picture is great (maybe some selective cropping could help a bit with fire)</td>', 'Super picture!  The only downfall I see is the bleaching out of the fire...I don''t know how you''d do it any differently but I still think the picture is great (maybe some selective cropping could help a bit with fire)', '2005-09-15 22:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712814, 230266, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, this portrait of such magnificent animals would have more impace if cropped tighter. The eyes of this lioness are so intense.</td>', 'For me, this portrait of such magnificent animals would have more impace if cropped tighter. The eyes of this lioness are so intense.', '2005-09-15 22:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712816, 230082, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait entry. I like the soft...dreamy kind of look...although the side of his face seems to have a....gray line to it...possibly from a photo editing program? This is a good shot to cherish in the years to come. :-)</td>', 'Nice portrait entry. I like the soft...dreamy kind of look...although the side of his face seems to have a....gray line to it...possibly from a photo editing program? This is a good shot to cherish in the years to come. :-)', '2005-09-15 22:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712820, 230114, 44299, '<td valign="top">very nice ''personality'' picture...not sure the coach would agree though!  lol</td>', 'very nice ''personality'' picture...not sure the coach would agree though!  lol', '2005-09-15 22:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712822, 229810, 41675, '<td valign="top">Although I feel like a voyeur, I like the portrait and your photo gives me the feeling of an artist at work. Nice job.</td>', 'Although I feel like a voyeur, I like the portrait and your photo gives me the feeling of an artist at work. Nice job.', '2005-09-15 22:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712824, 229115, 41675, '<td valign="top">The skin tones seem to have a bit of an orange cast, but I like the composition and casual pose.</td>', 'The skin tones seem to have a bit of an orange cast, but I like the composition and casual pose.', '2005-09-15 22:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712826, 229959, 41675, '<td valign="top">What a soft, sweet portrait. Those eyes! wish they were just a tad bit lighter, but really, be proud of this shot. 8</td>', 'What a soft, sweet portrait. Those eyes! wish they were just a tad bit lighter, but really, be proud of this shot. 8', '2005-09-15 22:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712828, 230355, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice, tight closeup. Well done and the eyes are riveting. Good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'Nice, tight closeup. Well done and the eyes are riveting. Good luck in this challenge.', '2005-09-15 22:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712829, 229906, 44299, '<td valign="top">nice portrait, she needs to get out in the sun a bit more and ask her mom for help with her mascara......still a nice portrait though<br/></td>', 'nice portrait, she needs to get out in the sun a bit more and ask her mom for help with her mascara......still a nice portrait though', '2005-09-15 22:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712832, 228381, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and soft background. For me, I wish his head was tilted up more, and I don''t even mind the sunglasses. Nice lighting too. :-)</td>', 'I like the composition and soft background. For me, I wish his head was tilted up more, and I don''t even mind the sunglasses. Nice lighting too. :-)', '2005-09-15 22:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712834, 228242, 44299, '<td valign="top">fantastic show of colors!</td>', 'fantastic show of colors!', '2005-09-15 22:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712835, 230212, 41675, '<td valign="top">The first thing that caught my eye was the pink on the horses nose and that of the rider''s outfit. They compliment each other well, and both of their eyes seem focused on a goal. I like it. Good job. 8</td>', 'The first thing that caught my eye was the pink on the horses nose and that of the rider''s outfit. They compliment each other well, and both of their eyes seem focused on a goal. I like it. Good job. 8', '2005-09-15 22:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712837, 229608, 44299, '<td valign="top">I like your lighting on this....I assume it wasn''t just ''natural''</td>', 'I like your lighting on this....I assume it wasn''t just ''natural''', '2005-09-15 22:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712838, 229751, 41675, '<td valign="top">Well done photo of a beautiful woman. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Well done photo of a beautiful woman. Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-09-15 22:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712839, 230233, 38648, '<td valign="top">this is too creepy</td>', 'this is too creepy', '2005-09-15 22:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712840, 229183, 41675, '<td valign="top">Awww, I wish this was a bit more in focus as this is such a pretty (and furry) cat. I like the contrasting background choice.</td>', 'Awww, I wish this was a bit more in focus as this is such a pretty (and furry) cat. I like the contrasting background choice.', '2005-09-15 22:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712842, 229623, 44299, '<td valign="top">Best photo I have seen in this challenge so far!  well done<br/></td>', 'Best photo I have seen in this challenge so far!  well done', '2005-09-15 22:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712844, 229941, 41675, '<td valign="top">My initial reaction...OMG! What comes to mind is...streetwalker. I think it''s a fun photo, great colors and wild, but your shot brings out some serious sexual overtones - at least to me. Good luck in the challenge. I''m sure the male voters will love this one.</td>', 'My initial reaction...OMG! What comes to mind is...streetwalker. I think it''s a fun photo, great colors and wild, but your shot brings out some serious sexual overtones - at least to me. Good luck in the challenge. I''m sure the male voters will love this one.', '2005-09-15 22:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712845, 229981, 23203, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp portrait. A black background might have additional impact. Good luck!</td>', 'Nice sharp portrait. A black background might have additional impact. Good luck!', '2005-09-15 22:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712847, 228340, 44299, '<td valign="top">way too much emphasis on the green tinting,  nice job on the fence though</td>', 'way too much emphasis on the green tinting,  nice job on the fence though', '2005-09-15 22:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712848, 229722, 41675, '<td valign="top">Ha ha ha, cute. Too bad the groundhog doesn''t seem to be smiling as much as the man in the background (can''t blame him though). Funny shot.</td>', 'Ha ha ha, cute. Too bad the groundhog doesn''t seem to be smiling as much as the man in the background (can''t blame him though). Funny shot.', '2005-09-15 22:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712850, 230055, 41675, '<td valign="top">I really like the light and dark. The areas around his face look a bit grainy, but you might be going for that effect, which is cool. Overall, I like it. Nice change from the stereotypical female models. Good luck! 8</td>', 'I really like the light and dark. The areas around his face look a bit grainy, but you might be going for that effect, which is cool. Overall, I like it. Nice change from the stereotypical female models. Good luck! 8', '2005-09-15 22:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712851, 228847, 31230, '<td valign="top">Okay, I love this one.  I know who you are, I know who you are.  The braids are cute.</td>', 'Okay, I love this one.  I know who you are, I know who you are.  The braids are cute.', '2005-09-15 22:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712852, 229963, 44299, '<td valign="top">nice emphasis on the eyes but picture needs something else besides a young girl standing in the grass</td>', 'nice emphasis on the eyes but picture needs something else besides a young girl standing in the grass', '2005-09-15 22:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712853, 229727, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, I think this would have greater impact if cropped above the demented spong bob on her shirt. Getting in tigher to her face. I like the expression you captured.</td>', 'For me, I think this would have greater impact if cropped above the demented spong bob on her shirt. Getting in tigher to her face. I like the expression you captured.', '2005-09-15 22:46:12.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1712854, 229378, 41675, '<td valign="top">What a cute kid. Personally, I find the overly large white border a bit much, but good capture.</td>', 'What a cute kid. Personally, I find the overly large white border a bit much, but good capture.', '2005-09-15 22:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712856, 229727, 44299, '<td valign="top">you were almost able to keep the right hand in focus with the rest of the picture... nice try...I really do mean that.  Her face tells quite a few stories, I think she would be interesting to sit down and ask her ''what are we doing wrong?"  Great composing on the bricks and her dark black shirt......it really is a good picture..wish it was mine!</td>', 'you were almost able to keep the right hand in focus with the rest of the picture... nice try...I really do mean that.  Her face tells quite a few stories, I think she would be interesting to sit down and ask her ''what are we doing wrong?"  Great composing on the bricks and her dark black shirt......it really is a good picture..wish it was mine!', '2005-09-15 22:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712857, 228520, 41675, '<td valign="top">At first, I wasn''t crazy about the saturation. The more I look at it though, I get an old world sense to it. I like having the subject in the chair - it works.</td>', 'At first, I wasn''t crazy about the saturation. The more I look at it though, I get an old world sense to it. I like having the subject in the chair - it works.', '2005-09-15 22:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712862, 230018, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the bright red chair for contrast against the faded jeans and gray background. Unfortuantely, my eyes are drawn to the very large earrings which I find kind of distracting, but overall I think you did well. Good luck in the challenege.</td>', 'I like the bright red chair for contrast against the faded jeans and gray background. Unfortuantely, my eyes are drawn to the very large earrings which I find kind of distracting, but overall I think you did well. Good luck in the challenege.', '2005-09-15 22:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712866, 228206, 41675, '<td valign="top">Il ike the contrasting white wrap with her wonderful dark skin tones and the muted background. I find that one...tree? behind her head a bit distracting, but I really like this photo - she seems natural as opposed to other entries. <br/>Good luck. :-)</td>', 'Il ike the contrasting white wrap with her wonderful dark skin tones and the muted background. I find that one...tree? behind her head a bit distracting, but I really like this photo - she seems natural as opposed to other entries. Good luck. :-)', '2005-09-15 22:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712869, 230122, 41675, '<td valign="top">To me, she seems a bit dark and....bluish. I really like the tilt of her head. Too bad for the coloring and seems a bit of motion blur or out of focus around the forehead.</td>', 'To me, she seems a bit dark and....bluish. I really like the tilt of her head. Too bad for the coloring and seems a bit of motion blur or out of focus around the forehead.', '2005-09-15 22:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712870, 228731, 41675, '<td valign="top">It''s unfortuante you weren''t able to completely get her face in focus. I like the motion of the bottom of her dress though.</td>', 'It''s unfortuante you weren''t able to completely get her face in focus. I like the motion of the bottom of her dress though.', '2005-09-15 22:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712875, 228408, 41675, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and nice neutral background and I like the composition. One of the better entries I''ve seen. Good luck! :-)</td>', 'Good lighting and nice neutral background and I like the composition. One of the better entries I''ve seen. Good luck! :-)', '2005-09-15 22:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712877, 228258, 41675, '<td valign="top">Awww, what a cute little guy. It makes me smile that here is a little boy with a baseball on his outfit, holding a truck, yet in the midst of a bed of flowers. A good photo to cherish.</td>', 'Awww, what a cute little guy. It makes me smile that here is a little boy with a baseball on his outfit, holding a truck, yet in the midst of a bed of flowers. A good photo to cherish.', '2005-09-15 22:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712879, 229508, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the overcast light in this shot and the pattern on her sweater with the pattern of the background wood grain. Good angle too.</td>', 'I like the overcast light in this shot and the pattern on her sweater with the pattern of the background wood grain. Good angle too.', '2005-09-15 22:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712880, 230373, 41675, '<td valign="top">With that hint of purple in the eyes...he is indeed royalty ;-) Nice pet portrait.</td>', 'With that hint of purple in the eyes...he is indeed royalty ;-) Nice pet portrait.', '2005-09-15 22:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712882, 230246, 23203, '<td valign="top">Wow! Nice sharp portrait. Not too sure about the crop - the negative space might have been better on the right. Good luck<br/></td>', 'Wow! Nice sharp portrait. Not too sure about the crop - the negative space might have been better on the right. Good luck', '2005-09-15 22:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712884, 230321, 41675, '<td valign="top">To me, I find the large white portion at the bottom of the photo distracting, but man...what a look he''s giving you...now that''s priceless. :-)</td>', 'To me, I find the large white portion at the bottom of the photo distracting, but man...what a look he''s giving you...now that''s priceless. :-)', '2005-09-15 22:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712888, 229770, 41675, '<td valign="top">Here I sit staring at my tiny little Nikon Coolpix 4800 and then I see this...I now have camera envy :::sigh::: Nice portrait of a photographer. I like the lighting and colors....and I still have camera envy :::heavier sigh::: :-)</td>', 'Here I sit staring at my tiny little Nikon Coolpix 4800 and then I see this...I now have camera envy :::sigh::: Nice portrait of a photographer. I like the lighting and colors....and I still have camera envy :::heavier sigh::: :-)', '2005-09-15 22:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712890, 228835, 41675, '<td valign="top">There''s something about the eyes that look...odd, but I really like how he is positioned to the side of the photo.</td>', 'There''s something about the eyes that look...odd, but I really like how he is positioned to the side of the photo.', '2005-09-15 23:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712892, 228847, 41675, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if it''s my monitor, but the skin tones seem overly red (or magenta). I like the solid black background and the look on her face makes me smile.</td>', 'I don''t know if it''s my monitor, but the skin tones seem overly red (or magenta). I like the solid black background and the look on her face makes me smile.', '2005-09-15 23:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712893, 230284, 41675, '<td valign="top">This is a nice keepsake shot for years to come. I like the eyes the best, and maybe there''s just the faintest hint of a smile. Good job.</td>', 'This is a nice keepsake shot for years to come. I like the eyes the best, and maybe there''s just the faintest hint of a smile. Good job.', '2005-09-15 23:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712894, 227597, 41675, '<td valign="top">The first thing I noticed was the whites of her eyes, her teeth and her shirt. All well contrasted by the black background. I like the bits of flying hair too. The eyes seem a bit...strange or out of focus, can''t put my finger on it, but nicely done overall.</td>', 'The first thing I noticed was the whites of her eyes, her teeth and her shirt. All well contrasted by the black background. I like the bits of flying hair too. The eyes seem a bit...strange or out of focus, can''t put my finger on it, but nicely done overall.', '2005-09-15 23:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712895, 229401, 41675, '<td valign="top">Neat shot. Very colorful and I like the off-centered composition.</td>', 'Neat shot. Very colorful and I like the off-centered composition.', '2005-09-15 23:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712896, 229867, 41675, '<td valign="top">:-D What a GREAT outfit and a terrific picture. It reminds me of my sister at that age. Thanks for the smile and goodl uck in the challenge. I hope you get a ribbon. 10!</td>', ':-D What a GREAT outfit and a terrific picture. It reminds me of my sister at that age. Thanks for the smile and goodl uck in the challenge. I hope you get a ribbon. 10!', '2005-09-15 23:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712899, 228502, 41675, '<td valign="top">Awww, what a cute photo. he seems kind of puzzled as to what''s going on, but I love that hammock. When I look at him, my eyes drift to the mountain in the background and therefore distracts a bit from the main subject (at least to my untrained eyes), but what a fun keepsake shot for the future.</td>', 'Awww, what a cute photo. he seems kind of puzzled as to what''s going on, but I love that hammock. When I look at him, my eyes drift to the mountain in the background and therefore distracts a bit from the main subject (at least to my untrained eyes), but what a fun keepsake shot for the future.', '2005-09-15 23:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712900, 228242, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, the flash has overdone some of the colors, but a good concept. Nice change from people portraits too. :)</td>', 'For me, the flash has overdone some of the colors, but a good concept. Nice change from people portraits too. :)', '2005-09-15 23:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712901, 229087, 32837, '<td valign="top">if it isn''t her name, it''s bonita. FYI. Well done shot</td>', 'if it isn''t her name, it''s bonita. FYI. Well done shot', '2005-09-15 23:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712903, 230198, 41675, '<td valign="top">Fun photo. I''m not good at technical critiques (sorry), but your photo does make me smile.</td>', 'Fun photo. I''m not good at technical critiques (sorry), but your photo does make me smile.', '2005-09-15 23:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712906, 229004, 41675, '<td valign="top">I wonder how this would look if it were cropped in a bit more from the right hand side? This would take the subject out of the center, which for me, makes photos a bit more interesting. I do like how she has a pretty white tutu against the dirty, gritty background.</td>', 'I wonder how this would look if it were cropped in a bit more from the right hand side? This would take the subject out of the center, which for me, makes photos a bit more interesting. I do like how she has a pretty white tutu against the dirty, gritty background.', '2005-09-15 23:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712909, 229949, 41675, '<td valign="top">I''m not very good at the techincal critiques, but to me, the head seems...squished in this photo. I wonder how this would look with a bit more room around the face itself?</td>', 'I''m not very good at the techincal critiques, but to me, the head seems...squished in this photo. I wonder how this would look with a bit more room around the face itself?', '2005-09-15 23:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712910, 229663, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, this would have greater interest if cropped in from the left to her shoulder - giving it a bit more interest than having the subject in the center of the photo. I like the lighting on the hair. Nice shot of a pretty lady.</td>', 'For me, this would have greater interest if cropped in from the left to her shoulder - giving it a bit more interest than having the subject in the center of the photo. I like the lighting on the hair. Nice shot of a pretty lady.', '2005-09-15 23:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712912, 228762, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like this photo. I like the soft border effect you used. It enhances the overall feeling of the photo. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like this photo. I like the soft border effect you used. It enhances the overall feeling of the photo. Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-09-15 23:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1712919, 228810, 41675, '<td valign="top">I''m not good at technical critiques...there''s something about the nose that looks...too light or something compared to the rest of her skin tones. I like the hair partially covering the one eye and the eyes themselves.</td>', 'I''m not good at technical critiques...there''s something about the nose that looks...too light or something compared to the rest of her skin tones. I like the hair partially covering the one eye and the eyes themselves.', '2005-09-15 23:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
