(1714289, 228021, 35804, '<td valign="top">I do like her gaze...very wistful, I find myself wondering what she is thinking...but the processing is a bit over done for my taste. I think this would have been just as lovely, more so really, if we could see the "natural-ness" of her skin...it''s texture, the imperfections...these are the things that make skin look "alive".</td>', 'I do like her gaze...very wistful, I find myself wondering what she is thinking...but the processing is a bit over done for my taste. I think this would have been just as lovely, more so really, if we could see the "natural-ness" of her skin...it''s texture, the imperfections...these are the things that make skin look "alive".', '2005-09-16 14:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
