(1714324, 229865, 35804, '<td valign="top">I just really love the light and simplicity of this picture! Of both portraits actually! What an intriguing idea. I also love the fact that the natural / real element of the actually photograph has been left intact...this is a photograph left in it''s purest and best form...no obvious Neat Image, no crazy photoshop"filters",  just so natural and "true" and left to be what it is...very nicely done.</td>', 'I just really love the light and simplicity of this picture! Of both portraits actually! What an intriguing idea. I also love the fact that the natural / real element of the actually photograph has been left intact...this is a photograph left in it''s purest and best form...no obvious Neat Image, no crazy photoshop"filters",  just so natural and "true" and left to be what it is...very nicely done.', '2005-09-16 14:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
