(1714440, 229424, 17507, '<td valign="top">the light from above has created unflattering shadows under her nose and chin- try lighting that''s from a lower angle next time. also, a flatter background might have helped, or simply using a wide aperture (eg 3.5, 2.8) for a narrower DOF.</td>', 'the light from above has created unflattering shadows under her nose and chin- try lighting that''s from a lower angle next time. also, a flatter background might have helped, or simply using a wide aperture (eg 3.5, 2.8) for a narrower DOF.', '2005-09-16 16:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1714442, 229610, 17507, '<td valign="top">I understand that this guy was probably just about as red and raw looking as he appears in this photo... but it would have been more flattering to him (without detracting from its effectiveness as a portrait) if you''d desaturated the reds a bit. He''d still look chafed and weathered without looking quite so burnt.</td>', 'I understand that this guy was probably just about as red and raw looking as he appears in this photo... but it would have been more flattering to him (without detracting from its effectiveness as a portrait) if you''d desaturated the reds a bit. He''d still look chafed and weathered without looking quite so burnt.', '2005-09-16 16:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
