(1714616, 229574, 42328, '<td valign="top">I would have lifted up the blinds in the background to give it a backlit effect ...providing that there was available light.  If this was taken in the evening then I would have waited to take this during daylight hours.  I also might have used a reflector to pop some light onto her face.  I don''t care for  the hair accessory on her wrist.<br/>Smile is nice.  Pose is good.</td>', 'I would have lifted up the blinds in the background to give it a backlit effect ...providing that there was available light.  If this was taken in the evening then I would have waited to take this during daylight hours.  I also might have used a reflector to pop some light onto her face.  I don''t care for  the hair accessory on her wrist.Smile is nice.  Pose is good.', '2005-09-16 17:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
