(1714674, 228910, 2553, '<td valign="top">I adore this shot, it''s one of my favorites in the challenge, and even more so now that I am back to look at it again, and comment.  Her outfit goes so well with the overall color tone of the rest of the photo, and yet the colors she''s wearing are superbly vivid.  I love the look on her face, the way her hair is done, the dainty little necklace, just everything.  Composition is wonderful too.  Great work here!</td>', 'I adore this shot, it''s one of my favorites in the challenge, and even more so now that I am back to look at it again, and comment.  Her outfit goes so well with the overall color tone of the rest of the photo, and yet the colors she''s wearing are superbly vivid.  I love the look on her face, the way her hair is done, the dainty little necklace, just everything.  Composition is wonderful too.  Great work here!', '2005-09-16 17:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1714677, 229475, 2553, '<td valign="top">This is lovely, I like the tight crop, and the the side light.  I can imagine that some will say it needs more light, but I don''t think so, I think the lighting is perfect for the subject.</td>', 'This is lovely, I like the tight crop, and the the side light.  I can imagine that some will say it needs more light, but I don''t think so, I think the lighting is perfect for the subject.', '2005-09-16 17:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
