(1715186, 230376, 42328, '<td valign="top">Very naturally pretty model. I don''t like the fact that part of her face is cut off (the left side &amp; her chin).  Also, there needs to be more light on her face. A lighter background might have worked better as well, to give more contrast between the model and the wall.  I like her stare into the camera.  Good luck  :)</td>', 'Very naturally pretty model. I don''t like the fact that part of her face is cut off (the left side & her chin).  Also, there needs to be more light on her face. A lighter background might have worked better as well, to give more contrast between the model and the wall.  I like her stare into the camera.  Good luck  :)', '2005-09-16 21:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715190, 229122, 11895, '<td valign="top">my attention keeps going back to her eyes, they''re great</td>', 'my attention keeps going back to her eyes, they''re great', '2005-09-16 21:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715236, 230364, 11895, '<td valign="top">colorful, but this is more like digital art than a portrait, portraits need to show face(s)</td>', 'colorful, but this is more like digital art than a portrait, portraits need to show face(s)', '2005-09-16 21:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715238, 230336, 33899, '<td valign="top">i think the heads should be placed to the left more to make it perfectly symmetrical. also, the head on the right seems a bit overexposed. exposure might have been off because the black shirts might have messed with the exposure calculation</td>', 'i think the heads should be placed to the left more to make it perfectly symmetrical. also, the head on the right seems a bit overexposed. exposure might have been off because the black shirts might have messed with the exposure calculation', '2005-09-16 21:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715241, 227897, 33899, '<td valign="top">would have liked a bit more saturation in the orange and yellow channels to bring out more vibrance to the photo</td>', 'would have liked a bit more saturation in the orange and yellow channels to bring out more vibrance to the photo', '2005-09-16 21:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715243, 229944, 33899, '<td valign="top">overall picture seems a bit out of focus. remember to make sure that the eyes are in focus</td>', 'overall picture seems a bit out of focus. remember to make sure that the eyes are in focus', '2005-09-16 21:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715248, 229809, 33899, '<td valign="top">although the light source is coming off from the right and slightly above the model''s head, it still appears a bit flat. also a tighter cropped might have been better</td>', 'although the light source is coming off from the right and slightly above the model''s head, it still appears a bit flat. also a tighter cropped might have been better', '2005-09-16 21:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715250, 228365, 39163, '<td valign="top">Great picture, but I  reserve top mark for those who managed to get people to pose for tehm</td>', 'Great picture, but I  reserve top mark for those who managed to get people to pose for tehm', '2005-09-16 21:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715252, 230158, 33899, '<td valign="top">seems a tad underexposed. also try to achieve the most distance between the background on the model as possible to get a better background blur. the background leaves still seem to be a bit too defined.</td>', 'seems a tad underexposed. also try to achieve the most distance between the background on the model as possible to get a better background blur. the background leaves still seem to be a bit too defined.', '2005-09-16 21:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715254, 229439, 39163, '<td valign="top">Love it one of the few with character I have seen so far.  Great lighting. 9</td>', 'Love it one of the few with character I have seen so far.  Great lighting. 9', '2005-09-16 21:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715260, 229905, 33899, '<td valign="top">i think it would look cool if the only thing that outlined the eye was the eye lashes. maybe dodge out the skin parts.</td>', 'i think it would look cool if the only thing that outlined the eye was the eye lashes. maybe dodge out the skin parts.', '2005-09-16 21:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715268, 230057, 33899, '<td valign="top">it looks like you used the camera flash, which is good as a fill. but when the sun doesn''t do much to contribute to the lighting, the lighting and thus the picture always seems to look a bit flat. with stright on lighting, the picture loses a lot of it''s 3d feel. also the picture looks a bit cool. im not sure if this was a white balance issue</td>', 'it looks like you used the camera flash, which is good as a fill. but when the sun doesn''t do much to contribute to the lighting, the lighting and thus the picture always seems to look a bit flat. with stright on lighting, the picture loses a lot of it''s 3d feel. also the picture looks a bit cool. im not sure if this was a white balance issue', '2005-09-16 21:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715272, 229795, 39163, '<td valign="top">I like the colouring.  I don''t really connect with the subject</td>', 'I like the colouring.  I don''t really connect with the subject', '2005-09-16 21:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715279, 230142, 33899, '<td valign="top">the title, expression, and background of the picture seems to promote a sense of sadness. however, the lighting is soft and broad, almost boardering a high key (shadowless) effect. this soft lighting usually doesn''t promote the sense of drama or sadness as well as harsh or high key lighting. an easy way to achieve a harsh lighting setup is to use a single, powerful, source of light (such as a street lamp or something at night)</td>', 'the title, expression, and background of the picture seems to promote a sense of sadness. however, the lighting is soft and broad, almost boardering a high key (shadowless) effect. this soft lighting usually doesn''t promote the sense of drama or sadness as well as harsh or high key lighting. an easy way to achieve a harsh lighting setup is to use a single, powerful, source of light (such as a street lamp or something at night)', '2005-09-16 21:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715285, 230290, 33899, '<td valign="top">blue channels seem to be oversaturated. background seem to have an off-white or beige ton to it which somewhat matches the contrast levels of the skin. this tends to mesh the background and the model to the same tone, instead of separating the subject from its background</td>', 'blue channels seem to be oversaturated. background seem to have an off-white or beige ton to it which somewhat matches the contrast levels of the skin. this tends to mesh the background and the model to the same tone, instead of separating the subject from its background', '2005-09-16 21:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715288, 229092, 33899, '<td valign="top">hmm the model seems to have squinted at the shutter. one way to avoid this is to have the model blink several times or close his/her eyes before the shot. and then open them right before you take the picture.</td>', 'hmm the model seems to have squinted at the shutter. one way to avoid this is to have the model blink several times or close his/her eyes before the shot. and then open them right before you take the picture.', '2005-09-16 21:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715291, 229380, 33899, '<td valign="top">good even lighting, however, i dont think the horizontal format works for this shot. i think vertical would hav ebeen better.</td>', 'good even lighting, however, i dont think the horizontal format works for this shot. i think vertical would hav ebeen better.', '2005-09-16 21:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715294, 228910, 37938, '<td valign="top">gorgeous photograph.</td>', 'gorgeous photograph.', '2005-09-16 21:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715302, 229471, 33899, '<td valign="top">the right side of the background seems a bit over complicated and it detracts the viewers eye from the subject</td>', 'the right side of the background seems a bit over complicated and it detracts the viewers eye from the subject', '2005-09-16 21:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715304, 229744, 33899, '<td valign="top">a bit overexposed on the white parts of the picture. the highlights along the face are a bit blown out.</td>', 'a bit overexposed on the white parts of the picture. the highlights along the face are a bit blown out.', '2005-09-16 21:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715309, 229773, 33899, '<td valign="top">you seem to have gotten flare along the top left.  also the model seems to be squinting slightly. have the model  close her eyes before the shutter</td>', 'you seem to have gotten flare along the top left.  also the model seems to be squinting slightly. have the model  close her eyes before the shutter', '2005-09-16 21:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715312, 230306, 33899, '<td valign="top">face is exposed well. however because you chose to shoot your light from below head level there is not a lot of light to cover the hair area. and your model has a great hair style. either use a another light as a hair light or get a reflector to channel some light back down onto the hair</td>', 'face is exposed well. however because you chose to shoot your light from below head level there is not a lot of light to cover the hair area. and your model has a great hair style. either use a another light as a hair light or get a reflector to channel some light back down onto the hair', '2005-09-16 21:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715313, 228365, 33899, '<td valign="top">i think a tighter crop would have been better. a lot of the left side doesn''t really contribute much to the picture in my opinion and can be taken out of the picture</td>', 'i think a tighter crop would have been better. a lot of the left side doesn''t really contribute much to the picture in my opinion and can be taken out of the picture', '2005-09-16 21:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715318, 229722, 33899, '<td valign="top">hmm the guy''s head isn''t blurred enough, it''s sort of inbetween blur and in focus. but i''m not sure what parameters you''re working with. as for the squirrel, the focus is on the hair around the cheek area, the eye seems to be slightly out of the depth of field</td>', 'hmm the guy''s head isn''t blurred enough, it''s sort of inbetween blur and in focus. but i''m not sure what parameters you''re working with. as for the squirrel, the focus is on the hair around the cheek area, the eye seems to be slightly out of the depth of field', '2005-09-16 21:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715324, 230299, 33899, '<td valign="top">the picture seems a bit overexposed because the left side of the face shows some blown out highlights. also, it looks like you used window (ambient) light and a lamp. this introduces complications between the color temperature of the lights. thus, you have a blue and orange side of the face due to the different lights. it''s best to use a reflector on window portraits instead of a new light source because of this color temperature difference.</td>', 'the picture seems a bit overexposed because the left side of the face shows some blown out highlights. also, it looks like you used window (ambient) light and a lamp. this introduces complications between the color temperature of the lights. thus, you have a blue and orange side of the face due to the different lights. it''s best to use a reflector on window portraits instead of a new light source because of this color temperature difference.', '2005-09-16 21:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715325, 229727, 13026, '<td valign="top">Neat...Joey?  The face coulda been just a touch sharper, I think, but other than that, really nice.<br/>I like the tilt you got going on.  :)</td>', 'Neat...Joey?  The face coulda been just a touch sharper, I think, but other than that, really nice.I like the tilt you got going on.  :)', '2005-09-16 21:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715326, 229424, 33899, '<td valign="top">good choice of butterfly style lighting, however, it still seems a bit harsh. diffusion from a softbox or any sort of transparent layer might have been better.</td>', 'good choice of butterfly style lighting, however, it still seems a bit harsh. diffusion from a softbox or any sort of transparent layer might have been better.', '2005-09-16 21:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715327, 230229, 13026, '<td valign="top">Burning on the side of her face is painfully obvious here.  :(</td>', 'Burning on the side of her face is painfully obvious here.  :(', '2005-09-16 21:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715331, 230098, 13026, '<td valign="top">Cool piercings, they''re awesome.  :)</td>', 'Cool piercings, they''re awesome.  :)', '2005-09-16 21:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715333, 229115, 33899, '<td valign="top">i think this picture lacks some interaction. i would shoot at a weird angle and have the model do some pose that provokes a sense of movement.</td>', 'i think this picture lacks some interaction. i would shoot at a weird angle and have the model do some pose that provokes a sense of movement.', '2005-09-16 21:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715338, 230353, 33899, '<td valign="top">seems a bit overexposed. and i''m not sure if the horizontal format works well. there is not much border space along the left side. usually the phtoographer has a model look off to a side and goes for a horizontal shot he/she leaves room along the side where the model is looking</td>', 'seems a bit overexposed. and i''m not sure if the horizontal format works well. there is not much border space along the left side. usually the phtoographer has a model look off to a side and goes for a horizontal shot he/she leaves room along the side where the model is looking', '2005-09-16 21:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715342, 229337, 33899, '<td valign="top">picture seems to need a boost in saturation. and it might be interesting to frame the head with that ring thing that got cropped off. as in it might be interesting to include the whole ring instead of cutting it off</td>', 'picture seems to need a boost in saturation. and it might be interesting to frame the head with that ring thing that got cropped off. as in it might be interesting to include the whole ring instead of cutting it off', '2005-09-16 21:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715345, 229842, 33899, '<td valign="top">great lighting, but it seems slightly overexposed along the left side of the sweater and a bit on the hair. -.3EV might have been good.</td>', 'great lighting, but it seems slightly overexposed along the left side of the sweater and a bit on the hair. -.3EV might have been good.', '2005-09-16 22:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715350, 229981, 33899, '<td valign="top">this picture has a lot of feel to it, but certain areas seem a bit soft or out of focus, like the eyes, parts of the beard. the focus issue on the eyes is probably due to the distortion from the glasses though.</td>', 'this picture has a lot of feel to it, but certain areas seem a bit soft or out of focus, like the eyes, parts of the beard. the focus issue on the eyes is probably due to the distortion from the glasses though.', '2005-09-16 22:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715352, 228857, 33899, '<td valign="top">maybe cropped a bit too tight on the lip, it seems like it''s almost touching the frame. soft focus works well and gives it that dreamy feel. i also like the tones on the hair.</td>', 'maybe cropped a bit too tight on the lip, it seems like it''s almost touching the frame. soft focus works well and gives it that dreamy feel. i also like the tones on the hair.', '2005-09-16 22:03:26.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1715355, 230298, 33899, '<td valign="top">hmm the background is a bit too in focus. of course, you''re limited by not being able to ask the drummer to move away from the crowd more and by the limitations of your camera lens. however, you can try to get closer and the background blur will increase.</td>', 'hmm the background is a bit too in focus. of course, you''re limited by not being able to ask the drummer to move away from the crowd more and by the limitations of your camera lens. however, you can try to get closer and the background blur will increase.', '2005-09-16 22:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715359, 230344, 33899, '<td valign="top">highlights on the forehead and hand look blownout. but the color and saturation is very good.</td>', 'highlights on the forehead and hand look blownout. but the color and saturation is very good.', '2005-09-16 22:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715360, 228849, 33899, '<td valign="top">it''s hard to get a lot of light when your subject is facing away from the sun. but it''s better than risking weird shadows from the sun. the way to remedy the lack of light is to use a reflector like a piece of white three-ply board.</td>', 'it''s hard to get a lot of light when your subject is facing away from the sun. but it''s better than risking weird shadows from the sun. the way to remedy the lack of light is to use a reflector like a piece of white three-ply board.', '2005-09-16 22:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715362, 228381, 33899, '<td valign="top">picture seems a bit oversharpened to where you get some grain on the defined edges.</td>', 'picture seems a bit oversharpened to where you get some grain on the defined edges.', '2005-09-16 22:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715382, 228125, 38911, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model  lovely picture.  Great job! :o)</td>', 'Beautiful model  lovely picture.  Great job! :o)', '2005-09-16 22:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715384, 228810, 38911, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model  lovely picture.  Great job! :o)</td>', 'Beautiful model  lovely picture.  Great job! :o)', '2005-09-16 22:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715392, 230296, 38911, '<td valign="top">Good capture  I like the easy going feel to it.  Great job! <br/>8o)<br/></td>', 'Good capture  I like the easy going feel to it.  Great job! 8o)', '2005-09-16 22:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715394, 230091, 25355, '<td valign="top">Why fire Mark? He''s been doing a good job. If anyone should be fired, it''s Bruce. ;-)<br/> <br/>Ok, about the picture. I''m probably not the first to say it, but isn''t the figure too centrally located? Perhaps crop off some of the left side.</td>', 'Why fire Mark? He''s been doing a good job. If anyone should be fired, it''s Bruce. ;-) Ok, about the picture. I''m probably not the first to say it, but isn''t the figure too centrally located? Perhaps crop off some of the left side.', '2005-09-16 22:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715395, 229608, 38911, '<td valign="top">Great capture of mother &amp; son!  Very warm  good job!<br/>:&gt;)<br/></td>', 'Great capture of mother & son!  Very warm  good job!:>)', '2005-09-16 22:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715397, 228762, 38911, '<td valign="top">Great capture of mother &amp; daughter!  Very warm  good job!<br/>:&gt;)<br/></td>', 'Great capture of mother & daughter!  Very warm  good job!:>)', '2005-09-16 22:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715399, 230280, 25355, '<td valign="top">I presume "Avarice" is the name of the band (if this is a band). "Grumpy Young Men" would be an apt title, too ;-) Shame about the roofing in the background; plain sky would have been better.</td>', 'I presume "Avarice" is the name of the band (if this is a band). "Grumpy Young Men" would be an apt title, too ;-) Shame about the roofing in the background; plain sky would have been better.', '2005-09-16 22:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715400, 229602, 42328, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  Such expressive eyes.  I love how you can see the life she''s lived right on her face.  The blouse is a great color as well.</td>', 'I really like this.  Such expressive eyes.  I love how you can see the life she''s lived right on her face.  The blouse is a great color as well.', '2005-09-16 22:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715403, 228520, 25355, '<td valign="top">I would like a little space between the top of the head and the frame...<br/>I like the processing, though the shirt is a bit blown out in places.</td>', 'I would like a little space between the top of the head and the frame...I like the processing, though the shirt is a bit blown out in places.', '2005-09-16 22:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715405, 229362, 42328, '<td valign="top">How adorable.  I like the pose and his smile.  Nicely lit, too.</td>', 'How adorable.  I like the pose and his smile.  Nicely lit, too.', '2005-09-16 22:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715407, 229325, 25355, '<td valign="top">Is this the one getting lots of odd comments but getting a high score?</td>', 'Is this the one getting lots of odd comments but getting a high score?', '2005-09-16 22:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715410, 230358, 42328, '<td valign="top">I really like this. The cuteness factor is overwhelming.  :D  But something about the position of the hand bothers me.  I suppose ideally it would look better if the hand were open &amp; the kitty was sitting in the palm of it.  Still a great shot.</td>', 'I really like this. The cuteness factor is overwhelming.  :D  But something about the position of the hand bothers me.  I suppose ideally it would look better if the hand were open & the kitty was sitting in the palm of it.  Still a great shot.', '2005-09-16 22:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715413, 228849, 42328, '<td valign="top">What a lovely image.</td>', 'What a lovely image.', '2005-09-16 22:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
