(1715806, 230111, 44319, '<td valign="top">Perfect light</td>', 'Perfect light', '2005-09-17 04:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715807, 227475, 41337, '<td valign="top">The focusing seems off. Also the color contrast between his arm and face is weird looking. Was he out in the sun with a bag over his face?</td>', 'The focusing seems off. Also the color contrast between his arm and face is weird looking. Was he out in the sun with a bag over his face?', '2005-09-17 04:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715808, 230231, 34547, '<td valign="top">Wow! You did it. You captured "it". Perfect photograph in my eyes. The tones and contrast are just right. 10</td>', 'Wow! You did it. You captured "it". Perfect photograph in my eyes. The tones and contrast are just right. 10', '2005-09-17 04:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715811, 229696, 34547, '<td valign="top">A decent photo to say the least but the touch-up work in the face makes it look a bit over-processed where the skin meets more detailed areas in the hair, eyebrows, and goatee.</td>', 'A decent photo to say the least but the touch-up work in the face makes it look a bit over-processed where the skin meets more detailed areas in the hair, eyebrows, and goatee.', '2005-09-17 04:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715813, 230271, 41337, '<td valign="top">I''ll be honest. I don''t really like this photo. The alligator kinda looks like a giant turd floating in muddy water and the boy''s expression is too contrived. On the plus side the lighting on the boy''s face is good.</td>', 'I''ll be honest. I don''t really like this photo. The alligator kinda looks like a giant turd floating in muddy water and the boy''s expression is too contrived. On the plus side the lighting on the boy''s face is good.', '2005-09-17 04:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715815, 230369, 34547, '<td valign="top">Very reminiscent of the National Geographic photo. A decent job on the lighting and color choice to contrast the eyes. The light appears to be coming from left and right sides leaving a sort of darker area right down the middle of the face. But I am by no means knowledgeable in the art of studio lighting. You have done a great job here.</td>', 'Very reminiscent of the National Geographic photo. A decent job on the lighting and color choice to contrast the eyes. The light appears to be coming from left and right sides leaving a sort of darker area right down the middle of the face. But I am by no means knowledgeable in the art of studio lighting. You have done a great job here.', '2005-09-17 04:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715817, 228408, 34547, '<td valign="top">So tell me, which way is the beach?</td>', 'So tell me, which way is the beach?', '2005-09-17 04:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715819, 230336, 41337, '<td valign="top">The first thing I see is the contrast between their skin. The eyes are aligned but that''s not what I take from this. Perhaps if they were wearing more eye makeup it would demand more attention?</td>', 'The first thing I see is the contrast between their skin. The eyes are aligned but that''s not what I take from this. Perhaps if they were wearing more eye makeup it would demand more attention?', '2005-09-17 04:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715820, 230218, 41337, '<td valign="top">The horse looks too boxed in.</td>', 'The horse looks too boxed in.', '2005-09-17 04:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715821, 229044, 41337, '<td valign="top">This would look better with a greater DOF.</td>', 'This would look better with a greater DOF.', '2005-09-17 04:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715822, 229838, 34547, '<td valign="top">Looks like a perfume ad. I like how you''ve lit the background and model.  The flower is a perfect addition. It looks just a tad out of focus in the further areas of the face; could use a greater DOF. 9+</td>', 'Looks like a perfume ad. I like how you''ve lit the background and model.  The flower is a perfect addition. It looks just a tad out of focus in the further areas of the face; could use a greater DOF. 9+', '2005-09-17 04:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715823, 229124, 41337, '<td valign="top">Too funny. I like the detail but the face seems to be lacking a little sharpness except for the hair.  Also the border looks too cheezy although it fits with the theme that this is a "cheap" model shoot.</td>', 'Too funny. I like the detail but the face seems to be lacking a little sharpness except for the hair.  Also the border looks too cheezy although it fits with the theme that this is a "cheap" model shoot.', '2005-09-17 04:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715824, 228978, 34547, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit over-photoshopped in places but this is damn near perfect. With those features, I would not be surprised if she holds still for photos for a living. Great hair and makeup, wonderfully lit, fantastic lines...and those lips...ohhh.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-09-19 02:20:17.</i></td>', 'Looks a bit over-photoshopped in places but this is damn near perfect. With those features, I would not be surprised if she holds still for photos for a living. Great hair and makeup, wonderfully lit, fantastic lines...and those lips...ohhh.', '2005-09-17 04:39:19.000000', '2005-09-19 03:20:17.000000', 1),
(1715825, 229428, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like the style. It''s simple yet there''s a lot to see.</td>', 'I like the style. It''s simple yet there''s a lot to see.', '2005-09-17 04:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715826, 230361, 34547, '<td valign="top">Neither one having a good time, ehh.</td>', 'Neither one having a good time, ehh.', '2005-09-17 04:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715827, 227430, 41337, '<td valign="top">I would have just gone with a different title so as to avoid cropping the head.</td>', 'I would have just gone with a different title so as to avoid cropping the head.', '2005-09-17 04:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715831, 228762, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. I love the way the subjects fill the frame. You also captured the mood very well. You should lose the border. Doesn''t really add anything.</td>', 'Nice photo. I love the way the subjects fill the frame. You also captured the mood very well. You should lose the border. Doesn''t really add anything.', '2005-09-17 04:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715832, 230310, 41337, '<td valign="top">I love the color and the composition especially the way the sweater/scarf wraps around her and then fades into the corner. I also love the lighting on her face. The background is a bit distracting in that it has some detail but then just fades out.</td>', 'I love the color and the composition especially the way the sweater/scarf wraps around her and then fades into the corner. I also love the lighting on her face. The background is a bit distracting in that it has some detail but then just fades out.', '2005-09-17 04:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715835, 229954, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like the way you framed the shot.</td>', 'I like the way you framed the shot.', '2005-09-17 04:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715836, 230083, 41337, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of one of those liquor ads where the person''s wild side is shown through the bottle. You don''t quite have all of her "wild side" seen through the syrup but it''s still looks cool.</td>', 'This reminds me of one of those liquor ads where the person''s wild side is shown through the bottle. You don''t quite have all of her "wild side" seen through the syrup but it''s still looks cool.', '2005-09-17 05:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715838, 230172, 41337, '<td valign="top">Detail is good on the face but her shoulder and hair is too blurred. Makes it look too unnatural.</td>', 'Detail is good on the face but her shoulder and hair is too blurred. Makes it look too unnatural.', '2005-09-17 05:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715840, 228591, 41337, '<td valign="top">Love the DOF. Don''t care too much for the pose. Maybe if her hands were locked together under her chin it would add to the symmetry? Or just one hand under her chin? Ok I just don''t care too much for the way the chin looks here. :)</td>', 'Love the DOF. Don''t care too much for the pose. Maybe if her hands were locked together under her chin it would add to the symmetry? Or just one hand under her chin? Ok I just don''t care too much for the way the chin looks here. :)', '2005-09-17 05:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715842, 229905, 41337, '<td valign="top">Not sharp and the composition doesn''t work. Why are you cutting off the right side? If you wanted to keep the iris away from the center maybe try looking off to the side?</td>', 'Not sharp and the composition doesn''t work. Why are you cutting off the right side? If you wanted to keep the iris away from the center maybe try looking off to the side?', '2005-09-17 05:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715845, 229663, 41337, '<td valign="top">The first thing I notice is the cross which seems to have a mysterious dark shadow around it.</td>', 'The first thing I notice is the cross which seems to have a mysterious dark shadow around it.', '2005-09-17 05:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715847, 229608, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the nice warm tone, and the composition of this, but actually find the tree trunk to be a bit distracting. A very sweet picture though.</td>', 'I like the nice warm tone, and the composition of this, but actually find the tree trunk to be a bit distracting. A very sweet picture though.', '2005-09-17 05:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715849, 230149, 2553, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp shot, and I like the composition, but would really like to be able to see even the tiniest bit of the iris of the other eye - just being able to see that bit of orange feels a bit odd.  The color in the eyes looks a bit oversaturated, but I''m not taking anything away from the shot for that because, of course, it''s entirely possible that it is actually  the exact color!</td>', 'Nice sharp shot, and I like the composition, but would really like to be able to see even the tiniest bit of the iris of the other eye - just being able to see that bit of orange feels a bit odd.  The color in the eyes looks a bit oversaturated, but I''m not taking anything away from the shot for that because, of course, it''s entirely possible that it is actually  the exact color!', '2005-09-17 05:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715850, 228978, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very clean 3d model-ish look. Personally I like a little more detail in the skin.</td>', 'Very clean 3d model-ish look. Personally I like a little more detail in the skin.', '2005-09-17 05:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715851, 230347, 41337, '<td valign="top">Did you clone out something at the bottom near her hair? Doesn''t look good.</td>', 'Did you clone out something at the bottom near her hair? Doesn''t look good.', '2005-09-17 05:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715852, 230369, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the black background, the red scarf, and the beautiful eyes, but am not entirely crazy about the lighting on the face. I think I would have preferred to see lighting from one side only, giving a more mysterious look to the shot.</td>', 'I like the black background, the red scarf, and the beautiful eyes, but am not entirely crazy about the lighting on the face. I think I would have preferred to see lighting from one side only, giving a more mysterious look to the shot.', '2005-09-17 05:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715853, 228826, 41337, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the brightness effect here.</td>', 'I don''t like the brightness effect here.', '2005-09-17 05:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715857, 230018, 2553, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model, good concept, but for me, the bright red "industrial looking" chair clashes with the casually soft sensuallity of the model. I would love to have seen her draped over chair that was a bit "classier".  That being said, I must take into account the possiblity that this more industrial look was actually what you were going for, and if that is the case, then it is pretty well done.  The lighting is a bit bright for my taste in this instance, but the composition feels right, the model seems at ease, and the shot looks like a contemporary ad.  This might be a good stock shot.</td>', 'Beautiful model, good concept, but for me, the bright red "industrial looking" chair clashes with the casually soft sensuallity of the model. I would love to have seen her draped over chair that was a bit "classier".  That being said, I must take into account the possiblity that this more industrial look was actually what you were going for, and if that is the case, then it is pretty well done.  The lighting is a bit bright for my taste in this instance, but the composition feels right, the model seems at ease, and the shot looks like a contemporary ad.  This might be a good stock shot.', '2005-09-17 05:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715858, 229731, 41337, '<td valign="top">Striking photo! Love the eyes.</td>', 'Striking photo! Love the eyes.', '2005-09-17 05:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715859, 230101, 2553, '<td valign="top">Good clarity and sharpness, and I like the nice tight crop.  Reflection adds unexpected interest.</td>', 'Good clarity and sharpness, and I like the nice tight crop.  Reflection adds unexpected interest.', '2005-09-17 05:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715860, 229629, 41337, '<td valign="top">Is this guy dead?</td>', 'Is this guy dead?', '2005-09-17 05:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715861, 228952, 2553, '<td valign="top">Quite a beautiful woman.  I love the richness of the jewelry and the lovely fabric.  A lovely shot.</td>', 'Quite a beautiful woman.  I love the richness of the jewelry and the lovely fabric.  A lovely shot.', '2005-09-17 05:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715863, 229623, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the crop and composition, as well as the simplicity of the shot.  The lighting looks a bit harsh, and though I can''t really put my finger on why, the eyes feel a bit oversharpened - maybe it''s just the double reflection.</td>', 'I like the crop and composition, as well as the simplicity of the shot.  The lighting looks a bit harsh, and though I can''t really put my finger on why, the eyes feel a bit oversharpened - maybe it''s just the double reflection.', '2005-09-17 06:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715864, 229959, 2553, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous child, and she is just lovely in the soft light.  Depth of field seems razor thin - I honestly would have loved to have seen more sharpness on all those tendrils of hair in the light.  Beautiful shot though!</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous child, and she is just lovely in the soft light.  Depth of field seems razor thin - I honestly would have loved to have seen more sharpness on all those tendrils of hair in the light.  Beautiful shot though!', '2005-09-17 06:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715865, 229773, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait that could use some post processing to improve contrast.</td>', 'Nice portrait that could use some post processing to improve contrast.', '2005-09-17 06:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715867, 228502, 2553, '<td valign="top">Though this is an adorable shot, I would like to have seen a bit more of a dynamic composition.  The mountain in the background is distracting, and I would like to have seen that little face turned more towards the light.  The concept of him in the hammock (or whatever it is), is great, and the colors are lovely - perhaps try some different angles of approach and definitely some closer crops.</td>', 'Though this is an adorable shot, I would like to have seen a bit more of a dynamic composition.  The mountain in the background is distracting, and I would like to have seen that little face turned more towards the light.  The concept of him in the hammock (or whatever it is), is great, and the colors are lovely - perhaps try some different angles of approach and definitely some closer crops.', '2005-09-17 06:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715868, 229401, 2553, '<td valign="top">This is just incredibly beautiful.  Not only the lovely model, but the nice crisp saturated colors, and the perfect dof.  Not crazy about the composition, but not knowing the circumstances, I can''t say how it might be improved.  Nevertheless, quite a lovely shot.</td>', 'This is just incredibly beautiful.  Not only the lovely model, but the nice crisp saturated colors, and the perfect dof.  Not crazy about the composition, but not knowing the circumstances, I can''t say how it might be improved.  Nevertheless, quite a lovely shot.', '2005-09-17 06:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715870, 227851, 2553, '<td valign="top">Simple and lovely.  In this case, I think I might have liked a bit deeper depth of field to bring out more of the texture of the fabric - I think it adds to the shot rather than taking away from it.</td>', 'Simple and lovely.  In this case, I think I might have liked a bit deeper depth of field to bring out more of the texture of the fabric - I think it adds to the shot rather than taking away from it.', '2005-09-17 06:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715872, 229711, 41337, '<td valign="top">The tree takes up too much real estate for something that isn''t the focus of the shot.</td>', 'The tree takes up too much real estate for something that isn''t the focus of the shot.', '2005-09-17 06:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715873, 229045, 2553, '<td valign="top">Get closer, get closer, get closer!!  I would love to have seen a much tighter crop on this lovely child.  I think it would be much more powerful, bring out the colors much more, and be a much more dynamic composition. I love her posture, and the look on her face, this is a very nice capture!</td>', 'Get closer, get closer, get closer!!  I would love to have seen a much tighter crop on this lovely child.  I think it would be much more powerful, bring out the colors much more, and be a much more dynamic composition. I love her posture, and the look on her face, this is a very nice capture!', '2005-09-17 06:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715875, 229729, 41337, '<td valign="top">Don''t like this effect.</td>', 'Don''t like this effect.', '2005-09-17 06:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715876, 229691, 2553, '<td valign="top">Closer!! I want to see more babies, and less "green"!  This is just wonderful, but I think it would be much more powerful if it was a MUCH closer crop.  The positioning of the babies is already a good composition, and zooming in on them could only help.</td>', 'Closer!! I want to see more babies, and less "green"!  This is just wonderful, but I think it would be much more powerful if it was a MUCH closer crop.  The positioning of the babies is already a good composition, and zooming in on them could only help.', '2005-09-17 06:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715877, 229696, 41337, '<td valign="top">You''ve eliminated too much of the facial features, which makes it look too fake.</td>', 'You''ve eliminated too much of the facial features, which makes it look too fake.', '2005-09-17 06:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715878, 229795, 2553, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... I don''t really care for this.  The color is quite harsh, the amount of "movement" in the photo is quite distracting, and I''m really not sure what the concept is.  I suppose in the strictest sense of "portrait", this is one, but I prefer to see something of a person''s face in a portrait.</td>', 'Hmmm... I don''t really care for this.  The color is quite harsh, the amount of "movement" in the photo is quite distracting, and I''m really not sure what the concept is.  I suppose in the strictest sense of "portrait", this is one, but I prefer to see something of a person''s face in a portrait.', '2005-09-17 06:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715879, 229915, 41337, '<td valign="top">Don''t really care for these contrived setups unless they produce a really striking photo. This one doesn''t in my opinion.</td>', 'Don''t really care for these contrived setups unless they produce a really striking photo. This one doesn''t in my opinion.', '2005-09-17 06:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715880, 229744, 41337, '<td valign="top">Wow is this colorful! Would have liked to see more DOF but otherwise a nice shot!</td>', 'Wow is this colorful! Would have liked to see more DOF but otherwise a nice shot!', '2005-09-17 06:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715881, 227575, 2553, '<td valign="top">This is very small, which, for me, makes it more difficult to formulate a comment on.  The colors seem very saturated, and the lighting, at least from what I can tell, feels harsh.  A tighter crop on the lips and flower might help the composition  by cropping out the unflattering shadow on the left side.</td>', 'This is very small, which, for me, makes it more difficult to formulate a comment on.  The colors seem very saturated, and the lighting, at least from what I can tell, feels harsh.  A tighter crop on the lips and flower might help the composition  by cropping out the unflattering shadow on the left side.', '2005-09-17 06:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715882, 228408, 41337, '<td valign="top">Would have liked to see the elbow in the shot. Other than that good photo.</td>', 'Would have liked to see the elbow in the shot. Other than that good photo.', '2005-09-17 06:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715883, 230324, 41337, '<td valign="top">Looks too much like pop art for my liking.</td>', 'Looks too much like pop art for my liking.', '2005-09-17 06:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715884, 229941, 41337, '<td valign="top">Great color.</td>', 'Great color.', '2005-09-17 06:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715885, 229729, 2553, '<td valign="top">Though I am a big fan of high-key shots, I don''t care for this one.  I would love to have seen this as a more straightforward portrait.  It''s a nice tight crop, and the composition isn''t bad, though I think I would have cropped even farther in on the right side. <br/> <br/>This has almost an invisible man feel to it. I find the areas of red tones very "off-putting", and it seems kind of weird to see all those hairs floating around in space without really looking like they are attached to a face. <br/> <br/></td>', 'Though I am a big fan of high-key shots, I don''t care for this one.  I would love to have seen this as a more straightforward portrait.  It''s a nice tight crop, and the composition isn''t bad, though I think I would have cropped even farther in on the right side.  This has almost an invisible man feel to it. I find the areas of red tones very "off-putting", and it seems kind of weird to see all those hairs floating around in space without really looking like they are attached to a face.  ', '2005-09-17 06:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715886, 230055, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like this. I kinda wish one of the patches of light crossed his face but the bill of his cap prevents that.</td>', 'I like this. I kinda wish one of the patches of light crossed his face but the bill of his cap prevents that.', '2005-09-17 06:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715890, 229115, 2553, '<td valign="top">A lovely girl, and not a bad concept.  The lighting feels harsh and uneven, and your model doesn''t really look comfortable in the shot.  I like the simplicity of the white background.</td>', 'A lovely girl, and not a bad concept.  The lighting feels harsh and uneven, and your model doesn''t really look comfortable in the shot.  I like the simplicity of the white background.', '2005-09-17 06:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715891, 230329, 41337, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand why you cut off his arm when that''s central to his pose.</td>', 'I don''t understand why you cut off his arm when that''s central to his pose.', '2005-09-17 06:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715893, 228731, 2553, '<td valign="top">The amount of "movement" in the photo makes it feel very unfocused.  There is too much "busy" background for my taste; I would have preferred to see a much tighter crop on the lovely child.</td>', 'The amount of "movement" in the photo makes it feel very unfocused.  There is too much "busy" background for my taste; I would have preferred to see a much tighter crop on the lovely child.', '2005-09-17 06:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715895, 227967, 41337, '<td valign="top">I love the background in this. Would have liked the rest of the guitar to be in the shot but still a great photo.</td>', 'I love the background in this. Would have liked the rest of the guitar to be in the shot but still a great photo.', '2005-09-17 06:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715896, 230359, 2553, '<td valign="top">Hmmm....hmmm....<br/>OK, well, though the color is bright, the highlights are quite blown-out, and overall it looks somewhat oversharpened, particularly in the upper part of the photo.  <br/> <br/>For portraits, though, I really prefer to see more of the subjects face, so perhaps a MUCH tighter crop on the face (wherever it is) would be a more powerful portrait presentation.</td>', 'Hmmm....hmmm....OK, well, though the color is bright, the highlights are quite blown-out, and overall it looks somewhat oversharpened, particularly in the upper part of the photo.   For portraits, though, I really prefer to see more of the subjects face, so perhaps a MUCH tighter crop on the face (wherever it is) would be a more powerful portrait presentation.', '2005-09-17 06:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715897, 229963, 41337, '<td valign="top">The light seems a bit to bright.</td>', 'The light seems a bit to bright.', '2005-09-17 06:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715899, 230246, 41337, '<td valign="top">Cute.</td>', 'Cute.', '2005-09-17 06:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715901, 230324, 2553, '<td valign="top">OK, I tend to not comment on shots that impact me negatively anymore, because of the backlash.  And I do not mean to offend.  But I just have to tell you that the first thing that hits me every time I have looked at this is that it is just plain odd to see what looks like a head floating around without a body!  The colors are nice and saturated, but, the overall feel of the shot is that it is almost posterized.  The lighting feels harsh and unflattering, though this could just be from pushing it to high-key.</td>', 'OK, I tend to not comment on shots that impact me negatively anymore, because of the backlash.  And I do not mean to offend.  But I just have to tell you that the first thing that hits me every time I have looked at this is that it is just plain odd to see what looks like a head floating around without a body!  The colors are nice and saturated, but, the overall feel of the shot is that it is almost posterized.  The lighting feels harsh and unflattering, though this could just be from pushing it to high-key.', '2005-09-17 06:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715902, 230360, 41337, '<td valign="top">Great photo. Looks like paradise.</td>', 'Great photo. Looks like paradise.', '2005-09-17 06:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715904, 229838, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very pleasant looking photo. I like how this isn''t your typical hyper-sharpened photo that usually takes the ribbons.</td>', 'Very pleasant looking photo. I like how this isn''t your typical hyper-sharpened photo that usually takes the ribbons.', '2005-09-17 06:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715910, 230233, 38911, '<td valign="top">You were successful in obtaining the right bite me pose.  Good job!  Now go &amp; clean yourself up man. :o\</td>', 'You were successful in obtaining the right bite me pose.  Good job!  Now go & clean yourself up man. :o\', '2005-09-17 07:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715923, 229724, 24546, '<td valign="top">You chose a face that has so much personality - I really like the close up and the detail in his eyes and beard.  Excellent work! (10)</td>', 'You chose a face that has so much personality - I really like the close up and the detail in his eyes and beard.  Excellent work! (10)', '2005-09-17 07:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1715926, 229475, 24546, '<td valign="top">Your model is precious and you have done such a great job capturing her personality and her beauty.  Love the details in her eyes and the nice soft lighting.  (10)</td>', 'Your model is precious and you have done such a great job capturing her personality and her beauty.  Love the details in her eyes and the nice soft lighting.  (10)', '2005-09-17 08:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
