(1716291, 228939, 10985, '<td valign="top">Everything looks perfect except the blown out whites on this very intense portrait. (Also, the title doesn''t fit her expression, she looks more bored than desperate.) Still, this has a strong impact.<br/> <br/>Correction: I replaced the his wity a her and added an s before the he. Now I appologize... :o)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-09-19 23:45:02.</i></td>', 'Everything looks perfect except the blown out whites on this very intense portrait. (Also, the title doesn''t fit her expression, she looks more bored than desperate.) Still, this has a strong impact. Correction: I replaced the his wity a her and added an s before the he. Now I appologize... :o)', '2005-09-17 13:16:26.000000', '2005-09-20 00:45:02.000000', 1),
(1716292, 228978, 10985, '<td valign="top">Very fun. The smoothing is a bit bothersome to me, but it kind of has a purpose here, it makes for a very purposely-unnatural look. Great work!</td>', 'Very fun. The smoothing is a bit bothersome to me, but it kind of has a purpose here, it makes for a very purposely-unnatural look. Great work!', '2005-09-17 13:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716294, 228197, 10985, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. I just wish a little more sharpness in her eyes.</td>', 'I like this a lot. I just wish a little more sharpness in her eyes.', '2005-09-17 13:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716295, 230113, 10985, '<td valign="top">Very cool!</td>', 'Very cool!', '2005-09-17 13:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716296, 229518, 10985, '<td valign="top">Very effective!</td>', 'Very effective!', '2005-09-17 13:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716297, 228408, 10985, '<td valign="top">Fun and different. Very cool shot!</td>', 'Fun and different. Very cool shot!', '2005-09-17 13:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716298, 229062, 10985, '<td valign="top">Sweet and compelling.</td>', 'Sweet and compelling.', '2005-09-17 13:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716299, 230299, 10985, '<td valign="top">The lower left part of her face is almost blown out, but not quite. I love her hair and expression. A very strong portrait.</td>', 'The lower left part of her face is almost blown out, but not quite. I love her hair and expression. A very strong portrait.', '2005-09-17 13:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1716301, 227837, 10985, '<td valign="top">I like how natural this is. And the lighting is excellent on the little model''s face. Very nice angle. It looks like a candid, but an excellent one.</td>', 'I like how natural this is. And the lighting is excellent on the little model''s face. Very nice angle. It looks like a candid, but an excellent one.', '2005-09-17 13:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
