(1717697, 228978, 30861, '<td valign="top">I don''t WANT tolike this very "palstic" looking rendition, but there''s so much in it that compels... The rimlighting onnose and lips is very fine. The bone structure, the size of the eyes, she almost doesn''t look real, a very striking model. I don''t as a rule vote "for the model", the opposite in fact, but you''ve done quite a job of accentuating her gamin-like qualities.</td>', 'I don''t WANT tolike this very "palstic" looking rendition, but there''s so much in it that compels... The rimlighting onnose and lips is very fine. The bone structure, the size of the eyes, she almost doesn''t look real, a very striking model. I don''t as a rule vote "for the model", the opposite in fact, but you''ve done quite a job of accentuating her gamin-like qualities.', '2005-09-18 03:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717703, 230018, 30861, '<td valign="top">In many ways a very average picture, but a striking POV. I wish the post processing were a little "richer", it feels somewhat washed out to me, like half a stop too bright overall.</td>', 'In many ways a very average picture, but a striking POV. I wish the post processing were a little "richer", it feels somewhat washed out to me, like half a stop too bright overall.', '2005-09-18 03:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717707, 229673, 30861, '<td valign="top">Wow. wonderful, "real" capture of skin tones and hair, right down to the vaguely "bruised" look under the eyes that''s so characteristic of some redheads. Beautiful framing witht he hair, as well.</td>', 'Wow. wonderful, "real" capture of skin tones and hair, right down to the vaguely "bruised" look under the eyes that''s so characteristic of some redheads. Beautiful framing witht he hair, as well.', '2005-09-18 03:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717711, 229026, 30861, '<td valign="top">If only the tongue of white bench weren''t there, you''d have a virtually perfect comkposition. It''s unfortunate that the ear and the edge of the collar are not int he frame, as well. But a very nice piece of work that I have enjoyed viewing.</td>', 'If only the tongue of white bench weren''t there, you''d have a virtually perfect comkposition. It''s unfortunate that the ear and the edge of the collar are not int he frame, as well. But a very nice piece of work that I have enjoyed viewing.', '2005-09-18 03:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717781, 229842, 23478, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, keeping it slightly off center works great.</td>', 'Nice portrait, keeping it slightly off center works great.', '2005-09-18 03:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717782, 230272, 23478, '<td valign="top">Great candid portrait, I like the lighting.</td>', 'Great candid portrait, I like the lighting.', '2005-09-18 03:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717785, 229608, 23478, '<td valign="top">Great family portrait, just the background is a bit distracting, with the tree coming out of her head.</td>', 'Great family portrait, just the background is a bit distracting, with the tree coming out of her head.', '2005-09-18 03:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717803, 229378, 44402, '<td valign="top">animated!!! excellent!!!</td>', 'animated!!! excellent!!!', '2005-09-18 03:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717833, 230358, 10268, '<td valign="top">Aside from the hand, this is a really beautiful shot.  The hand is just really distracting.</td>', 'Aside from the hand, this is a really beautiful shot.  The hand is just really distracting.', '2005-09-18 04:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717834, 229062, 10268, '<td valign="top">Amazing!  I really ove the expression, the colors, the composition, the focus, the model, really, everything.   One of the best shots I''ve seen on here in a really long time!  I hope you ribbon.</td>', 'Amazing!  I really ove the expression, the colors, the composition, the focus, the model, really, everything.   One of the best shots I''ve seen on here in a really long time!  I hope you ribbon.', '2005-09-18 04:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717835, 229083, 10268, '<td valign="top">So much character in this shot.  I really love it.</td>', 'So much character in this shot.  I really love it.', '2005-09-18 04:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717836, 229838, 10268, '<td valign="top">The focus is a little too soft for my liking, but the lighting looks really great.  And the flower is a nice touch.</td>', 'The focus is a little too soft for my liking, but the lighting looks really great.  And the flower is a nice touch.', '2005-09-18 04:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717838, 230220, 10268, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful.  I like the busy background.  It works well with the composition of the shot.</td>', 'Really beautiful.  I like the busy background.  It works well with the composition of the shot.', '2005-09-18 04:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717839, 230231, 10268, '<td valign="top">Really awesome textures here.  And what  great subject.</td>', 'Really awesome textures here.  And what  great subject.', '2005-09-18 04:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717927, 228910, 22781, '<td valign="top">This is my top favorite.<br/>I hope it will ribbon. It''s so pretty.</td>', 'This is my top favorite.I hope it will ribbon. It''s so pretty.', '2005-09-18 06:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717973, 229864, 37961, '<td valign="top">Boy she has some white teeth. Maybe too white. I think the teeth and eyes are dodged just a tad too much, but this is a great pose, the light and her expression are really good and natural looking.</td>', 'Boy she has some white teeth. Maybe too white. I think the teeth and eyes are dodged just a tad too much, but this is a great pose, the light and her expression are really good and natural looking.', '2005-09-18 07:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717975, 229954, 37961, '<td valign="top">Love the guy in the background. Photo title is very fitting. A little too bright on her face though.</td>', 'Love the guy in the background. Photo title is very fitting. A little too bright on her face though.', '2005-09-18 07:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717985, 229959, 37961, '<td valign="top">Part of me loves the lack of DOF, but the other part wishes more of her were in focus...either way the expression/model and lighting are superb. Adorable.</td>', 'Part of me loves the lack of DOF, but the other part wishes more of her were in focus...either way the expression/model and lighting are superb. Adorable.', '2005-09-18 07:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717987, 229696, 37961, '<td valign="top">Love the pose and lighting. Eyes look a tad oversharpened, and the skin is blurred too much in some areas especially over the right eyebrow,  but the rest of the photo is excellent. Good pose for a man.</td>', 'Love the pose and lighting. Eyes look a tad oversharpened, and the skin is blurred too much in some areas especially over the right eyebrow,  but the rest of the photo is excellent. Good pose for a man.', '2005-09-18 07:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717989, 230310, 37961, '<td valign="top">This is nice, but  a closer up may have done better. Like your D&amp;L entry. You are certainly talented and have a creative eye, and lucky you, all those beautiful girls to shoot.</td>', 'This is nice, but  a closer up may have done better. Like your D&L entry. You are certainly talented and have a creative eye, and lucky you, all those beautiful girls to shoot.', '2005-09-18 07:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717992, 230044, 37961, '<td valign="top">Really cute kid. Love the hairstyle and candid smile.</td>', 'Really cute kid. Love the hairstyle and candid smile.', '2005-09-18 07:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717993, 230356, 37961, '<td valign="top">Lovely pose, model and color tones.</td>', 'Lovely pose, model and color tones.', '2005-09-18 07:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717997, 230363, 37961, '<td valign="top">This is a classic photo of a couple in love. Wow. You captured it really well. They will love having this photo in 20 years when everyone is heavier and backs arent as strong...LOL Nice.</td>', 'This is a classic photo of a couple in love. Wow. You captured it really well. They will love having this photo in 20 years when everyone is heavier and backs arent as strong...LOL Nice.', '2005-09-18 07:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1717998, 230374, 37961, '<td valign="top">This is a really sweet portrait. I love the turn of the head and her hair framing the left side of the frame. Awesome.</td>', 'This is a really sweet portrait. I love the turn of the head and her hair framing the left side of the frame. Awesome.', '2005-09-18 07:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718000, 229941, 37961, '<td valign="top">Strange.....yet interesting. Not sure what to say, definately thought provoking though.</td>', 'Strange.....yet interesting. Not sure what to say, definately thought provoking though.', '2005-09-18 07:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718003, 230351, 37961, '<td valign="top">The light on the subject is nearly perfect. I love the pose and her expression, the only thing I see that you could have done to improve this would be to work on her skin tone a touch, seems a bit too yellow.</td>', 'The light on the subject is nearly perfect. I love the pose and her expression, the only thing I see that you could have done to improve this would be to work on her skin tone a touch, seems a bit too yellow.', '2005-09-18 07:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718004, 229867, 37961, '<td valign="top">Sweet Sassy little pose.  Who needs to buy school portraits anymore!</td>', 'Sweet Sassy little pose.  Who needs to buy school portraits anymore!', '2005-09-18 07:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718007, 230336, 37961, '<td valign="top">Unusual choice for the challenge. I love the contrast of the girls skin and hair.  Pretty girls. Light seems a tad much on the fair skinned one though, although Im sure this is hard to control.</td>', 'Unusual choice for the challenge. I love the contrast of the girls skin and hair.  Pretty girls. Light seems a tad much on the fair skinned one though, although Im sure this is hard to control.', '2005-09-18 07:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718008, 229252, 37961, '<td valign="top">Cute pose. Love the relaxed expressions and color tones. Lighting is well done also.</td>', 'Cute pose. Love the relaxed expressions and color tones. Lighting is well done also.', '2005-09-18 07:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718011, 230229, 37961, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of entry. I like it though, it has soul.</td>', 'Interesting choice of entry. I like it though, it has soul.', '2005-09-18 07:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718136, 228910, 25355, '<td valign="top">I think I know whose this is.  A sombre mood, but nice colours in the costume.</td>', 'I think I know whose this is.  A sombre mood, but nice colours in the costume.', '2005-09-18 09:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718138, 229089, 25355, '<td valign="top">Unusual perspective for a photograph, but maybe not so for a child... nice.</td>', 'Unusual perspective for a photograph, but maybe not so for a child... nice.', '2005-09-18 09:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718144, 230113, 25355, '<td valign="top">What''s this? An annual portrait? IN a coujple of years his chin will pass into the frame. ;-)</td>', 'What''s this? An annual portrait? IN a coujple of years his chin will pass into the frame. ;-)', '2005-09-18 09:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718167, 230231, 40977, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured so much more than his image....great job!!  Bumping --9--</td>', 'You''ve captured so much more than his image....great job!!  Bumping --9--', '2005-09-18 09:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718258, 230113, 39483, '<td valign="top">Very creative photo idea! Love the crop, the neutral background and the focus on the eyes! The photo seems a bit over sharpened? Perhaps just sharpening the eyes might have worked better? Very well done. I hope it scores high!</td>', 'Very creative photo idea! Love the crop, the neutral background and the focus on the eyes! The photo seems a bit over sharpened? Perhaps just sharpening the eyes might have worked better? Very well done. I hope it scores high!', '2005-09-18 10:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718262, 230130, 9780, '<td valign="top">Nice collores Siggi! :D<br/>good luck !<br/></td>', 'Nice collores Siggi! :Dgood luck !', '2005-09-18 10:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718269, 228910, 39483, '<td valign="top">What a beautifully composed photo. I love the muted light and how it seems to fall mostly on her. Her bright clothes contrast so well with the ''sad'' background as does her expression. Perhaps just cropping a bit more on the right side to make her feel even more offsided? Very well done!</td>', 'What a beautifully composed photo. I love the muted light and how it seems to fall mostly on her. Her bright clothes contrast so well with the ''sad'' background as does her expression. Perhaps just cropping a bit more on the right side to make her feel even more offsided? Very well done!', '2005-09-18 10:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718275, 230111, 39483, '<td valign="top">What amazing lighting you captured (or created?) The focus on the eyes is perfect and the skin tone very natural. I''m not sure if I like the coat details but that''s MHO... Great job</td>', 'What amazing lighting you captured (or created?) The focus on the eyes is perfect and the skin tone very natural. I''m not sure if I like the coat details but that''s MHO... Great job', '2005-09-18 10:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718280, 228978, 39483, '<td valign="top">I just noticed the earings :) Great composition and neutral background. I really like her looking sideways and the depth it gives the photo with her strong profile. Amazing focus on the eyes and great skin tones. The photo does seem just a tad oversharpned around the hair? Very well done!</td>', 'I just noticed the earings :) Great composition and neutral background. I really like her looking sideways and the depth it gives the photo with her strong profile. Amazing focus on the eyes and great skin tones. The photo does seem just a tad oversharpned around the hair? Very well done!', '2005-09-18 10:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718285, 229378, 39483, '<td valign="top">I really like the expression and the cropping of the photo. Nice out of focus background and interesting foreground with the apple. It seems to tell a bit of a story perhaps? IMHO, the frame is a bit too wide. it distracts from the photo itself and I find myself lost in the white... But great capture of an expression! Well done</td>', 'I really like the expression and the cropping of the photo. Nice out of focus background and interesting foreground with the apple. It seems to tell a bit of a story perhaps? IMHO, the frame is a bit too wide. it distracts from the photo itself and I find myself lost in the white... But great capture of an expression! Well done', '2005-09-18 10:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718290, 230335, 39483, '<td valign="top">I like the originality of the foreground! And the expression works well with it! The face does seem a bit lost lighting wise? Maybe a side lighting might have increased the contrast? well done</td>', 'I like the originality of the foreground! And the expression works well with it! The face does seem a bit lost lighting wise? Maybe a side lighting might have increased the contrast? well done', '2005-09-18 10:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718293, 229045, 39483, '<td valign="top">What a great expression! I like the out of focus backgorund and the soft feel of this photo! IMHO, the bottom could be cropped nearer her crossed arms? It would help focus on her face! The composition is well done with her off to the side and the feeling of depth...well done</td>', 'What a great expression! I like the out of focus backgorund and the soft feel of this photo! IMHO, the bottom could be cropped nearer her crossed arms? It would help focus on her face! The composition is well done with her off to the side and the feeling of depth...well done', '2005-09-18 11:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718305, 229471, 39483, '<td valign="top">What a great capture. I like the backgroung here and the darkened part of it on the right side. Somehow it matches his expression and the mood of the photo... The left side of the tree is a bit distracting however so I might have tried cropping that out? But good lighting on the face, it has depth and the eyes are easy to focus on! well done!</td>', 'What a great capture. I like the backgroung here and the darkened part of it on the right side. Somehow it matches his expression and the mood of the photo... The left side of the tree is a bit distracting however so I might have tried cropping that out? But good lighting on the face, it has depth and the eyes are easy to focus on! well done!', '2005-09-18 11:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718318, 229999, 39483, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured a great smile! The background is nicely out of focus but the top part of it is a bit distracting. It might have worked better if you were higher up and it would be all green or had croutched and it would be all sky white... But nice photo nonetheless!</td>', 'You''ve captured a great smile! The background is nicely out of focus but the top part of it is a bit distracting. It might have worked better if you were higher up and it would be all green or had croutched and it would be all sky white... But nice photo nonetheless!', '2005-09-18 11:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718326, 228206, 39483, '<td valign="top">I like the contrasts in this photo and the expression and pose seem to tell a story! The background is nicely out of focus but the tree (?) in the left side is a bit distracting?</td>', 'I like the contrasts in this photo and the expression and pose seem to tell a story! The background is nicely out of focus but the tree (?) in the left side is a bit distracting?', '2005-09-18 11:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718334, 230289, 39483, '<td valign="top">Not sure why, but the car is too distracting to me and doesn''t seem to fit with the portrait of this man. I like the side lighting and the expression as well as the out of focus background. perhaps a tighter crop nearer to his face?</td>', 'Not sure why, but the car is too distracting to me and doesn''t seem to fit with the portrait of this man. I like the side lighting and the expression as well as the out of focus background. perhaps a tighter crop nearer to his face?', '2005-09-18 11:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718345, 230336, 39483, '<td valign="top">Great portrait! The lighting is even and the eyes captivating! I love the yinyang set up! great expressions! IMHO, I might have kept this one dead center by cropping out the left side of it? well done!</td>', 'Great portrait! The lighting is even and the eyes captivating! I love the yinyang set up! great expressions! IMHO, I might have kept this one dead center by cropping out the left side of it? well done!', '2005-09-18 11:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718352, 229954, 39483, '<td valign="top">Great capture! I love the ligthing and the composition! This is a great portrait. The photo does seem just a tad oversharpened? Extra points for originality, DOF and composition!</td>', 'Great capture! I love the ligthing and the composition! This is a great portrait. The photo does seem just a tad oversharpened? Extra points for originality, DOF and composition!', '2005-09-18 11:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718368, 229621, 39483, '<td valign="top">Great capture! no pun intended :) I love his expression and the fish tells a story and adds depth to the image! The background is a bit distracting, not so much the shadows but the top part of it. Perhaps a tighter crop both on top and on the right side? well done. good lighting on his face!</td>', 'Great capture! no pun intended :) I love his expression and the fish tells a story and adds depth to the image! The background is a bit distracting, not so much the shadows but the top part of it. Perhaps a tighter crop both on top and on the right side? well done. good lighting on his face!', '2005-09-18 11:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718378, 228826, 39483, '<td valign="top">I do like the soft feel of this photo! The backlight does seem a bit too strong though IMHO...</td>', 'I do like the soft feel of this photo! The backlight does seem a bit too strong though IMHO...', '2005-09-18 11:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718390, 230138, 39483, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the mirror image! It gives the image a lot of depth! I''m not sure if I like the clothy background in the mirror though? Perhaps a tighter crop would gives more emphasis on the face and the interesting expression!</td>', 'I like the idea of the mirror image! It gives the image a lot of depth! I''m not sure if I like the clothy background in the mirror though? Perhaps a tighter crop would gives more emphasis on the face and the interesting expression!', '2005-09-18 11:25:03.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1718401, 229574, 39483, '<td valign="top">It''s a nicely captured expression and a relaxed pose but the blinds in the background somehow add to the blue tinge to the photo. Details like the hair scrungy thingy also distract form her great smile and eyes!</td>', 'It''s a nicely captured expression and a relaxed pose but the blinds in the background somehow add to the blue tinge to the photo. Details like the hair scrungy thingy also distract form her great smile and eyes!', '2005-09-18 11:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718414, 229966, 39483, '<td valign="top">It''s a nicely composed photo but there is a lack of contrast? It seems too washed out. A tighter crop at the bottom and on the right might also return focus on her great expression and beautiful face!</td>', 'It''s a nicely composed photo but there is a lack of contrast? It seems too washed out. A tighter crop at the bottom and on the right might also return focus on her great expression and beautiful face!', '2005-09-18 11:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718417, 230233, 25553, '<td valign="top">very cool ''dirty'' look not only on the make up but the picture too..</td>', 'very cool ''dirty'' look not only on the make up but the picture too..', '2005-09-18 11:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718420, 228857, 25553, '<td valign="top">this is a beautiful image. very captivating, especially because of the intensity in her expression. i like that she doesnt have lipstick it wouldve taken away from the eyes. good use of the soft feel..good job!</td>', 'this is a beautiful image. very captivating, especially because of the intensity in her expression. i like that she doesnt have lipstick it wouldve taken away from the eyes. good use of the soft feel..good job!', '2005-09-18 11:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718424, 228762, 39483, '<td valign="top">What a great capture and wonderful composition. I like the soft feel of this photo and the subtle lighting but perhaps just a bit more lighting and contrast to highlight features like strands of hair or the eyes? I feel like I''m contradicting myself :) Don''t listen to me!<br/>Great portrait to cherish!</td>', 'What a great capture and wonderful composition. I like the soft feel of this photo and the subtle lighting but perhaps just a bit more lighting and contrast to highlight features like strands of hair or the eyes? I feel like I''m contradicting myself :) Don''t listen to me!Great portrait to cherish!', '2005-09-18 11:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718427, 230310, 25553, '<td valign="top">great picture as always.. but two things i dont like. her stare is a bit too blank..not as in shes thinking about something but as in shes forces to look at a mark cause thats where her eyes look good, and the fly-aways in front of her forehead. otherwise its a great picture and i think it will place high..good job!</td>', 'great picture as always.. but two things i dont like. her stare is a bit too blank..not as in shes thinking about something but as in shes forces to look at a mark cause thats where her eyes look good, and the fly-aways in front of her forehead. otherwise its a great picture and i think it will place high..good job!', '2005-09-18 11:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718431, 230057, 39483, '<td valign="top">Amazing clear eyes and great expression! The composition might be a tad stronger IMHO of you cropped out the left side of the chair? great soft lighting and out of focus background! well done</td>', 'Amazing clear eyes and great expression! The composition might be a tad stronger IMHO of you cropped out the left side of the chair? great soft lighting and out of focus background! well done', '2005-09-18 11:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718432, 229475, 25553, '<td valign="top">finally a picture of a child that doesnt look like it was taken with a one time use camera. good job with the lighting.</td>', 'finally a picture of a child that doesnt look like it was taken with a one time use camera. good job with the lighting.', '2005-09-18 11:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718437, 227989, 39483, '<td valign="top">I really like the set up here and the expression! The white background really lets you focus on the eyes. great lighting and not overly sharpened. IMHO, a tighter crop on the left side would make the eyes wander a bit more to where she is looking. I like the originality of the head ''gear'' :) it adds a lot of depth!</td>', 'I really like the set up here and the expression! The white background really lets you focus on the eyes. great lighting and not overly sharpened. IMHO, a tighter crop on the left side would make the eyes wander a bit more to where she is looking. I like the originality of the head ''gear'' :) it adds a lot of depth!', '2005-09-18 11:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718440, 230111, 25553, '<td valign="top">reviewing my scores and im bumping this up.. its a great fashion shot very beautifully done..</td>', 'reviewing my scores and im bumping this up.. its a great fashion shot very beautifully done..', '2005-09-18 11:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718446, 230233, 39483, '<td valign="top">great portrait! I really like the neutral gray background and his expression! Somehow, the table takes away from the mood of this photo, not sure why? Nice lighting and capture! well done</td>', 'great portrait! I really like the neutral gray background and his expression! Somehow, the table takes away from the mood of this photo, not sure why? Nice lighting and capture! well done', '2005-09-18 11:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718451, 229089, 39483, '<td valign="top">I like the capture of the expression and the composition but somehow, she seems to be floating. her elbows don''t seem anchored on the table...But amazing lighting on her face and angle...wonderful face and eyes! well done</td>', 'I like the capture of the expression and the composition but somehow, she seems to be floating. her elbows don''t seem anchored on the table...But amazing lighting on her face and angle...wonderful face and eyes! well done', '2005-09-18 11:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718456, 229842, 25553, '<td valign="top">nice job.. pretty lighting very nice and subtle. i like how her hands are in her shirt sleeves. bumping up..</td>', 'nice job.. pretty lighting very nice and subtle. i like how her hands are in her shirt sleeves. bumping up..', '2005-09-18 11:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718460, 229518, 39483, '<td valign="top">How can I not bump this up even more! Very original composition, great expression and I love the side lighting! The out of focus foreground and background add an enormous amount of depth! The only minor thing I migh say is that IMHO, the tiny bit of left eye seen is a tad distracting (perhaps because it''s only the white of the eye we see here?). <br/>this image really tells a story, even without the title! WOW, very well done. I hope you score high!!!</td>', 'How can I not bump this up even more! Very original composition, great expression and I love the side lighting! The out of focus foreground and background add an enormous amount of depth! The only minor thing I migh say is that IMHO, the tiny bit of left eye seen is a tad distracting (perhaps because it''s only the white of the eye we see here?). this image really tells a story, even without the title! WOW, very well done. I hope you score high!!!', '2005-09-18 11:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
