(1718472, 230299, 39483, '<td valign="top">I like the expression and the amazingly captured eyes! The strands of hair add a lot of depth and of course great contrasting color here! IMHO, the lighting on the left side is a bit too harsh, I prefer the right side light... I would also try cropping out more at the top to really let the viewer focus on the eyes instead of the hairline! well done</td>', 'I like the expression and the amazingly captured eyes! The strands of hair add a lot of depth and of course great contrasting color here! IMHO, the lighting on the left side is a bit too harsh, I prefer the right side light... I would also try cropping out more at the top to really let the viewer focus on the eyes instead of the hairline! well done', '2005-09-18 11:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1718475, 227575, 25553, '<td valign="top">the head on flash is almost never a good choice..trade it in for a longer exposure and perhaps close down your iris (for dof).  the size on the picture doesnt help it either.. also remember to keep an eye on your models look..dab the sweat ect.. sorry for the bluntness but i hope these comment help you in later challenges.</td>', 'the head on flash is almost never a good choice..trade it in for a longer exposure and perhaps close down your iris (for dof).  the size on the picture doesnt help it either.. also remember to keep an eye on your models look..dab the sweat ect.. sorry for the bluntness but i hope these comment help you in later challenges.', '2005-09-18 11:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
