(1719692, 229608, 35775, '<td valign="top">A beautiful moment</td>', 'A beautiful moment', '2005-09-18 23:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1719698, 228408, 37961, '<td valign="top">Nice angle, and subject. I really like your choice of posing. Lighting is decent too. Good Job. I love this photo. 10.</td>', 'Nice angle, and subject. I really like your choice of posing. Lighting is decent too. Good Job. I love this photo. 10.', '2005-09-18 23:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1719701, 230272, 37961, '<td valign="top">Great idea for the challenge....something different. Love the glow on her face &amp; the sweater she has on....nice.</td>', 'Great idea for the challenge....something different. Love the glow on her face & the sweater she has on....nice.', '2005-09-18 23:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1719702, 230071, 35775, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.............</td>', 'Nice lighting.............', '2005-09-18 23:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1719703, 229727, 37961, '<td valign="top">Joey- The setting and lighting for this photo is great. Her expression is interesting also, just would like to see a little less casual clothing. Next time have her get into a gothic dress or something. Halloween is coming soon....should be able to find some interesting apparel. Love the brick wall.</td>', 'Joey- The setting and lighting for this photo is great. Her expression is interesting also, just would like to see a little less casual clothing. Next time have her get into a gothic dress or something. Halloween is coming soon....should be able to find some interesting apparel. Love the brick wall.', '2005-09-18 23:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1719704, 229602, 35775, '<td valign="top">wonderful detail.....</td>', 'wonderful detail.....', '2005-09-18 23:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1719706, 227855, 37961, '<td valign="top">This is a really enjoyable portrait. Her disgruntled expression and the way the bangs sweep across her eye is lovely. Her skin is flawless and it looks like  you captured her just wonderfully.</td>', 'This is a really enjoyable portrait. Her disgruntled expression and the way the bangs sweep across her eye is lovely. Her skin is flawless and it looks like  you captured her just wonderfully.', '2005-09-18 23:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1719708, 229062, 37961, '<td valign="top">Crazy background blur.....Her face is hilarious. Love the way you off centered her and the focus on her face is excellent.</td>', 'Crazy background blur.....Her face is hilarious. Love the way you off centered her and the focus on her face is excellent.', '2005-09-18 23:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1719710, 229944, 35775, '<td valign="top">I like the crop, well done...</td>', 'I like the crop, well done...', '2005-09-18 23:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1719711, 229906, 35775, '<td valign="top">just beautiful...........</td>', 'just beautiful...........', '2005-09-18 23:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1719712, 228857, 35775, '<td valign="top">Beautiful soft tones..........</td>', 'Beautiful soft tones..........', '2005-09-18 23:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1719718, 229744, 35775, '<td valign="top">wonderful colour....</td>', 'wonderful colour....', '2005-09-18 23:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1719726, 230122, 26756, '<td valign="top">Cutie pie model.  Looks like the camera was not completely in focus, or you suffered a bit from camera shake.  The photo is nicely composed and you have a nice range of colors.<br/> <br/>This photo needs a bit more light, and more contrast and it would really make it look much better.  Great subject, keep taking portraits of her and you''re sure to get some great shots of her in the future.</td>', 'Cutie pie model.  Looks like the camera was not completely in focus, or you suffered a bit from camera shake.  The photo is nicely composed and you have a nice range of colors. This photo needs a bit more light, and more contrast and it would really make it look much better.  Great subject, keep taking portraits of her and you''re sure to get some great shots of her in the future.', '2005-09-18 23:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1719757, 229092, 5112, '<td valign="top">I like this picture: I love the soft colours, the expression, and the beautiful out of focus background.</td>', 'I like this picture: I love the soft colours, the expression, and the beautiful out of focus background.', '2005-09-18 23:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1719783, 229087, 22734, '<td valign="top">I prefer "bonita" A straightforward image which exudes great beauty and charm. Lovely. 7</td>', 'I prefer "bonita" A straightforward image which exudes great beauty and charm. Lovely. 7', '2005-09-18 23:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1719791, 230018, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very well done to project that typical model stare into empty space. Very well done: 7</td>', 'Very well done to project that typical model stare into empty space. Very well done: 7', '2005-09-18 23:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1719798, 229724, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very moving and so, so charming. 8</td>', 'Very moving and so, so charming. 8', '2005-09-18 23:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1719801, 230233, 22734, '<td valign="top">A cool study to arouse sleeping emotions. 7</td>', 'A cool study to arouse sleeping emotions. 7', '2005-09-18 23:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1719804, 228197, 37961, '<td valign="top">I recently saw that movie. This is a very skillful interpretation of that portrait. Lovely, and quite risky using a model who isn''t 16 and drop dead gorgeous, it still works.</td>', 'I recently saw that movie. This is a very skillful interpretation of that portrait. Lovely, and quite risky using a model who isn''t 16 and drop dead gorgeous, it still works.', '2005-09-18 23:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1719820, 228978, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is so slick wherein the post processing has produced a masterpiece. Great attention to detail and done to perfection. The guitar earrings makes it sing even louder. Facial feautures are of course a big plus and thry serve as the foundation to this blue ribbon quality image. 10</td>', 'This is so slick wherein the post processing has produced a masterpiece. Great attention to detail and done to perfection. The guitar earrings makes it sing even louder. Facial feautures are of course a big plus and thry serve as the foundation to this blue ribbon quality image. 10', '2005-09-18 23:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1719824, 228125, 22734, '<td valign="top">Nice, beautiful and delicate. 7</td>', 'Nice, beautiful and delicate. 7', '2005-09-18 23:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1719828, 229729, 22734, '<td valign="top">As a graphical representation this is indeed a very good execution. DPC  crowd may miss the point. 7</td>', 'As a graphical representation this is indeed a very good execution. DPC  crowd may miss the point. 7', '2005-09-18 23:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1719837, 230370, 22734, '<td valign="top">This image and subject (model) shows great potential without the special effect as it fails to enhance the beauty. Pretending the effect is not there I give you a 6 but would have gone a full 10.</td>', 'This image and subject (model) shows great potential without the special effect as it fails to enhance the beauty. Pretending the effect is not there I give you a 6 but would have gone a full 10.', '2005-09-18 23:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1719848, 230161, 22734, '<td valign="top">A nice study but lacking critical detail. Often we expose for the shadow and let everything else fall apart and this is often accepted. The end result here is not favoring the facial detail. The concept was good and composition. Bumping tp 6.</td>', 'A nice study but lacking critical detail. Often we expose for the shadow and let everything else fall apart and this is often accepted. The end result here is not favoring the facial detail. The concept was good and composition. Bumping tp 6.', '2005-09-18 23:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
