(1719914, 230153, 5112, '<td valign="top">Really good, hope you do well.  I like it that it is not just a "portrait", but it tells a whole story.  Beautiful colours also.  10 from me.</td>', 'Really good, hope you do well.  I like it that it is not just a "portrait", but it tells a whole story.  Beautiful colours also.  10 from me.', '2005-09-19 00:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
