(1719919, 230335, 5112, '<td valign="top">I like this very much, the placement of eyes, nose, mouth is perfect.  It''s a very "strong" portrait.  One of my favourites in the challenge.  (10)</td>', 'I like this very much, the placement of eyes, nose, mouth is perfect.  It''s a very "strong" portrait.  One of my favourites in the challenge.  (10)', '2005-09-19 00:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1719920, 228910, 22734, '<td valign="top">Simply lovely and adorable. 8</td>', 'Simply lovely and adorable. 8', '2005-09-19 00:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1719923, 230122, 33899, '<td valign="top">slightly underexposed. and with a blue-ish tint in the white-balance. i think a tighter crop on the left would be good also.</td>', 'slightly underexposed. and with a blue-ish tint in the white-balance. i think a tighter crop on the left would be good also.', '2005-09-19 00:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1719929, 229696, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice eyes!</td>', 'Nice eyes!', '2005-09-19 00:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1719934, 230058, 33899, '<td valign="top">hmm i think the way the light was positioned or how this shot was exposed made you lose a lot of contrast in the face. i see you might have been trying to go for the high key effect. but the lighting sort of takes away all shadows which take away the 3d ness of the shot</td>', 'hmm i think the way the light was positioned or how this shot was exposed made you lose a lot of contrast in the face. i see you might have been trying to go for the high key effect. but the lighting sort of takes away all shadows which take away the 3d ness of the shot', '2005-09-19 00:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1719942, 228167, 5112, '<td valign="top">I don''t know, the painting is beautiful, and a great portrait, but to take a picture of a beautiful portrait, add a brush/foot, and make it "your" portrait doesn''t quite seem right.</td>', 'I don''t know, the painting is beautiful, and a great portrait, but to take a picture of a beautiful portrait, add a brush/foot, and make it "your" portrait doesn''t quite seem right.', '2005-09-19 00:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1719943, 230265, 33899, '<td valign="top">hmm from the eyes, it looks like you used to bare bulbs to light this portrait. this could have caused the somewhat harsh lighting  and definied shadows on this shot. have you tried using one main/key light and then a reflector on the other side? that might provide more favorable results</td>', 'hmm from the eyes, it looks like you used to bare bulbs to light this portrait. this could have caused the somewhat harsh lighting  and definied shadows on this shot. have you tried using one main/key light and then a reflector on the other side? that might provide more favorable results', '2005-09-19 00:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1719949, 230362, 33899, '<td valign="top">hmm this shot suffers from slight camera movement. i dunno about you, but with a 50mm lens, i can''t hand hold anything 1/40th or slower</td>', 'hmm this shot suffers from slight camera movement. i dunno about you, but with a 50mm lens, i can''t hand hold anything 1/40th or slower', '2005-09-19 00:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1719952, 227575, 33899, '<td valign="top">it''s important that any oil on the face be wiped clean because it is highly reflective in direct light. it doesn''t look like you used the camera flash becaus of the way the shadows fall across the petals, but it is important that you also diffuse the light in some way</td>', 'it''s important that any oil on the face be wiped clean because it is highly reflective in direct light. it doesn''t look like you used the camera flash becaus of the way the shadows fall across the petals, but it is important that you also diffuse the light in some way', '2005-09-19 00:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1719953, 229949, 25397, '<td valign="top">That title has got some serious class. :-)<br/>Great work</td>', 'That title has got some serious class. :-)Great work', '2005-09-19 00:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1719955, 229663, 27107, '<td valign="top">nice shot wish she was off to the side a bit and maybe a touch of added contrast to make her stand out more. Pretty good though!</td>', 'nice shot wish she was off to the side a bit and maybe a touch of added contrast to make her stand out more. Pretty good though!', '2005-09-19 00:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1719958, 229362, 33899, '<td valign="top">the lighting is good. i like how the white carpet acted as a reflector. but i think a tighter crop around the head/body would have been nicer since the background on the right and top sides dont seem to add much to the picture</td>', 'the lighting is good. i like how the white carpet acted as a reflector. but i think a tighter crop around the head/body would have been nicer since the background on the right and top sides dont seem to add much to the picture', '2005-09-19 00:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1719959, 229791, 27107, '<td valign="top">nice shot, a tad bright to me.</td>', 'nice shot, a tad bright to me.', '2005-09-19 00:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
