(1720282, 230076, 19936, '<td valign="top">Yup  this was intentional.  Figured there would be plenty of nice sharp very colorful images in this challenge so decided to try something different.  Took a perfectly good colorful candid image but failed to get the sweet angelic effect I was going for right (my lowest score ever). Sure learned quite a bit from your comments though.  Thanks to all.</td>', 'Yup  this was intentional.  Figured there would be plenty of nice sharp very colorful images in this challenge so decided to try something different.  Took a perfectly good colorful candid image but failed to get the sweet angelic effect I was going for right (my lowest score ever). Sure learned quite a bit from your comments though.  Thanks to all.', '2005-09-19 03:04:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(1720287, 228910, 18450, '<td valign="top">Woohooooo WTG Soni!! Congrats on the well deserved blue (((hugs))) Beautiful shot!</td>', 'Woohooooo WTG Soni!! Congrats on the well deserved blue (((hugs))) Beautiful shot!', '2005-09-19 03:14:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(1720303, 228978, 38267, '<td valign="top">I knew you would do well in this challenge.  Wonderful job!</td>', 'I knew you would do well in this challenge.  Wonderful job!', '2005-09-19 03:59:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1720306, 228910, 25355, '<td valign="top">Yes, I was right. Congratulations, Soni</td>', 'Yes, I was right. Congratulations, Soni', '2005-09-19 04:00:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(1720309, 228910, 9232, '<td valign="top">Sonja,<br/>   You have a great composition here.  It''s just far enough off-center but not at a thirds line.  It makes nice use of placement to weight the image a little without overbalancing it.  The lightness of the patina balances out the colors of her outfit.  I love how it looks like you have a vignette here, too.  Did you apply a vignette or is that done with lighting at the time of shooting?  Your skin treatment is fantastic as well.  I love the slight softening of the skin that I''m perceiving; its serves to reinforce how the color interacts on her skin.  The makeup stands out on her cheeks and lips and it leads me to feel that she''s prepared to perform on the outside which contrasts with the look and the pose which looks like she wants anything but a performance.  This is a wonderful submission to me since it seems timeless.  It looks like you captured not just a set of blue pixels (which shows you that several of your peers like this) but it looks like you captured an ethos of lonliness or introspection or some other feeling to which many people can relate.  Great job and congrats on that ribbon.<br/> <br/>Kev</td>', 'Sonja,   You have a great composition here.  It''s just far enough off-center but not at a thirds line.  It makes nice use of placement to weight the image a little without overbalancing it.  The lightness of the patina balances out the colors of her outfit.  I love how it looks like you have a vignette here, too.  Did you apply a vignette or is that done with lighting at the time of shooting?  Your skin treatment is fantastic as well.  I love the slight softening of the skin that I''m perceiving; its serves to reinforce how the color interacts on her skin.  The makeup stands out on her cheeks and lips and it leads me to feel that she''s prepared to perform on the outside which contrasts with the look and the pose which looks like she wants anything but a performance.  This is a wonderful submission to me since it seems timeless.  It looks like you captured not just a set of blue pixels (which shows you that several of your peers like this) but it looks like you captured an ethos of lonliness or introspection or some other feeling to which many people can relate.  Great job and congrats on that ribbon. Kev', '2005-09-19 04:05:41.000000', NULL, 0),
