(1720354, 230289, 30364, '<td valign="top">Don''t complain, Elli.  Submit stuff like this &amp; very few people will tolerate it.  Your work is usually balanced on the edge of reason, so it''s not surprising that for many viewers much of it topples over to the ''wrong'' side!  Still my equal favourite.</td>', 'Don''t complain, Elli.  Submit stuff like this & very few people will tolerate it.  Your work is usually balanced on the edge of reason, so it''s not surprising that for many viewers much of it topples over to the ''wrong'' side!  Still my equal favourite.', '2005-09-19 05:36:44.000000', NULL, 0),
