(1720392, 227897, 9765, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Digital Quixote:</b></div><hr/><i> You may disagree with me, and that''s okay, but this doesn''t meet the spirit of the challenge in my opinion. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>And your reason for this is why? Yes, you are right and I don''t agree with you. Portrait can be other then a person and no where did it say it had to be a person.</td>', 'Originally posted by Digital Quixote: You may disagree with me, and that''s okay, but this doesn''t meet the spirit of the challenge in my opinion.   And your reason for this is why? Yes, you are right and I don''t agree with you. Portrait can be other then a person and no where did it say it had to be a person.', '2005-09-19 06:58:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(1720394, 227897, 9765, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Caltrop:</b></div><hr/><i> Beautiful photo but...<br/> <br/>portrait   n. <br/>1.	A likeness of a person, especially one showing the face, that is created by a painter or photographer, for example. <br/>n 1: a painting of a person''s face 2: a word picture of a person''s appearance and character 3: any likeness of a person; "the photographer made excellent portraits" </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You forgot one.<br/> <br/>Portrait - a representation of a person or group or animal on a two-dimensional medium that typically also shows some aspect symbolic of the subject.</td>', 'Originally posted by Caltrop: Beautiful photo but... portrait   n. 1.	A likeness of a person, especially one showing the face, that is created by a painter or photographer, for example. n 1: a painting of a person''s face 2: a word picture of a person''s appearance and character 3: any likeness of a person; "the photographer made excellent portraits"   You forgot one. Portrait - a representation of a person or group or animal on a two-dimensional medium that typically also shows some aspect symbolic of the subject.', '2005-09-19 07:02:07.000000', NULL, 0),
