(1720760, 228910, 714, '<td valign="top">I am pretty lucky to have 2 lovely girls to pose for me..without them I wouldn''t have got this I am sure.  They do get tired of me shooting pictures of them, but they love to see the outcome. She will be please this shot won!  I have a few more in this gallery of her and my other daughter. <a href="//www.pbase.com/sonifo/chandraya" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.pbase.com/sonifo/chandraya</a> <a href="//www.pbase.com/sonifo/lilamae&amp;page=3" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.pbase.com/sonifo/lilamae&amp;page=3</a> <br/> <br/>Thanks to all of you!!!  ((hug))<br/> <br/>Kev, I used a process to lighten the middle and darken the edges slightly to make the young girl stand out.  Didn''t really do much else to the shot. I did crop it and probably wouldn''t have changed a thing even after the comments. I like it just the way it is. I wanted the background to help tell the story.   I do have a shot in the gallery that was messed with, but thought it would do to well.  <br/> <br/>Thanks to that special friend of mine who helped me choose this one. :-)) (hug)<br/> <br/>Thanks for all the wonderful comments!  You all rock!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-09-19 10:51:41.</i></td>', 'I am pretty lucky to have 2 lovely girls to pose for me..without them I wouldn''t have got this I am sure.  They do get tired of me shooting pictures of them, but they love to see the outcome. She will be please this shot won!  I have a few more in this gallery of her and my other daughter. //www.pbase.com/sonifo/chandraya //www.pbase.com/sonifo/lilamae&page=3  Thanks to all of you!!!  ((hug)) Kev, I used a process to lighten the middle and darken the edges slightly to make the young girl stand out.  Didn''t really do much else to the shot. I did crop it and probably wouldn''t have changed a thing even after the comments. I like it just the way it is. I wanted the background to help tell the story.   I do have a shot in the gallery that was messed with, but thought it would do to well.   Thanks to that special friend of mine who helped me choose this one. :-)) (hug) Thanks for all the wonderful comments!  You all rock!', '2005-09-19 11:08:30.000000', '2005-09-19 11:51:41.000000', 0),
