(1721012, 230233, 7291, '<td valign="top">I have to say honestly that I''m not too fond of one''s particular style always getting voted highly but this image is fantastic.  It''s unique, stands out from the rest, is technically flawless, goes against thr grain, etc....  My kind of image!  He looks like Johnny Knoxville gone wrong.  Or worse than he already is.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-09-19 11:37:55.</i></td>', 'I have to say honestly that I''m not too fond of one''s particular style always getting voted highly but this image is fantastic.  It''s unique, stands out from the rest, is technically flawless, goes against thr grain, etc....  My kind of image!  He looks like Johnny Knoxville gone wrong.  Or worse than he already is.', '2005-09-19 12:37:40.000000', '2005-09-19 12:37:55.000000', 0),
(1721017, 228381, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh Brian, this is an incredible color portrait.   I''m amazed that this isn''t in the top 10 or 20!!!!   I''ve been out of the loop since I''ve been on vacation, but I wish I could have voted this one the 10 it deserves!!!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh Brian, this is an incredible color portrait.   I''m amazed that this isn''t in the top 10 or 20!!!!   I''ve been out of the loop since I''ve been on vacation, but I wish I could have voted this one the 10 it deserves!!! ', '2005-09-19 12:39:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(1721019, 230071, 21862, '<td valign="top">grrr...  poor guy.</td>', 'grrr...  poor guy.', '2005-09-19 12:39:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(1721034, 228910, 41337, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by cloverstar:</b></div><hr/><i> Perhaps allow more of her skin texture to be there. Great choice of background; </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yeah I don''t typical care for this either but it definitely gives it a unique look. It does look better on females, IMO. Anyway, like what everyone else has said, it''s a fantastic photo.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-09-19 11:47:27.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by cloverstar: Perhaps allow more of her skin texture to be there. Great choice of background;   Yeah I don''t typical care for this either but it definitely gives it a unique look. It does look better on females, IMO. Anyway, like what everyone else has said, it''s a fantastic photo.', '2005-09-19 12:46:52.000000', '2005-09-19 12:47:27.000000', 0),
(1721038, 230231, 41337, '<td valign="top">I don''t see how you didn''t get a ribbon for this. Maybe next time shoot a beautiful woman instead?</td>', 'I don''t see how you didn''t get a ribbon for this. Maybe next time shoot a beautiful woman instead?', '2005-09-19 12:50:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(1721039, 229725, 24454, '<td valign="top">How Beautiful!   The softness of her skin-- without losing any sharpness is amazing.  Kelly you are SO TALENTED!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!    I''m still catching up from being on vacation for a couple of weeks, so I''ve missed so many challenges, but it sure is great to come back and see what amazing things people have submitted  :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'How Beautiful!   The softness of her skin-- without losing any sharpness is amazing.  Kelly you are SO TALENTED!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!    I''m still catching up from being on vacation for a couple of weeks, so I''ve missed so many challenges, but it sure is great to come back and see what amazing things people have submitted  :) ', '2005-09-19 12:50:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(1721042, 229902, 24454, '<td valign="top">This was sooooo one of my favorites!   I think the score of the commenters is much more deserving of what this picture should have gotten!!!<br/> <br/></td>', 'This was sooooo one of my favorites!   I think the score of the commenters is much more deserving of what this picture should have gotten!!! ', '2005-09-19 12:52:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(1721043, 229727, 13026, '<td valign="top">Good work, Joey!  Not a bad finish at all.<br/>You like shooting behind that Chinese restaurant, don''t you?  :)<br/></td>', 'Good work, Joey!  Not a bad finish at all.You like shooting behind that Chinese restaurant, don''t you?  :)', '2005-09-19 12:53:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(1721053, 229508, 13026, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by art-inept:</b></div><hr/><i> hah christie, very joey-esque. people might dock you for the detail-less hair though. did you use curves? because it''s hard to control certain areas in curves as some highlights will be blown out and some dark spots will lose all detail. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Lol Justin...very Joey?  I wish!  :P  Anyways...nope, it was this automatic, no-control-over-it-at-all brightness and contrast thing in PSP.  So yeah...I noticed the hair, but meh, oh well.<br/>:)</td>', 'Originally posted by art-inept: hah christie, very joey-esque. people might dock you for the detail-less hair though. did you use curves? because it''s hard to control certain areas in curves as some highlights will be blown out and some dark spots will lose all detail.  Lol Justin...very Joey?  I wish!  :P  Anyways...nope, it was this automatic, no-control-over-it-at-all brightness and contrast thing in PSP.  So yeah...I noticed the hair, but meh, oh well.:)', '2005-09-19 13:00:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(1721057, 229401, 24454, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful Peter!!!  This is just stunning!</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful Peter!!!  This is just stunning!', '2005-09-19 13:02:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(1721074, 230310, 37779, '<td valign="top">B E A U T I F U L ! ;-)</td>', 'B E A U T I F U L ! ;-)', '2005-09-19 13:10:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(1721079, 230083, 14773, '<td valign="top">All fabulous shots. My favorite by far.  Great work and I don''t believe for a second that a portrait is only a portrait if there are no other dominant elements. Look at Jack Nicholson, his famous portrait with the magnifying glass. <br/> <br/>This is work I wish I''d done myself. Congrats :-)</td>', 'All fabulous shots. My favorite by far.  Great work and I don''t believe for a second that a portrait is only a portrait if there are no other dominant elements. Look at Jack Nicholson, his famous portrait with the magnifying glass.  This is work I wish I''d done myself. Congrats :-)', '2005-09-19 13:12:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(1721080, 229673, 37779, '<td valign="top">Really liked this one- perfect capture! Love it!</td>', 'Really liked this one- perfect capture! Love it!', '2005-09-19 13:13:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(1721084, 228978, 41337, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Cutter:</b></div><hr/><i> this is not overprocessed, oversharpened or overneatimaged.  It is borderline perfect.  You are really becoming (already are) an amazing photographer.  Wonderful. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Well, it''s certainly a stylized look that some will like very much. I think it''s really a love it or hate it type of thing. Obviously there''s a lot of talent here both from the photography aspect and the post-processing. I however, don''t like the fact that you''ve removed all of the detail from her skin. If you left a hint of it I think this rates even better. As is those without a camera seem to think this was really just a 50ish ranked photo as oppose to what the "experts" thought. Still great regardless.</td>', 'Originally posted by Cutter: this is not overprocessed, oversharpened or overneatimaged.  It is borderline perfect.  You are really becoming (already are) an amazing photographer.  Wonderful.   Well, it''s certainly a stylized look that some will like very much. I think it''s really a love it or hate it type of thing. Obviously there''s a lot of talent here both from the photography aspect and the post-processing. I however, don''t like the fact that you''ve removed all of the detail from her skin. If you left a hint of it I think this rates even better. As is those without a camera seem to think this was really just a 50ish ranked photo as oppose to what the "experts" thought. Still great regardless.', '2005-09-19 13:16:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(1721085, 230233, 37779, '<td valign="top">I love this one! One of my top three to win it- top ten aint too shabby though. :D Rock on.</td>', 'I love this one! One of my top three to win it- top ten aint too shabby though. :D Rock on.', '2005-09-19 13:16:18.000000', NULL, 0),
