(1721173, 228910, 13602, '<td valign="top">I commented this 2 times already, I came back to this image over and over, and it''s amazing I can''t help one more :)). It''s like I don''t even know if you neatimaged it or not, some makeup is there too, but you mastered it so well that despite it''s softness every single little detail is there and not melt like in the overneatimaged miages DPC seems to love so much. <br/>It''s just beautiful, the colors the expression, marvellous, everything, a masterpiece. Add to that your daughter is a little beauty. <br/>I''d add this in my favorites 10 times. I''m so happy when somethin like this wins.<br/> <br/>Cristi.</td>', 'I commented this 2 times already, I came back to this image over and over, and it''s amazing I can''t help one more :)). It''s like I don''t even know if you neatimaged it or not, some makeup is there too, but you mastered it so well that despite it''s softness every single little detail is there and not melt like in the overneatimaged miages DPC seems to love so much. It''s just beautiful, the colors the expression, marvellous, everything, a masterpiece. Add to that your daughter is a little beauty. I''d add this in my favorites 10 times. I''m so happy when somethin like this wins. Cristi.', '2005-09-19 14:18:23.000000', NULL, 0),
