(1721234, 228978, 24925, '<td valign="top">She looks creepy...incredibly unhuman, I love it.  The hair and skin look unreal and her facial features look toyish...this is creepy-cool.</td>', 'She looks creepy...incredibly unhuman, I love it.  The hair and skin look unreal and her facial features look toyish...this is creepy-cool.', '2005-09-19 14:50:58.000000', NULL, 0),
