(1722021, 230116, 41673, '<td valign="top">WHAT! Had you as an 8. I thought the idea of color portrait was to capture that certain something about a person. You did that beautifully. Great job.</td>', 'WHAT! Had you as an 8. I thought the idea of color portrait was to capture that certain something about a person. You did that beautifully. Great job.', '2005-09-19 20:43:33.000000', NULL, 0),
