(1722640, 229810, 28710, '<td valign="top">Yeah! Gotta love white guys writing shufa. I haven''t practiced in a long while either. This guy is GOOD. Nice table too. <br/> <br/>I guess he knows his hand position is off for Chinese style writing. I don''t know what the Japanese influence has been on it though. Proof is in the pudding though.<br/> <br/>I would have liked it even better if he was writing characters that had more direct meaning to your title too.<br/> <br/>Edit: looks like there is no support for chinese characters in posts...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-09-19 22:14:04.</i></td>', 'Yeah! Gotta love white guys writing shufa. I haven''t practiced in a long while either. This guy is GOOD. Nice table too.  I guess he knows his hand position is off for Chinese style writing. I don''t know what the Japanese influence has been on it though. Proof is in the pudding though. I would have liked it even better if he was writing characters that had more direct meaning to your title too. Edit: looks like there is no support for chinese characters in posts...', '2005-09-19 23:11:13.000000', '2005-09-19 23:14:04.000000', 0),
