(1724026, 230111, 44320, '<td valign="top">A very good pic. Just one tip:-<br/> <br/>Provide enough ambient lighting so that the pupil closes. This does 2 things:-<br/> <br/>1) Makes the picture look more natural.<br/>2) Brings out the wonderful colour of the eyes.<br/> <br/>Great pic though, and keep up the good work!<br/> <br/>Regards,<br/>Danny</td>', 'A very good pic. Just one tip:- Provide enough ambient lighting so that the pupil closes. This does 2 things:- 1) Makes the picture look more natural.2) Brings out the wonderful colour of the eyes. Great pic though, and keep up the good work! Regards,Danny', '2005-09-20 13:11:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(1724185, 228910, 5313, '<td valign="top"><br/><b>Ohhhh, Congratulations once again, Soni on a superb image!</b> <br/> <br/>Wow, she''s growing up so quickly.  This is a wonderful portrait.  I''d love to see this on my wall!  ;)<br/> <br/>Luvya<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-09-20 13:37:03.</i></td>', 'Ohhhh, Congratulations once again, Soni on a superb image!  Wow, she''s growing up so quickly.  This is a wonderful portrait.  I''d love to see this on my wall!  ;) Luvya', '2005-09-20 14:36:19.000000', '2005-09-20 14:37:03.000000', 0),
(1724312, 229332, 41763, '<td valign="top">The line created from the left shoulder to the flower in her hair was a little distracting. The flower is so light that I mis-took it for an ear - only for a sec of course. I think changing the angle to remove the shoulder and maybe a brighter flower would make quite a difference. That being said I still like the picture and the upward angle of her glance.</td>', 'The line created from the left shoulder to the flower in her hair was a little distracting. The flower is so light that I mis-took it for an ear - only for a sec of course. I think changing the angle to remove the shoulder and maybe a brighter flower would make quite a difference. That being said I still like the picture and the upward angle of her glance.', '2005-09-20 15:23:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(1724482, 229906, 31637, '<td valign="top">I knew you would ribbon...My only question is why were you third instead of first? your model is becoming really famous here on this site, you have the best looking one thats for sure...the sharpness is great here...nothing much I can say that your picture can''t say. congrats.</td>', 'I knew you would ribbon...My only question is why were you third instead of first? your model is becoming really famous here on this site, you have the best looking one thats for sure...the sharpness is great here...nothing much I can say that your picture can''t say. congrats.', '2005-09-20 16:43:26.000000', NULL, 0),
