(1725641, 230172, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot.  I love the soft glow lighting on her face and hair and the light of the eyes.  The expression goes perfectly with the pose.  I do see the white speck others have mentioned, but other than that I would aspire to take a portrait as perfect as this one.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot.  I love the soft glow lighting on her face and hair and the light of the eyes.  The expression goes perfectly with the pose.  I do see the white speck others have mentioned, but other than that I would aspire to take a portrait as perfect as this one.', '2005-09-20 23:51:52.000000', NULL, 0),
