(1735812, 229401, 23203, '<td valign="top"><b>Greetings from the critique club</b> <br/> <br/><b>Composition</b> <br/>Composition is good. The desaturated background is non intrusive. I like the traditional costume, and the colors make it stand out.<br/> <br/><b>Processing</b> <br/>Some detail in the eyes appears to have been lost. I would have loved to see more sharpness and perhaps some catchlights there.<br/> <br/>Overall, I like this photograph. Congratulations on a top-50 finish, and good luck in future challenges.</td>', 'Greetings from the critique club  Composition Composition is good. The desaturated background is non intrusive. I like the traditional costume, and the colors make it stand out. Processing Some detail in the eyes appears to have been lost. I would have loved to see more sharpness and perhaps some catchlights there. Overall, I like this photograph. Congratulations on a top-50 finish, and good luck in future challenges.', '2005-09-24 15:34:12.000000', NULL, 0),
