(1738335, 229508, 25397, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by christie3:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by art-inept:</b></div><hr/><i> hah christie, very joey-esque. people might dock you for the detail-less hair though. did you use curves? because it''s hard to control certain areas in curves as some highlights will be blown out and some dark spots will lose all detail. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Lol Justin...very Joey?  I wish!  :P<br/>:) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Needs more dirt. :-D</td>', 'Originally posted by christie3: Originally posted by art-inept: hah christie, very joey-esque. people might dock you for the detail-less hair though. did you use curves? because it''s hard to control certain areas in curves as some highlights will be blown out and some dark spots will lose all detail.  Lol Justin...very Joey?  I wish!  :P:)  Needs more dirt. :-D', '2005-09-26 00:49:05.000000', NULL, 0),
