(1742547, 228376, 33481, '<td valign="top">oh, I forgot to ask, incase anyone else decides to read this.  I have a question about the softness.  Someone mentioned it''s too soft for them.  I think it''s the lense I have, it has a very soft focus.  How can I fix this in Photoshop, or can I?  Do I just need to save up(way up) for a new lense with sharper focus?</td>', 'oh, I forgot to ask, incase anyone else decides to read this.  I have a question about the softness.  Someone mentioned it''s too soft for them.  I think it''s the lense I have, it has a very soft focus.  How can I fix this in Photoshop, or can I?  Do I just need to save up(way up) for a new lense with sharper focus?', '2005-09-27 16:15:25.000000', NULL, 0),
