(2074805, 229378, 38464, '<td valign="top">I was out of town when voting took place for this challenge, I wish I had been here though.<br/> <br/>This is a beautiful photo and for me the border brings the focus inwards, which leads to her wonderful expression. That and I don''t think of it as a border really, more like matting for the photo. ;)</td>', 'I was out of town when voting took place for this challenge, I wish I had been here though. This is a beautiful photo and for me the border brings the focus inwards, which leads to her wonderful expression. That and I don''t think of it as a border really, more like matting for the photo. ;)', '2006-01-23 15:38:36.000000', NULL, 0),
