(2199857, 229867, 39144, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot you''ve captured here. The lighting is wonderful. How did you set this shot up, as far as lights used, and also the background. I''m drawn in to the area around her feet because there is a reflection. I''m curious what you used for a background that would do that.</td>', 'This is a great shot you''ve captured here. The lighting is wonderful. How did you set this shot up, as far as lights used, and also the background. I''m drawn in to the area around her feet because there is a reflection. I''m curious what you used for a background that would do that.', '2006-03-04 11:50:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(2226663, 230086, 28299, '<td valign="top">I like it and the soft effect! This won''t mean a thing to you probably, but this photo looks a lot like David Letterman (tv personality in the US)!</td>', 'I like it and the soft effect! This won''t mean a thing to you probably, but this photo looks a lot like David Letterman (tv personality in the US)!', '2006-03-14 08:01:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2240270, 229578, 13077, '<td valign="top">This is really a great photo. Love the texture of the wall or whatever it is on the side, and the framing of her face with the grass on the other side. And of course her expression is really good.</td>', 'This is really a great photo. Love the texture of the wall or whatever it is on the side, and the framing of her face with the grass on the other side. And of course her expression is really good.', '2006-03-19 23:33:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(2261624, 229724, 23394, '<td valign="top">awesome capture.  just love the way his eyes are lit up.</td>', 'awesome capture.  just love the way his eyes are lit up.', '2006-03-27 00:48:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2273875, 229865, 25728, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo, especially in that while your face hasn''t changed much in the year between the photos - the knowledge and wisdom has. Its a nice contemplation on how much we can grow in a short time. :)<br/></td>', 'I really like this photo, especially in that while your face hasn''t changed much in the year between the photos - the knowledge and wisdom has. Its a nice contemplation on how much we can grow in a short time. :)', '2006-03-30 16:32:43.000000', NULL, 0),
