(3519945, 228910, 74979, '<td valign="top">GLOOMY???  contemplative, maybe...but look at the joy in those beautiful colors! (um, why was she looking so distant anyway-way too young to be SOOO serious!)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-04-04 17:49:10.</i></td>', 'GLOOMY???  contemplative, maybe...but look at the joy in those beautiful colors! (um, why was she looking so distant anyway-way too young to be SOOO serious!)', '2007-04-04 18:48:31.000000', '2007-04-04 18:49:10.000000', 0),
(3524175, 228910, 714, '<td valign="top">Not sure if anyone knows what the world of dance is like for these young dancers.  It is worse than any public school out there.  Girls can be so mean to others and as a dancer trying to move up in different levels is challenge not only physically but mentally as well.  This little one is an amazing dancer and performer.  Taking this picture was easy because she was her amazing self, modeling in front of the camera as usual.  Not all pictures need to be of a child smiling or running around playing.  I take those all to often..it is these shots that bring pictures to life....for me that is....</td>', 'Not sure if anyone knows what the world of dance is like for these young dancers.  It is worse than any public school out there.  Girls can be so mean to others and as a dancer trying to move up in different levels is challenge not only physically but mentally as well.  This little one is an amazing dancer and performer.  Taking this picture was easy because she was her amazing self, modeling in front of the camera as usual.  Not all pictures need to be of a child smiling or running around playing.  I take those all to often..it is these shots that bring pictures to life....for me that is....', '2007-04-06 01:36:40.000000', NULL, 0),
